<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Jeremia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jeremia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeremia</para>
  <para style="mt1">Jeremia</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Jeremia chekhai, now arui khin dow 627-586 BC takra kowi chekhai. Risi Jeremia dow Juda pren kowi kowh maru-uüa tut-e Thurai satang phowng mih chekhai. Nami khin khe Juda pren kowi chowm mang mih dow Josia chekhai. Risi Jeremia kowh laiklow che sak kowi a-i towah khai, now aia kar mih uan ün a-i tuk pe khai hanow aia tek mih laiklow a-i natukta kown. Pur prakowi kowh nauang ting kown mih laiklow Jeremia tek mih khin khe sum pren maru tasen thüm chekhai. Naiawngün dow Asuria pren, Aigupta pren hai Babulawn pren chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Thurai mih Jeremia kowi pre chap laiklow uang tek pe khai. Lowk dow Aigupta hown kowh taking tasangra laikham luk kowi Judauüa naowmsak dowi kown mih chekhai, now lowk dow Judauüa ngak rakowi Babulawnuüa mih amatni kowi khümla hanow 70 ning mowr pe changah nar lup kown mih chekhai. Maru changah anowng apowng chepaw Jeremia dow kaah sakowmma hown Thurai pe tekah mih satang maru tut-e krawi phuang khai. Sak kowi raura hown kowh aia tekah mih piakra hai takhangra laiklow dow uang tachi mih aia khila khai. Judauüa kowi Babulawn pren kowi pawla mih khin khe pren kowi nata uowi kownkow ka ana mih pungmadawng kowi dow Jeremia paw na chekhai. Aia dow pren kowi kowh ta uowi miuüa kowi Aigupta pren kowi naplan dowi kownkow tek pe khowk chowdiah. Tawkche amatni dow aia kowh laiklow chün dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni hown aia kowi paw nakowi pawla khai. Now aia dow Aigupta pren kowi kowkowng khai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Amen: Amen pami dow Hebrai lai chekhai. Nami auan dow “Pana lah,” pami chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Thurai chup kim: Thurai chup kim pami dow Thurai hown kowh taklowp taklangra kim chekhai. Judauüa chowng khe dow Jerusalem kowi kowh Thurai chup kim kowi nauang chang tawncher phuchua kownkow hai achap akawm pawi nauang chang kownkow paning kowi sum kat chi maru uang takua talawm reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Buala: Buala pami dow sumu salama mih maru kowi kowh tek pe mih chekhai. Bualama mih maru kowi dow plan plan tek pe chepaw tek pe iawng tuk chang lup dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Kurdik: Kurdik pami kowi auan uowi pre chaing. Lowk dow uanh dik kur mih kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai, now lowk dow ka arah mih kowi kowh tekah mih paw na chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Jeremia ka kurdik mih 1:1-19</para>
  <para style="io1">Josia, Jehoiakim, Jehoiakhin hai Zedekia chowng khe kowh pur pra laiklow 2:1-25:38</para>
  <para style="io1">Jeremia chownglawng lawnguan 46:1-51:64</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem piak mih 52:1-34</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1" />Maiawngün dow Hilkia kowh chapa Jeremia kowh laiklow chekhai. Jeremia dow Anathawt marow kowi uamowuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lowk ia mih chekhai. Anathawt marow uowi mih dow Benjamin krungchak süng kowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2" />Juda pren kowi Josia chowm mang mih laisum ning khe CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow Jeremia tut-e uang uown ting khai. Josia dow Amawn chapa chekhai. <verse eid="JER 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3" />Nami hownia Juda pren kowi Josia kowh chapa Jehoiakim chowm mang mih khin khe paw CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow Jeremia tut-e uang ting reng tak chekhai. Naiawng hown Juda pren mang Josia kowh alowk mih chapa Zedekia chowm mang mih lailowk ning nga kowi kowh tanga la mowr aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG klangah khai. Nami tanga la mih khin khe dow Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowi Babulawnuüa khümla hanow Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai.<verse eid="JER 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG hawah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4" />CHAKRAMANG laiklow dow ang tut-e uang ting khai. CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih,<verse eid="JER 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5" />“En kowi dow en u mu lak kowi ang thawp en dowi rawn hownia ang tuk en chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">en kowi dow en uang dia dowi hownia ang lang klota en khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">now en chenchapuüa tut-e risi nachowng kownkow ang khowmta en khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi ang tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang dow klangiungma tuk tek lai dowi; ang dow ngeuüa lai tak chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7" />Tawkche CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:7">“‘Ang ngeuüa lai tak,’ pami laiklow hang tek diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:7">ang chin en mih maru-uüa tut-e en nakowkowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:7">now ang pe tek en mih laiklow chowtaih nakowi en nakowtek kown.<verse eid="JER 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8" />Amatni kowi dow hangkow kram diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:8">en tut-e atungma ang natawi uowila en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:8">now ang natawi towkala en reng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG dow iu iaw rut hanow kak ang nawr khai. Now tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 1:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:9">“Kawmat dow ang kowh laiklow mih en nawr kowi ang towta en khowk.<verse eid="JER 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10" />Ani hownia chenchapuüa hai prenchakuüa kowi nakingküa kownkow ang tow en khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:10">amatni kowi dow singh chawi iawng en nachawiah ne kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:10">now amatni kowi dow en napiakta ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:10">Tawkche akeng miuüa kowi dow en naplan thawpah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:10">now singh chowk iawng en nachowkah ngengche iawk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Jeremia, tawng chow en khi?” pakhai. Aia kowi ang klangah mih, “Ang khi madam singh mia lowk,” pape khai. <verse eid="JER 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “En khi mih na chow, tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh laiklow iawng naia phawla kownkow nami prakowi ang dow pe ching reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG plan lünta ang mih, “Tawng chow en khi?” pakhai. Ang tek pe mih, “Ang khi puh lowk. Nami puh dow tawngphak hownia mrawkphak prakowi tange hüah chekhai, now alak kowi dow tui klawk butlut chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="JER 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Mami pren kowi kowh uowi miuüa luk kowi dow tawngphak hownia tui lawt iawng phih nauang ting kown. <verse eid="JER 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15" />Ang dow tawngphak pra kowh pren maten kowi kowh uowi mih chenchapuüa kowi Jerusalem marow kowi nauang kownkow ang hawah khai. Naiawngün pren manguüa dow Jerusalem tapplawt re-e uang hanow aiamat kowh mang nanra nauang thawp kown. Amatni dow Jerusalem tap hai Juda pren kowi kowh marow maten paw nakrawi rumta bowk kown. <verse eid="JER 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16" />Naiawng hown amatni kowi dow ang nachet pe tara hanow naripah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang maru-uüa dow nuata ang khai, now akeng thurai vüi nam iungma mih maikhük cham towk büah khai. Amatni rut hown kowh thawpah mih uanh kowi ün amatni dow cham chupiia khai.<verse eid="JER 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17" />“Jeremia, en mih awr rü hanow kamrütma uowi diah. Now ang pe tek en mih laiklow amatni kowi kowtek pe diah. Amatni kowi mapaw hangkow kram diah. En che kram khai hanow amatni pur kowi krampuma ang nachang en kown. <verse eid="JER 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18" />Ani dow akhawtma mih marow iawng, lawngha chüng iawng hai kri tap iawng ang changta en khowk. Naiawng ang chang en mih dow Juda pren manguüa, maru iukuüa, uamowuüa hai pren kowi kowh maru maten luk kowi naia tek laiklow kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="JER 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19" />Amatni dow nauang kingküa en kown. Tawkche naia sum en büah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow natawi towkala en kownkow en tut-e ang tawi uowi reng chekhai. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 1:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2" />
  <para style="s">Israel kowi Thurai kingküaah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JER 2:1-2" />CHAKRAMANG dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh maru-uüa tut-e mami laiklow nakowtek kownkow kowchin ang khai. Aia tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:1-2">“Enni klanguüa khe kaah sakowmma enni uowi mih dow ang sak kowi uowi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:1-2">Nami khin khe dow amasi sar kowi ahua sakrauah iawng enni sakrau ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:1-2">Tawng luprak paw phaw dowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang tek iawng enni mang khai.<verse eid="JER 2:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3" />Israeluüa dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh lang kloah mih chenchap chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">amatni dow aia rik kaah mih chauüa chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowi pe ngarau miuüa maten dow ka aprek reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">now amatni luk kowi dow phih uang kla reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4" />Aw Jakawb krungchak, Israel krungchak maten, enni mih CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta büa diah. <verse eid="JER 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">“Tawng atawi chow ang changta khai kowh ang hownia enni pipu-uüa tuk powt khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">Amatni dow asung uowi dowi mih arup aren kowi cham chupiia khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">now asung uowi dowi mih iawng phaw büah khai.<verse eid="JER 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6" />‘Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang lawtla anging mih CHAKRAMANG tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">Aia dow tui uowi dowi mih süng iawng, akang khawngma mih süng iawng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">aiiuma mih süng iawng, katpaw maru mangah dowi iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">maru uowiah dowi mih süngrüp süngkangma iawng uang pawla anging khai,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">pami amatni dow katpaw tek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7" />Enni kowi dow krawngsi uowi mih pren kowi ang uang pawla enni khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">nakowi ang uang pawla enni mih dow uih-ak enni paka chala pakowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">now aiung aiungma mih chakkham enni paka chala pakowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">Tawkche enni dow uang hanow nami ang kowh pren mih enni uang sürlawkta nak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">now nami pren dow suiiai kaniaima mih uanh iawng enni changah khai.<verse eid="JER 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8" />‘CHAKRAMANG tawng kowi chow?’ pami uamowuüa dow katpaw tek dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Ari aiang tuk miuüa dow tuk mat ang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">aluchowuüa dow kingküa ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Risiuüa dow asung uowi dowi mih Baal thurai ming hown tek lai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">now asung uowi dowi mih arup aren kowi tawi chupiia büah khai.<verse eid="JER 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9" />Naiawng rakowi enni kowi dow ang natüng enni aprek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:9">now enni kowh krungchakuüa kowi paw ang natüng pe aprek kown.<verse eid="JER 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10" />Satkup pra kowh Saipras süngdum sata paipra pown kowi kowh pren ün kowi kowmü diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:10">now satlawt pra kowh Kedar süng paw kowchin pe maru hanow klangiungma kowpe müah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:10">Nakowi dow naiawng mih angak katpaw chang dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11" />Akeng chenchapuüa dow amatni owmah mih thurai kowi leah lütlüt dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">nami thurai aching nadowi chepaw nuaah büah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">Tawkche ang maru-uüa dow Thurai kowi arup aren hown leah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">now asung uowi dowi mih thuraiuüa kowi tawi chupiia büah khai.<verse eid="JER 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12" />Naiawng rakowi aw mukuang, takrow diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:12">now kram hown chür diah.<verse eid="JER 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang maru-uüa dow changta lup ngak pre chap chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">amatni dow ang masing tuikuam kowi nuata ang büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">Nami takcha amatni matia vüi thawp tuikuam khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">tawkche nami tuikuam dow avitma rakowi tui tanung dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa ka angak sung mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Israel mih nar chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:14">Uang dia hownia aia mih nar chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:14">Nadowi kowh chalow now tawngplawng kowchow aia kowi ransu-uüa tuk krawiah khai?<verse eid="JER 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15" />Israeluüa kowh ransu-uüa dow krangsila iawng tüng klow reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">now amatni kowi khi hanow ransu-uüa dow chang ran sulu reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Amatni kowh pren dow ransu-uüa piakta pe nak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">now amatni kowh marow ün paw towkta pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Naiawng rakowi nakowi dow amiapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JER 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16" />Aigupta pren kowi kowh Memfis marowchakuüa dow khaita enni lu khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:16">now Tapanhes marowchakuüa paw pe enni rukrai kownkow khaita enni lu khai.<verse eid="JER 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17" />Naiawng enni piak mih dow enni kowh angak rakowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow tiama nowm kowi aia pawla enni mih khin khe aia kowi dow enni nuata khai.<verse eid="JER 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18" />Nail aw tui kowkham kown mih iawng Aigupta pren kowi enni kowkowi mih tawng chow mrawk?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:18">Iufratis aw tui kowkham kown mih iawng Asuria pren kowi enni kowkowi mih tawng chow mrawk?<verse eid="JER 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19" />Enni kowh angak dow nauang pawla enni ripra kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">enni mangah mih tiama ngak dow nape enni aprek kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi enni nuata mih khin khe mün khowt chow nanga kown mih sam tuak madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">now aia kowi enni kram dowi mih khin khe mün khowt chow nanga kown mih sam tuak madiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Ang lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai kowh kiowrira Israeluüa nuata mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Israel, en dow alai hownia ang tek iawng en chün dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">nami khin khe en tek mih, ‘En kowh lup ang nachang kown nadowi bowt,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">En dow chawkkrawma iawng alowngma mih hungh towng cham krawi chupiia arup aren khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">now aram chakma mih singh tut towng kowi paw en cham krawi chupiia arup aren khai.<verse eid="JER 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21" />En kowi dow lang ruiah mih aliu hownia kowh awr ru mih aiungma mih grep pawi iawng ang chowk en mih chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:21">nami kowi tawng iawng chow angakma mih grep iua ruih iawng en tuk chowng khai?<verse eid="JER 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22" />Alawi takhuala mih chap hown en tasau chepaw en kowh angak dow ang pur kowi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">now dua hown plan plan en tasau chepaw en kowh angak dow ang pur kowi uowi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:22">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23" />En tek mih, ‘Ang dow sürlawkma nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">now Baal thurai kowi paw ang cham tawi chupiia dowi chekhai,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Tawkche Hinawm hungh kowi kowh en changah mih angak mü diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">nakowi kowh en changah mih suiiai kaniaima mih lup sam tuak madiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">En dow utla hown tapaw hau kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">mapra paipra krawi iowm haplap mih utma iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24" />En dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh uowi mih kaurawng kawrngaramchükma iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">en dow krawi paw hau kownkow krawi hüp anam mih kawrngaramchükma iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Kawrngaramchükma kowi dow aia nau hau pawk mih khin khe amiapaw nowng hangah dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">aia kowi kowh krawi cham mih kawrngaramchük ala hawmh dow nakawm kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Tawngplawng kowchow panow hau pawk khin khe amatni dow aia kowi aiachow nakrum kown.<verse eid="JER 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25" />Aw Israel, arup aren kung kowi hang cham tawi krawi tham bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">Naiawngün arup aren vüi kowi kowh en kowh sakkraira taingta bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">Tawkche en tek mih, ‘Ang ia plan dowi tham;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">naiawngün thuraiuüa kowi ang sakrau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">now amatni kowi ang natawi chupiia kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kala ripra kown mih angak chang mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26" />“Ka khümta kuk mih khe kowh kuk mih rukrai iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">Israel krungchakuüa paw ka rukrai khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:26">Now amatni, amatni kowh manguüa, maru iukuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">uamowuüa hai risiuüa maten paw tawi ka rukrai khai.<verse eid="JER 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27" />Amatni dow singh kowi tek pe mih, ‘En dow apa chekhai,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">Now hua kowi tek pe mih, ‘En dow au chekhai,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Amatni dow ang prakowi uang plan dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">uang plan lak dow kung prakowi plan büah ngamlam chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Tawkche amatni kla phih mih khin khe tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">‘Awr rü hanow uang lawng anging bowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28" />Aw Juda, en vüi kowi kowh en thawpah mih thuraiuüa tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">En kla phih mih khin khe amatni che nowng lawng en hanow pacham uang lawng en lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh dow marow uowi mowr thuraiuüa paw uowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29" />Amatni kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:29">“Tawngplawng kowchow enni tuk pe ang angak khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:29">Changta atawi ama mih dow enni chowtaih chekhai.<verse eid="JER 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30" />Enni kowh chauüa kowi ang ripah khowk chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">Tawkche tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:30">Enni kowh risiuüa kowi dow saidawng hown enni saiah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">amatni kowi dow chak sakkrai mih krangsila iawng enni makah khai.<verse eid="JER 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31" />“Ang kowh maru-uüa low, ang laiklow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">Israeluüa tut-e süngrüp süngkangma iawng ang chowng khai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">Ang mih pren iiu iawng angakma chekhai bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Ang maru-uüa tek mih, ‘Thurai hownia anging ka lawtra khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">anging lakke Thurai dowi bowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32" />Tawng iawng mih masiuüa paw tama üta ngawng awr mih uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:32">now cham mang kown mih masiuüa paw tama khupla tawnguat dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">Tawkche ang kowh maru-uüa dow tamata ang mih akrama khowk.<verse eid="JER 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33" />“Aw Juda, en dow masiuüa lek kiakma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:33">en kowi khi hanow angakma mih masiuüa paw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:33">naiawng nachang kown mih natuk kown.<verse eid="JER 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="JER 2:34-35" />Ngaraima miuüa hai angak uowi dowi miuüa kowh vi dow en tawnguat kowi ang khi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34-35">amatni dow tawng iawng mih ngak paw chang en dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:34-35">Nami kung kowi paw en tek mih, ‘Ang dow achinawmma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34-35">Thurai dow ang luk kowi kunmarau ang dowi bowt chekhai,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:34-35">Tawkche en kowi dow ang nachet en tara hanow ang narip en kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34-35">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en tek mih, ‘Ang chang ngak dowi,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 2:34-35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36" />En dow mapra lai paipra lai cham krawi lü khowng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:36">Nachenganchepaw Asuriauüa tut-e enni kowh tuak chur mih iawng Aiguptauüa tut-e paw enni kowh tuak chur kown.<verse eid="JER 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37" />Aiguptauüa hownia dow kala khowng dowi kowi tawmpa rukrai mumla tulu se en nauang plan kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:37">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en neplawng nesak mih maru-uüa kowi dow ang CHAKRAMANG nuata khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:37">Amatni dow tawngpaw tawi nowng khowng en kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3" />
  <para style="s">Kaah sakowm dowi iawng Israeluüa uowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Israel mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">“Ahua khuata mih masiuüa akeng mih kachakuüa tut-e che cham mang khai bowt hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">ahua prim mih krawi nowng paw kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Aia che krawi plan paw khai hanow pren mih natasür talawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Nachenganchepaw chawkkrawma kowh klanguüa akawmma mih iawng en kowh dow akeng thuraiuüa akawmma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">naiawng mih hownia kawmat tawng iawng chow ang tut-e en nauang plan kown?<verse eid="JER 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2" />Singh kau uowi dowi mih hungh prakowi awr tang mü diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">Naiawngün hungh kowi dow akeng thuraiuüa hown en cham chang iang dowi mih arah uowi dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">now naiawngün thuraiuüa kowi dow tiama ria kowi en hawt chawngah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Amatni kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh Arab maru-uüa iawng en hawt mitah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">En kowh iang changra hai lup ngak changra hown pren mih en sürlawkah khai.<verse eid="JER 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3" />Naiawng rakowi ang pe en uang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">now siadawng uang paw ang pe uangah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:3">Nachenganchepaw en dow iang chang mih maru iawng en uowi reng tak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">en dow mapaw rukrai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4" />En tek ang mih ‘En dow ang kowh pa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:4">en dow ang sowmchow hownia sakrau ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5" />Atungma bow en nakunmarau kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:5">En kowh kunmaraura sak kowi en natowta hüah kown bow?’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:5">Naiawng en tek chepaw en dow ia chang mowr chang angak khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel hai Juda iüah dow kaah sakowm dowi mih masiuüa iawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6" />Juda pren kowi Josia chowm mang mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG uang tek ang mih, “Ang kaah sakowm dowi iawng Israel uowi mih en khi tak bow? Amatni dow alowngma mih hungh luk kowi hai aram chakma mih singh tut kowi iang chang mih masiuüa iawng cham krawi chupiia akeng thuraiuüa khai. <verse eid="JER 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7" />Naiawngün lup ngak chang kung kowi Israel dow ang tut-e nauang plan bowt kown padow ang ka tuak khai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow uang plan dowi chekhai. Naiawng aia chang mih dow kaah sakowm dowi mih anaumow Juda paw tawi khi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8" />Kaah sakowm dowi mih Israel chang iang rakowi ang nuata mih dow anaumow Juda tawi khi chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw Juda dow kram dowi chekhai. Aia dow ataimow Israel iawng nuata ang hanow iang chang mih masiuüa iawng arup aren kowi cham tawi chupiia khai. <verse eid="JER 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9" />Naiawng mih lup ngak chang chepaw aia dow klowkah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow hua hai singh hown kowh thawpah mih thurai rup kowi chupiia hanow pren mih sürlawkah khai. <verse eid="JER 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10" />Naiawng phaw chepaw Israel kowh kaah sakowm dowi mih tuamow Juda dow sak maiow hown ang tut-e uang plan dowi chekhai. Aia uang plan mih dow uang tüng aiow krowngchow mih chekhai. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel vüi sakowmra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Jeremia mih, “Ang hownia Israel powt chepaw aia dow kaah sakowm dowi mih Juda lak-e iung chekhai. <verse eid="JER 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12" />Naiawng rakowi tawngphak pra kowh Israel tut-e maiawngün satang kowphuang diah,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 3:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">“‘Aw angak prakowi kowh mang mih Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">ang tut-e uang plan bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">En luk kowi chowngchowng saksakma ang nakunmarau kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh dow saksing sanara atekma chekhai.<verse eid="JER 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13" />Tawkche en changah mih maiawngün angak uang taphuang diah:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai kowi en kingküa khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">aram achakma mih singh tut kowi en cham chupiia akeng thurai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">now ang kowh laiklow paw en chün dowi chekhai,’ pape diah.<verse eid="JER 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14" />Angak prakowi kowh mang mih chauüa low, uang plan bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:14">Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow ang kowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:14">Enni kowi dow marow towng hownia lowk ia chi ang naklo enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:14">now krungchak towng hownia pre ia chi ang naklo enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:14">Nahanow Zaiawn hungh kowi ang nauang pawla enni kown.<verse eid="JER 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15" />Nami kung kowi dow ang laiklow chün mih kruitown miuüa kowi ang natow enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:15">now amatni dow chanlaira hai prengia hown nakruitown enni kown.<verse eid="JER 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16" />“Nami khin khe enni dow pren kowi maru iun akawmma nauang phaw kown, now maru kawmuüa dow ang kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla lawnguan kowi amiapaw natek kown nadowi bowt. Amatni dow nami lawnguan kowi sak kowi naka tuak kown nadowi bowt, now nami prakowi nape ching büah kown nadowi bowt. Nami dow lakke dowi bowt rakowi thawp paw nathawp büah iawk kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17" />Nami khin khe Jerusalem lawnguan kowi maru natek kown mih, ‘Jerusalem dow CHAKRAMANG kowh mang chowm rah chekhai,’ napa kown. CHAKRAMANG kowi nachupiiaah kownkow chenchap maten dow Jerusalem kowi nauang takua talawm kown. Nami hownia dow angak saktuak hown saktuak khawtma nauowi kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18" />Nami khin khe Juda maru-uüa dow Israel maru-uüa hown natawi tabawng kown. Now amatni pipu-uüa kowi kowh ang peah mih pren kowi dow ahawmsang tawngphak prakowi kowh pren hownia nauang büah kown.<verse eid="JER 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19" />“Sakdawng kowi ang sakowm mih, ‘Ang chapa iawng ang nasakrau enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">now akeng mih chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang klangiung mih pren ang nape powng enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">Apa, pahai enni nahaw ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">now ang hownia katpaw enni nacham powt kown nadowi bowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20" />Nachenganchepaw aw Israeluüa, enni dow hua kaah sakowm dowi mih masi iawng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:20">ang kaah sakowm iawng enni uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:20">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21" />Singh uowi dowi mih hungh luk kowi dow Israeluüa kowh kar klow nguk klow ta khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow tiama tawi kowi cham mang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">now CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai kowi dow tamata büah khai.<verse eid="JER 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Tiama ngak kowi mang miuüa low, ang tut-e uang plan büah bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">tiama ngak kowi enni cham mang rengreng mih rawka dow ang naiungta enni kown,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:22">Nami khin khe Israeluüa natek kown mih, “Ow, anging dow en tut-e nauang plan kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai dow en chowtaih.<verse eid="JER 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23" />Hungma mawngma kowi kowh anging cham chupiia mih arup aren dow asung uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">Israeluüa kowh lawngra dow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai tut-e chowtaih uowi.<verse eid="JER 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24" />“Tawkche anging pipu-uüa kawrah mih chia hawmh, ruapur hawmh hai amatni kowh chauüa dow mami rukraira uowima mih arup aren kowi anging cham phuchuala rakowi anging mata bowk khowk. <verse eid="JER 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25" />Naiawng rakowi chu, rukrai rakowi a-i uowi diah sik, now rukrai dow pacham khuta a-i hüah lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow asowmchow hownia kawmat mowr pat CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai kowi kingküala mih angak a-i chang khai, now a-i kowh pipu-uüa paw aia kowi kingküala mih ngak chang khai. A-i dow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai laiklow chün dowi chekhai,” napa kown.<verse eid="JER 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Israel mih, “Aw Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">en che uang plan kown nau hanow ang tut-e uang plan diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:1">En che ang pur hownia suiiai kaniaima mih arup aren henta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">en che angakma mih tiama kowi tawi mang dowi hanow<verse eid="JER 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2" />ang ming hown en naia kham sawi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">akeng chenchapuüa vüi enni nachowng prasira kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">now chenchap maten nauangah hanow nakiow ang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3" />Judauüa hai Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:3">“Enni lupah dowi mih krawng bawn kowi lupah büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:3">chu mung kowi hang sawt aliu büa diah.<verse eid="JER 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4" />Aw Judauüa hai Jerusalem maru-uüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">ang vüi kowi hiah khampha uanpik hanow enni kowh saktuak chimsaiah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:4">Nadowi now ang kowh kunmaraura mih maih iawng nalün pluplup kown chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">nami dow amiapaw naia mit kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawngphak hownia piakra uang ting mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi maiawng krawi phuang büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">‘Paprenma kowi tum baw büah,’ pape diah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">Now, ‘Asak naplaila kownkow powt diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">Chu, tap tapat lut mih marow kowi ün a-i kowkowi diah sik,’ pahai atünma tek büa diah.<verse eid="JER 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6" />Zaiawn hungh kowi kowkowila mih tiama natüngah kownkow ruang tamkhuown diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">athaulangma nauowi kownkow nakowi alenma kowpowt büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawngphak hownia ang uang pawla enni phih thüm khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">nami phih hownia dow kramra uowima mih piakra ang uang pawla enni thüm khowk.<verse eid="JER 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7" />Khawng lak hownia kowh krangsi uang lawt mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">chenchap piak mih maru dow aia uowi rah hownia uang lawt khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Aia dow enni kowh pren nauang piak kownkow uang tarü khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">enni kowh marow kowi dow amiapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">enni kowh marow ün dow apiaknama nauowi bowt kown.<verse eid="JER 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8" />Naiawng rakowi khup sala uanh hanow kar büah nguk büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura dow a-i hownia powt dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Nami khin khe mang hai maru iukuüa kowh dow sakkraingra natama kown, now uamowuüa hai risiuüa paw amawlawma naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10" />Nakhowk khe ang tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai, Juda hai Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi en kuanah khai. En tek pe mih, ‘Enni nathaulang kown,’ pakhai. Tawkche kawmat dow amatni ngawng kowi saidawng tatang hüah chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11" />Nami khin khe amatni kowi CHAKRAMANG natek pe kown mih, “Singh kau uowi dowi mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh hungh hownia ang maru-uüa prakowi krawi kamla mih li den uang khai. Nami dow rownla chapli mih li nadowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12" />Ang ana hown kowh uang mih nami li dow lainowmma kür khai. Naiawng hai amatni kowi dow kawmat ang nachet pe tara kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13" />Mü madiah, ransu dow uangnim iow iawng alenma uang tarü khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">aia kowh kawrnga kari ün dow liku uangchak iawng uang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">aia kowh kawrnga ün dow uamu iowk lak-e paw iowm lang len khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:13">Anging dow piak khai bowt!<verse eid="JER 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14" />Aw Jerusalem, en nakala lawngra kownkow en kowh angak mih en sak hownia kuakta diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:14">Mün ni tak chow en kowh saktuak ngak en natowah kown?<verse eid="JER 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15" />Dan marow hownia dow phih nauang kla kown mih lawnguan phuang khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:15">now Efraim hungh hownia paw phih nauang kla kown mih lawnguan phuang khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16" />Chenchapuüa tut-e hai Jerusalem maru-uüa tut-e mami laiklow krawi phuang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">“Judauüa kowi nauang sen kownkow alakma mih pren hownia ransu siphaiuüa uang tarü khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">now amatni dow Judauüa kowh marow ün nasen kownkow tüng klow khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17" />Krum kowi kowh hawt chawng kang miuüa iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:17">amatni dow Jerusalem marow tapat lut nauang rum büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Judauüa dow kingküa ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:17">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18" />Naiawng en luk kowi piakra uang ting mih dow en chang lup ngak rakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">now en kowh chowm krang uowi krang ngak rakowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:18">Nami en kowh ngak ripra dow lainowmma rau chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">nami dow en sak kowi pat pe en arau khai,” pape diah.<verse eid="JER 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda piak mih rakowi Jeremia sak nga mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19" />Ang sak dow kawm lai bowt kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">Uh, tuak krat hown ang kowh sak dow thu dukluk towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Ang dow ririmma nowng uowi phulu dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ransu-uüa kowh baw tün dow ang ta khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">now tasen klow paw ang ta khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20" />Pren kowi dow phih klen kowi phih uang ting khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:20">Naiawng rakowi pren maten piak bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">Kra sangrum now anging kowh tangbung ün hai tangbung uaniang ün napiak kown chowbowt.<verse eid="JER 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21" />Mün ni tak chow tasen tamkhuown ang nakhi kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:21">now mün ni tak chow baw tün ang nata kown?<verse eid="JER 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">“Ang maru-uüa dow abualama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">amatni dow tuk ang dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Amatni kowh dow abualama mih chauüa iawng aiung angak tukra uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">amatni dow lup ngak chang akiakma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Tawkche tawng iawng chow lup iung changah kown mih tuk dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23" />Ang dow lusa prakowi tang mü khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:23">lusa dow akhaw aklaima ang khi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:23">Mukuang prakowi ang awr plan tang mü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:23">nakowi dow tawngpaw anowi uowi dowi mih ang khi khai.<verse eid="JER 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24" />Aiuk aiukma mih hungh prakowi ang tang mü khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">naiawngün hungh dow chür nukluk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">now asowm asowmchow mih hungh ün dow tahowng nurlur khai.<verse eid="JER 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25" />Naiawngün hungh kowi ang krawi tang mü chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:25">Tawkche lowk iachow paw maru uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:25">Mukuang kowi kowh uakling uaber paw iow bowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26" />Nami kung kowi krawngsi uowi mih pren prakowi ang krawi tang mü khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">naiawngün pren paw CHAKRAMANG pur kowi süngrüp süngkangma iawng chowng bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">now nakowi kowh marow ün paw aia kowh kramra uowi mih kunmaraura pur kowi piak bowk khowk.<verse eid="JER 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Pren paprenma napiak kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:27">Tawkche pren mih asaima pat dow ang napiakah kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28" />Naiawng rakowi lusa dow nanguk nakar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">now mukuang paw naiiu kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami laiklow ang tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">Naiawng nachang kown mih ang khowm bowkta khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">Nami ang khowm bowkta mih hownia dow ang naplan kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">Nami dow ang nachang ngengche kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29" />Kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm miuüa kowh klow hown marow chakuüa maten napowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">now salangba dowk miuüa kowh klow hown marowchakuüa maten napowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Nami khin khe tawngbak mih maru dow kaurawng dawng kowi nacham powt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">now tawngbak mih maru dow aiukma mih hua luk kowi nacham powt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Naiawng rakowi marow maten dow akhaw aklaima nauowi kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">nakowi dow amiapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JER 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30" />Aw apiaknama mih Jerusalem marow, tawng chow en chang?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Tawngplawng kowchow aringma mih tawnguat hai kuh uanh hown en tatawng khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Now tawngplawng kowchow en tuk sü mikkhu pawi khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">En tatawng mih dow aiawnglowma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">En naukhi-ah mih maru-uüa dow sui en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">amatni dow napaw en asak kown mih kamrüt khai.<verse eid="JER 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31" />Kimuowi mu rau khe kowh kar klow iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">pen chah müng khe kowh kar klow iawng</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">Zaiawn chama kowh kar klow dow ang ta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">Aia dow awr tek mih, “Uh! Ang kowh chur khin uang tawn khai bowt!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">Maru ngakuüa uang saita ang kown chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5" />
  <para style="s">Juda kowh angak</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1" />Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">“Jerusalem marow kowi kowh mami tiakrum hownia paimi tiakrum mowr kowkrawi len diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">now aria aret kowi krawi tang mü diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Nami marow kowi kowh viadawng kowi ün anowmma mih maru krawi cham diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">nakowi dow achinawmma mih maru kowi krawi cham diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">Naiawng mih maru che uowi lowk ia hanow Jerusalem marow mih ang napiakah kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2" />‘Masing Thurai ming hown anging takham khowk,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:2">pahai amatni tek chepaw nami dow dai lai sawi kham amatni chang mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en nau mih dow en maru-uüa en kaah sakowm iawng nauowi kown mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow en peah arau khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">Tawkche amatni dow en peah arau pami tuk büah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Amatni kowi dow en ripah khowk chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow tarip dowi rengreng tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Amatni kowh saktuak dow hua lak-e lang khawt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">angak hownia amatni dow en tut-e uang plan dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4" />Ang ka tuak mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa dow ngaraima hai abualama chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:4">Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh tiama hai ari aiang tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5" />Naiawng rakowi aluchowuüa tut-e ang nakowkowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">now amatni hown ang nakowtalawp kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh tiama tuk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">now Thurai kowh ari aiang lawnguan paw atukma chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Tawkche amatni paw CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow chün dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi ransu-uüa napiakah kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow kaurawng hownia krangsi uangah hanow nauang makah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh sui amatni kowi dow nauang chawmah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">Amatni kowh marow ria kowi pri rengchow nahawt pawmah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">marow hownia kowh uang lawt mih maru kowi dow pri rengchow nahawt makah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow lainowmma chang angak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">now angak tia kowi amatni cham mang mih paw ahuma khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">“Aw Jerusalem, tawngplawng kowchow ang nalawt en kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">En kowh chauüa dow nuata ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">now Thurai ching nadowi mih ming hown cham kham sawi büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Amatni kowi dow amatni nau mih srui ang peah khowk chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow akeng thurai hown cham chang iang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">now amatni dow ahawmsang akeng thurai kowi cham chupiia büah khai.<verse eid="JER 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8" />Amatni dow chata chakkham kak now lowkkowlowk masi hown taphua taiua reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:8">amatni dow tapaw hau kownkow krawi len panglang mih kawrngala iawng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ang naripah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">naiawng mih chenchap luk kowi ang nasat pe klai kown.<verse eid="JER 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10" />“Aw ransu-uüa, Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowi kowpiakah diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">Tawkche amatni kowi asaima pat hangkow piak büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">Amatni kowi dow do singh mia khe kowh iawng piakah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11" />Israeluüa hai Judauüa dow ang kaah sakowm dowi iawng uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:11">ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12" />CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG lawnguan kowi tek dai lai khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:12">Amatni dow tek mih, “Aia mih tawngpaw narip a-i kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:12">aia mih tawngpaw napiak a-i kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:12">Tasen hai khown ün tawngpaw a-i nakrum kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13" />Risiuüa kowh laiklow dow li iawng asung uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:13">amatni tut-e dow Thurai kowh laiklow uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:13">Naiawng rakowi amatni tekah mih laiklow dow amatni luk kowi nauang kla kown.<verse eid="JER 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh tara chet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14" />Naiawng rakowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:14">“Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi ang naripah kown nadowi pahai maru kawmuüa krawi tek khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh laiklow mih maih iawng en nawr hownia nauang lawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">now amatni kowi dow sawp kowi maih kamah iawng ang nakamah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Israeluüa, enni kowi nakingküala kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">alakma hownia ang nauang pawla enni chenchap lowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:15">Amatni dow alai hownia kowh akürma mih chenchap chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">amatni kowh lai dow enni natuk kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">now tukta paw enni natukta kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16" />Amatni dow salangba ap kiakma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:16">now amatni dow tasen akürma kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17" />Amatni dow enni kowh uih-ak hai chakkham mih nachata enni bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">now enni kowh chauüa kowi paw nasaita enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Nami klen kowi enni kowh chia hai ruapur hawmh paw nakowngta enni kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">enni kowh grep ruih hai uidut singh ün nakripta enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Enni sakowmah mih tap tapat lut mih marow dow napiakta enni nak kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Juda-uüa mih, “Nachenganchepaw nami ni khe dow asaima ang napiak enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19" />Jeremia, en kowi Judauüa nalünta en kown mih, ‘Tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai maiawng tuk chang anging khai?’ napa kown. Nakhowk khe amatni kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Ang kowi enni nuata ang hanow enni pren kowi akeng thurai kowi enni chupiia khai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat enni mih akeng pren kowi kowh prenlang maru tut-e nar iawng hai enni nacham chang lup kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai maru-uüa nauowi kaneu kown mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20" />CHAKRAMANG mih Jakawb krungchakuüa tut-e mami laiklow kowpe phuang ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:20">now Juda krungchak tut-e paw mami laiklow kowpe phuang ang khai.<verse eid="JER 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21" />Aia tek mih, “Aw abualama mih hai prengia uowi dowi mih maru-uüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:21">mik uowi chepaw khi dowi miuüa hai param uowi chepaw ta dowi miuüa low, sünta büa diah.<verse eid="JER 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22" />Enni ringkaw ang dowi bowt tham bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">Ang pur kowi enni kram kowh chür dowi bowt tham bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Sata tui nave phunglung dowi kownkow chowngchowng saksakma vüi se hown ang thawpta rihi khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">sata tui talowng phunglung chepaw nami rihi kowi dow nauang ia ue kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">now tui talowng mih klow nowk rumrum chepaw nami rihi kowi nauang ia ue kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün maru-uüa dow saktuak khawtma hai kingküa dawma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:23">amatni dow angakma mih tiama kowi mang reng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24" />Amatni dow, ‘Chu, CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai kowi ringkawma hown a-i kram diah sik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:24">Aia dow akhin khe pe a-i uang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:24">aia dow a-i vüi kowi luprak kua khin towah a-i reng chekhai,’ pahai</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:24">sakdawng kowi katpaw tek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25" />Akhin khe enni ka uang dowi mih hai ka luprak dowi mih dow enni chang ngak rakowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:25">now enni kowh iungra uowi dowi mih paw enni chang ngak rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26" />“Ang maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi angakma mih maru uowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">amatni dow uakling ap mih maru iawng hawt tapet hüah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">now hawt khüm maru kownkow hawt thang leng reng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27" />Pawm kowi atekma uakling uowi iawng amatni kim kowi dawngthawnguan atekma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:27">Naiawngün dow amatni cham kuan maru mih hownia kowh kaah mih dawngthawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:27">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow akürma hai kurengma chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28" />Amatni dow cham krawi kuanah mih chakkham hown kau mih sisurlur towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">amatni kowh lup ngak chang dow achur uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:28">Amatni dow saratchowuüa naka tara nowm pami rakowi tawi tangila dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">now ngarai miuüa kowi paw tara nowm chet pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ang naripah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:29">naiawng mih chenchapuüa luk kowi ang nasat pe klai kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:29">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30" />“Juda pren kowi dow kramra uowima mih lup uang phaw khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:30">nakowi dow awdara uowima mih lup paw uang phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31" />Risiuüa dow krawi küa dai khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">now uamowuüa paw amatni low iawng krawi chang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:31">Ang maru-uüa dow naiawng mih lang nau rowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">Tawkche enni luk kowi piakra uang ting mih khin khe tawng chow enni nachang kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem maru-uüa nauowi kaneu kown mih vüi achur laiklow</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Aw Benjamin maru-uüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">asak naplai kownkow Jerusalem marow hownia powt büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Tekoa marow kowi tum baw büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">now Bet-Hakerem marow kowi nauowi kaneu kownkow ruang tamkhuown büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawngphak hownia phih uang tarü khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">akürma mih ransu siphaiuüa uang tarü khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2" />Zaiawn chama dow klangiungma chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:2">nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow ang napiakah kown.<verse eid="JER 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3" />Jerusalem marow tapat lut ruapur thing miuüa krawi khup tangbung reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">Nami iawng manguüa mih amatni kowh siphaiuüa kowi nauang pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">now marow tapat lut nakrawi khup tangbung büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:3">Naiawngün siphaiuüa dow amatni chowlowkkow tangbung kowi nauowi büah kown.<verse eid="JER 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4" />Manguüa natek kown mih, ‘Tasen kownkow kamrüt büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">chu, sat downg khe Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi a-i kowsen bowt lah,’ napa kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:4">Tawkche nami kung kowi amatni natek kown mih, ‘A-i dow kra khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">ni kowi kowh aiiu dow uang takuak khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5" />Naiawng rakowi rü bowt, iak-e khe amatni kowi a-i kowsen bowt lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:5">now amatni kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün a-i kowpiakta pe bowt lah,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6" />Akeng pren manguüa kowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">“Enni mih Jerusalem marow riaret kowi kowh singh maten kripta bowk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">now naklawla tap kownkow nami singh hown thawp dawng büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami marow kowi dow angak kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">Naiawng rakowi nami marow kowi naripah kown takla.<verse eid="JER 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7" />Tuikuam hownia tui uang lawt reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">nami iawng Jerusalem hownia paw angak uang lawt reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:7">Aia kowh marow kowi dow nowng chang powng chang klow hai piakra klow kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">aia arau uowi mih hai ma dow ang pur kowi ang khi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8" />Aw Jerusalem, ang pringhawi en mih laiklow sünta diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">en che sünta dowi hanow ang napowtta en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:8">En kowh pren mih ang napiakta en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">now akhaw aklaima ang natowta en hüah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">“Grep krum hownia maru krawi howngta grep uih prowng reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">nami iawng ransu-uüa mih Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi nahowngta prowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">Ta lat mih grep uih krawi ta lüng mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">ta lat mih maru-uüa kowi paw ransu-uüa nachangah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amowt uowi dowi Thurai kowi Juda kingküaah mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10" />Amia iawng miuüa hown chow ang nataklang kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">Amia iawng miuüa kowi chow nauowi kaneu kown mih laiklow ang natek pe kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Amia iawng miuüa chow ang kowh laiklow nasünta ang kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">Israeluüa kowh dow param pitma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">naiawng rakowi amatni dow ta dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow changla rensi küakau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">amatni dow aia kowh laiklow sünta kown nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura dow ang kowh kow tek khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">Nami dow ang ia tow dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 6:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “En kowh kunmaraura maru-uüa luk kowi sunah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">nami dow tiama kowi kowh ngeuüa luk kowi sunah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">Arasang takua talawm mih klanguüa hawmh luk kowi sunah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">now masi huaiu hai lawngtang matanguüa luk kowi sunah diah.<verse eid="JER 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12" />Amatni kowh kim dow amatni ransu-uüa kowh nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">amatni kowh üa hai masi paw amatni ransu-uüa kowh nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami pren kowi ang nakingküaah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">mami prenchakuüa luk kowi ang kowh rut akürma mih ang napar pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13" />“Amatni dow aiuk hai asowm bowkbowk lawpha khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:13">nami klen kowi risi hai uamowuüa paw maru kowi krawi kuan khai.<verse eid="JER 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14" />Risi hai uamowuüa dow ang maru-uüa kowh kramra uowima mih ma iawng mih angak iungta pe dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:14">iungta pe lak dow amatni daiah mih, ‘Iung kown taih, iung kown taih’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:14">Tawkche amatni tek iawng iung dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15" />Amatni dow amatni kowh naiawngün suiiai kaniaima mih lup ngak rakowi mapaw rukrai dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">amatni dow rukrai pami hing tawn büah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Naiawng rakowi ang saiah mih maru ngakuüa pungmadawng kowi amatni paw natawi uowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">Nakhowk khe amatni kowi dow ang nape khamah sum kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai tiama kowi Judauüa mang kown nau dowi mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16" />Aia maru-uüa kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">“Tiama krum kowi kowkowi hanow krawi tang mü büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">tawng mih chow tiama iung hai tiama ngak mih krawi lünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">now tiama iung prakowi mang büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">Aiungma mih tiama kowi dow thaulangra uowi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">Tawkche enni tek mih, ‘Tiama iung kowi anging mang kown nadowi,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17" />Enni luk kowi ang tow enni kangchawng mih hanow ang tek enni mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:17">‘Enni mih baw tün sünta büa diah,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:17">Tawkche enni tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:17">‘Anging sünta kown nadowi,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18" />“Naiawng rakowi aw akeng chenchapuüa, sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:18">now tawng iawng chow ang maru-uüa napiak kown mih mü büa diah.<verse eid="JER 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19" />Aw lusa maru-uüa, sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">Judauüa luk kowi ang nauang pawla pe ripra kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:19">Nami dow amatni kowh sangkrangra ngak sung chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang laiklow sünta dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">now ang kowh ari aiang paw nuata büah khai.<verse eid="JER 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20" />Aw ang kowh maru-uüa, Seba pren hownia kowh nam iungma mih maikhük ang lakke dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">now alakma mih pren hownia enni uang pawla mih nam iungma mih chap paw ang lakke dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:20">Enni kowh tikah mih uanap dow ang awmrawm dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">now enni kowh tawncher phuchua nam paw ang nauta dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:21">“Judauüa kowi maiow maiow ang natow pe krat pusara kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">nami krat pusara kowi dow pa hai chapauüa paw natawi takla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">now kimping namkhetuüa hai auiua paw napiak kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawngphak hownia kowh ransu-uüa</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Sünta büa diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">Tawngphak hownia siphai uang pathum khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">now prenchur nammowt hownia aiukma mih chenchap nauang sen enni kownkow süngürma uang tarü khowk.<verse eid="JER 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23" />Amatni tut-e dow salangba hai reh uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">amatni dow kunma ngakma hai saksing sana maru dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Kawrnga hown uang tarü khe amatni kowh klow dow nowk rumrum khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">nami klow dow sata tui talowng phunglung mih klow iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Aw Jerusalem, en kowi nauang sen en kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">amatni dow tasen miuüa iawng kamrütma uang tarü khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24" />Jerusalem maru-uüa tek mih, “Anging kowh ransu-uüa lawnguan kowi anging ta khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">Naiawng rakowi anging dow kram lai bowt kowh rut ün uaklakma towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:24">Krat pusara dawng kowi anging hing uowi hüah towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">anging kowh raura dow masiuüa penchow kimuowi mu rau iawng towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Prang kowi hang cham lawt büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:25">now tiama kowi paw hang cham mang büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:25">Lowra mih arah kowi a-i kowh ransu-uüa uowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26" />Aw ang kowh maru-uüa, khup sala uan büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">now plawi dawng kowi taiua büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">Chapa uowi lowkchow mih kowng khe kowh uowila uiting uangtak mih maru iawng kar büah nguk büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">Tawngplawng kowchow panow piakra dow a-i luk kowi linlanma nauang ting kown.<verse eid="JER 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27" />Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:27">“En kowi dow ang maru-uüa kowi nachaingla kownkow ang thawp en mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:27">Lawngha iung mih iung dowi mih chaingah iawng ang maru-uüa kowi en nachaingah kown.<verse eid="JER 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28" />Amatni dow lai üa kürma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">amatni kowh saktuak dow kri hai lawngha iawng akhawtma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:28">Amatni dow daila hown atekma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">now amatni kowh daila dow arah maten kowi krawi uetah khai.<verse eid="JER 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="JER 6:29-30" />Tai kowi dow lün pluplup mih maih hown achangma changah reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29-30">Tawkche ang maru-uüa kowi dow achangma nowng changah dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:29-30">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh dow angak hu lai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29-30">naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ang nuata khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 6:29-30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7" />
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi Jeremia tek lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1" />Jeremia tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang ting khai: <verse eid="JER 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2" />Thurai chup kim kimplawt kowi hawt iowng hanow en nahawt phuang kown mih, “Aw Juda maru-uüa, CHAKRAMANG kowi nauang chupiia kownkow mami kimplawt iawng enni uang kup miuüa maten CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta büa diah. <verse eid="JER 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Enni che ang nau iawng enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang hai lup chang khai hanow enni kowh pren kowi ang nape uowi enni kown. <verse eid="JER 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4" />Mami re-e CHAKRAMANG kowh kim uowi rakowi thaulangra nauowi kown pahai krawi tek miuüa kowh laiklow hangkow owm büa diah. Naiawng krawi dai miuüa kowh laiklow owm mih hownia hang thu büa diah. <verse eid="JER 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5" />Enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang hai lup chang krang che klangiungma takling taklai khai, lowkkowlowk klangiungma enni taklowp taklang khai, <verse eid="JER 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6" />prenlang maru, saratchowuüa hai mamaimowuüa kowi ün chang nowng dowi, mami pren kowi kowh aprek uowi dowi mih maru kowi krawi sai dowi, now akeng thuraiuüa kowi ün enni cham tawi chupiia dowi <verse eid="JER 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7" />hanow enni pipu-uüa kowi chowngchowng saksakma nauowila kownkow ang peah mih pren kowi ang nape uowi enni kown.<verse eid="JER 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8" />“‘Hang thukla büah! Mami re-e Thurai chup kim uowi khai pache enni luk kowi akrat pusara nauang ting kown nadowi bowt pami hangkow ka tuak büa diah. Nami dow daila chowtaih. <verse eid="JER 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9" />Enni dow cham ku khai, cham sai maru khai, cham chang iang hai dai lai hown cham kham sawi khai, now Baal thurai vüi kowi nam iungma mih maikhük cham towk khai. Nami klen kowi enni tukah dowi mih thurai kung kowi paw enni cham tawi krawi khai. <verse eid="JER 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10" />Nami kung kowi ang kim kowi enni uang kup hanow ang pur kowi iowng se enni tek mih, “Anging dow thaulangma,” pakhai. Tawkche enni powt hanow enni changah reng mih angak enni chang khai iawk. <verse eid="JER 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11" />Ang kowh kim mih kuk miuüa kowh tapetra bow enni nüla? Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, naiawng enni chang mih ang khi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12" />“‘Silo marow kowi kowh ang rik uowiah mih arah kowi kowkowi büa diah. Nakowi dow ang kowh maru Israeluüa chang ngak rakowi tawng iawng chow ang changah mih kowmü büa diah. <verse eid="JER 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13" />Plan plan ang hang enni chepaw enni dow naiawngün lup ngak maten tawi chang khai. Ang haw enni khowk chepaw enni klang ang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14" />Naiawng rakowi Silo kowi kowh ang changah mih iawng nami ang kowh kim dow enni kowh neplawng nesakra ang nachangah kown. Mami enni pipu-uüa hai enni vüi ang pe enni mih arah kowi Silo kowi ang changah iawng ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="JER 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15" />Enni kowh tainau Efraimuüa kowi ang prütah iawng enni kowi paw ang pur hownia ang naprüt enni kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda maru-uüa chün lai dowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16" />Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Juda maru-uüa vüi kowi ang tut-e hauang lü khowng diah, now kar paw hauang kar diah; tawng iawng mih akhowng paw ang tut-e hauang awr lü awr leng diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en kowh laiklow nasünta kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17" />Amatni kowh marow kowi ün hai Jerusalem tiama kowi ün tawng iawng chow amatni chang angak mih en khi dowi bow? <verse eid="JER 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18" />Amatni kowh chauüa dow changla phuchua kownkow krawi kua sawp khai, now pauüa dow hawt chang maih khai. Amatni kowh masi hawmh dow hawt lawk kawmdi khai, now mukuang kowi kowh masiuüa mang vüi kowi thawp kawmpah büah khai. Amatni dow towk ang kunmarau kownkow akeng mih thurai vüi kowi hüngah mih uanap pawi cham chang khai. <verse eid="JER 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19" />Naiawng amatni chang mih dow amatni pe ang arau kownkow pe bow? Nadowi. Nami dow amatni matia kowi tape arau mih chekhai, now amatni luk kowi uang pawla rukrai mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, “Ang kowh kunmaraura mami pren luk kowi ang nauang pe tingah kown. Mami pren kowi kowh maru, tawncher, singh kau hai luprak mih ang napiakta kown. Nami ang kowh kunmaraura dow maih iawng nalün hüah kown; katpaw namit kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, “Akeng mih phuchua hown changla tikah mih uanap pawi mih ngar paw enni chala prang e lang iung nadowi bow? <verse eid="JER 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22" />Aigupta pren hownia enni pipu-uüa kowi ang uang lawt mih khin khe amatni kowi dow tawng iawng mih phuchua paw nachang kown mih ang tek pe dowi chekhai. Tikah mih uanap hai akeng mih phuchua paw nachang kown mih ang tek pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23" />Tawkche enni pipu-uüa kowi ang peah ana mih, ‘Ang tek iawng uowi büa diah. Nahanow ang dow enni kowh Thurai nachowng kown, now enni dow ang kowh maru nachowng kown. Ang tek enni iawng chang büa diah; nahanow lowra sia enni vüi naiung kown,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JER 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24" />Tawkche amatni dow ang laiklow sünta dowi chekhai, now nami prakowi pe ching büa dowi chekhai. Pe ching lak dow amatni low iawng saktuak khawtma uowi khai. Amatni dow naiung ngamlam lak dow uang nga ngamlam khai. <verse eid="JER 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25" />Aigupta pren hownia enni pipu-uüa kowi ang uang lawtla hownia kawmat mowr pat ni towng ang nar risiuüa kowi ang uang chin enni khai. <verse eid="JER 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26" />Tawkche enni dow ang laiklow sünta dowi chekhai, now ching paw pe dowi chekhai. Enni dow enni kowh pipu-uüa lak-e saktuak khawt khai, now amatni lak-e enni lang chang ngak khai.<verse eid="JER 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27" />“Jeremia, naiawngün laiklow amatni kowi en tek pe mih khin khe amatni dow nasünta en kown nadowi, now amatni kowi en hawah mih khin khe paw amatni naklang en kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28" />Naiawng rakowi Judauüa kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Enni Juda chenchap dow CHAKRAMANG nau iawng chang dowi chekhai, now aia pringhawi enni mih khin khe paw enni sünta dowi chekhai. Enni pungmadawng hownia dow anowm tama khai bowt, now enni nawr hownia paw lainowm tama bowk khowk chekhai,’ pape diah.<verse eid="JER 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29" />“Aw Jerusalem maru-uüa, enni uowila uiting uangtak mih natüngla kownkow kepta sam büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 7:29">now singh kau uowi dowi mih hungh kowi cham krawi kar büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 7:29">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow aia kunmarauah mih maru-uüa kowi nuata khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asak saira lawngrawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Juda maru-uüa dow ang pur kowi chang angak khai. Amatni dow ang kim kowi suiiai kaniaima mih arup aren ün tow büah khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow ang kowh kim sürlawkah büah khai. <verse eid="JER 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31" />Amatni dow amatni kowh chauüa kowi maih kowi natikah kownkow Ben-Hinawm lawngrawi kowi kowh Tofet pami arah kroma mih kowi chupiiara thawp lowk khai. Tawkche naiawng nachang kown mih ang peah ana dowi chekhai. Naiawng napeah ana kown mih ang sak kowi khowm uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32" />Naiawng rakowi sünta diah! Maiawng mih khin nauang ting kown. Nami khin khe dow maru kawmuüa mih nami arah kowi Tofet hai Ben-Hinawm lawngrawi pahai natek kown nadowi bowt; nami dow Sak Saira Lawngrawi pahai natek bowt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Tofet kowi mih tadupra uowi dowi bowt mowr kowng miuüa kowi nadup büah kown. <verse eid="JER 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33" />Nami kung kowi naiawngün maru-uüa uak dow uakling hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowh chakkham nachowng kown. Naiawngün uakling hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowi dow naprütah kown mih maru amiapaw nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34" />Judauüa marow kowi hai Jerusalem tiama kowi kowh piaw sawmlawm mih klow dow ang narimta pe kown, now masi huaiu sar asowrchow talawp talai mih klow paw ang narimta pe kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow pren dow apiaknama naphaw bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 7:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Nami khin khe dow Juda pren manguüa kowh hut hai maru iukuüa kowh hut, uamowuüa kowh hut hai risiuüa kowh hut, now Jerusalem maru-uüa kowh hut mih amatni kowh tadupra hownia nalauta pe kown. <verse eid="JER 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2" />Naiawngün hut dow sat, lama hai krek pur kowi natakuak pan kown. Amatni kowh hut dow amiapaw nakrawi kua pe kown nadowi, now dup paw naplan dup pe kown nadowi. Naiawng hown amatni kowh hut dow chia kih iawng krawng kowi natakuak hüah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow mukuang kowi kowh naiawngün uanh kowi sakrau khai, chang pe lup khai, awr lü khowng khai, now chupiiaah khai. <verse eid="JER 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3" />Judauüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ta sing uowi miuüa kowi dow kür hown prenlang kowi ang nachinah kown. Nakhowk khe amatni dow sing uowi mih lak-e kowng kown mih nalang nau büah kown. Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Risi iuauüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4" />Juda maru-uüa kowi natek pe kownkow CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:4">“Tim mih maru dow awr plan rü reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:4">now takuowng mih maru paw uang plan reng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5" />Tawkche Jerusalem maru-uüa dow tiama tawi kowi cham mang chepaw ang tut-e uang plan dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">amatni dow angak kowi dowkta chen khai.<verse eid="JER 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6" />Amatni kowh laiklow dow kaneuma ang sünta khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">Tawkche amatni dow tek lainowm dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Changta angak chepaw amatni dow taphuang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">‘Ow! Ang changta ngak khai!’ pahai amiapaw tek dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Cham tasen khe kowh kawrnga alenma iowm mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">amatni dow amatni kowh tiama ngak prakowi alenma mang büah khai.<verse eid="JER 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7" />Iammow uakaw dow alakma kowi nacham kowi kown mih khin tuk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">now nauang plan kown mih akhin paw tuk reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">Kimtawn uatur, berbaw hai charak paw amatni kowh iow khin tuk reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">Tawkche ang maru-uüa dow ang kowh ari arow tuk dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8" />“Enni tek mih, ‘Anging dow chanlaima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:8">now anging tut-e dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ari aiang uowi,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:8">Tawkche enni kowh kawngmu sarauüa dow amatni kowh sangkrangra ngak vüi ari aiang laiklow klowita büah khai.<verse eid="JER 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9" />Naiawng mih tüngsang mih maru-uüa dow naka rukrai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">amatni dow takrow reng, now tauowk reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow nuata khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">Naiawng rakowi amatni tut-e chanlaira uowi khai bow?<verse eid="JER 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10" />Amatni kowh masi hawmh dow akeng mih maru kowi ang napeah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">now amatni kowh laih paw akeng mih maru kowi ang napeah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Amatni dow aiuk hai asowm bowkbowk lawpha khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">now risi hai uamowuüa khowm padow lawpha khai.<verse eid="JER 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11" />Risi hai uamowuüa dow ang maru-uüa kowh kramra uowima mih ma iawng mih angak iungta pe dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:11">nami takcha kowi amatni daiah mih, ‘Iung kown taih, iung kown taih,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:11">Tawkche amatni tek iawng iung dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12" />Amatni dow amatni kowh naiawngün suiiai kaniaima mih lup ngak rakowi mapaw rukrai dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">amatni dow rukrai pami hing tuk büah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Naiawng rakowi ang saiah mih maru ngakuüa pungmadawng kowi amatni paw natawi uowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">Nakhowk khe amatni kowi dow ang nape khamah sum kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:13 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow dow Hebrai lai hown mapaw chim dowi chekhai.</char>
    </note>Amatni kowi dow ang napiakta ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">Nami kung kowi dow nakowi mih grep uih hai uidut uih nauowi kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">now grep ruih hai uidut singh paw nauowi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Amatni kowh uih singh dow nakowng bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">now amatni kowi kowh ang peah mih maten namata büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14" />Judauüa tatek mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow mami re-e a-i uowi rengreng tak?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">Chu, nakowtatung tanim kownkow tap tapat lut mih marow kowi a-i kowpowt lah, now nakowi a-i kowng lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai dow a-i vüi khowmta a-i piakra khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">Tawngplawng kowchow panow a-i dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak changta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Naiawng rakowi aia dow pe kham a-i ket tui khai.<verse eid="JER 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15" />Thaulangma nauowi kown mih a-i owmsak chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:15">Tawkche tawngpaw thaulangra uang ting dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:15">Arau naiung kown mih a-i owmsak chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:15">Tawkche kramra uowima mih takrow takraira uang ting khai.<verse eid="JER 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16" />A-i ransu-uüa kowh kawrnga sak hü klow dow Dan marow hownia ta khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">amatni kowh kawrnga plak klow hown paprenma kram kowh chür khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">Amatni uang mih dow pren hai pren kowi kowh uowi mih maten napiakta kownkow chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">now marow hai maru-uüa maten kowi nauang piak kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="JER 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17" />Sünta büa diah, nauang sen enni kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">akru uowima mih rua iawng mih ransu-uüa kowi ang nauang chin enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:17">Naiawngün ransu-uüa dow rua iawng nachawt enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">amatni kowi dow amiapaw naia hangah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judauüa rakowi Jeremia sak kowi rau kowh kar mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18" />Ang sak kowi rau mih dow nowng iung dowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:18">ang kowh sak dow tapiak nak khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19" />Alakma mih pren hownia ang maru-uüa kowh kar klow ta khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">Amatni dow kar se tek mih, “Zaiawn kowi CHAKRAMANG uowi dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">Nakowi dow mang uowi dowi bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">Nakhowk khe Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG klangah mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">“Tawngplawng kowchow amatni kowh asung uowi dowi mih arup aren hown tuk towk ang kunmarau khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">Tawngplawng kowchow prenlang thuraiuüa hown tuk towk ang kunmarau khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20" />Maru-uüa tek mih, “Chatua khin rawn khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:20">now satma khin paw rawn khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:20">Nachenganchepaw anging dow ka lawngra dowi tak chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21" />Ang maru-uüa sak piak rakowi ang paw tawi sak piak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:21">ang sak kowi rau lai bowt kowh ang nowng lai dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:21">Lainowmma sak kowi rau hown ang uowi khai.<verse eid="JER 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22" />Gilead süng kowi chakhang uowi dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:22">Nakowi maru rawk mih uowi dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">Tawngplawng kowchow ang maru-uüa kowh arau iung dowi?<verse eid="JER 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1" />Owh, ang lu che chowng mrawng tui khai panü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:1">now ang mik che chowng tuikuam khai panü.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">Ang chenchap maru-uüa kowi saita mih vüi ni chut uar prowt ang nowng kar diah.<verse eid="JER 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2" />Owh, Süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang kowh uowi rah uowi lowk panü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">ang maru-uüa kowi towla hüah now nakowi ang kowia powt diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang maru-uüa dow Thurai kowi kingküa khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">amatni dow Thurai kaah sakowm dowi iawng uowi khai.<verse eid="JER 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Jeremia mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">“Judauüa dow tek dai lai kownkow rüata hüah mih leba sek iawng kamrütma uowi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Pren kowi dow mapaw asung uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">lainowm kowi paw dai lai hown nowng awng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Amatni dow angak klen kowi angak chang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">ang kowi paw amatni kowh Thurai pahai kham büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4" />Amatni dow amatni kowh auiuauüa hownia pacham uowi kaneu lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">now amatni tainau-uüa kowi paw hangkow pacham owm lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow tainau dow kowmatia tainau kowi kuan reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">now auiua dow kowmatia auiua kowi <char style="w">prawngren</char> reng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5" />Maru maten lowkkowlowk takuan reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">now amiapaw tek lainowm dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">Amatni dow tek dai lai kown mih kangowh tasang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">amatni dow kawm dowi mowr chang ngak khai.<verse eid="JER 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6" />Amatni dow lowk kung kowi lowk chang angak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:6">amatni dow lowk kung kowi lowk tek dai lai tek khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:6">Amatni dow ang tut-e uang tape büah dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7" />Naiawng rakowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">“Judauüa kowi dow kri chaing iawng ang nachaingah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:7">Ang maru-uüa kowi nami klen kowi tawng tak chow ang nachangah kown?<verse eid="JER 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8" />Amatni kowh dai dow kramra uowima mih salangba sek iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">nami dai hown amatni dow krawi tek dai lai reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Amatni dow amatni kowh nawr hown krawi kuan kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">klowkchakuüa kowi krawi sowr lai iung reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Tawkche amatni kowh sak kowi dow kuanla kown mih tuak kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="JER 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi ang ripah dowi tham bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:9">Naiawng mih chenchap kowi ang sat pe klai dowi tham bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10" />Hungma mawngma vüi kowi ang nakar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">now süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh tawncher thing rah vüi kowi ang nakar kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün dow piak bowk khowk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">nakowi dow amiapaw len dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">tawncher hawmh klow paw ta dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Mukuang kowi kowh iow mih uaklinguüa paw powt bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">now asaduauüa paw powt bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Jerusalem marow dow ang napiakah hanow mawngchawng kuakra ang nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">now brenkhui hawmh tapetra ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">Judauüa kowh marow ün süngrüp süngkangma iawng naphaw kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">nahanow nakowi dow amiapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12" />Naiawngün laiklow tukta mih prengia chakma mih maru uowi ne bow? CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh laiklow ta hanow akeng mih maru kowi nowng phuang mih maru uowi ne bow? Tawngplawng kowchow pren tuk piak bowk khai? Tawngplawng kowchow nami pren süngrüp süngkangma iawng tuk phaw khai? Tawngplawng kowchow nami pren iawng miapaw nowng mang dowi bowt?<verse eid="JER 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Naiawng phaw mih dow amatni kowi kowh ang peah mih ari aiang nuata büah rakowi chekhai, now ang tek iawng chün büah dowi rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14" />Amatni dow ang tek iawng chün lak dow saktuak khawtma uowi büah khai. Now amatni pipu-uüa tüngsangah iawng Baal thurai kowi chupiia büah khai. <verse eid="JER 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15" />Naiawng rakowi ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai mami laiklow ang tek khowk. Sünta büa diah, ang maru-uüa kowi dow akhakma mih chakkham hai akru uowi mih tui ang nape khamah kown. <verse eid="JER 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16" />Amatni kowi dow amatni tukah dowi mih chenchap hai amatni pipu-uüa paw tukah dowi mih chenchap dawng kowi ang nacham uetah kown. Asaima piak dowi mowr amatni kung kowi dow saidawng nakrawiah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem maru-uüa kar mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17" />Mukuang siphai kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">“Kawmat maiawngün lawnguan kowi tuak büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:17">Nakar kownkow cham krawi haw masiuüa hawmh büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:17">now klangiungma tuk kar mih masiuüa kowi nauang hawla kownkow cham chin maru büa diah.<verse eid="JER 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18" />Naiawngün masiuüa hawmh mih alenma uang hanow pacham kar lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:18">a-i kowh mik tui vüng bunlun dowi mowr a-i vüi pacham kar büah lah.<verse eid="JER 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19" />Zaiawn hungh hownia dow maiawng ta kar klow khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">‘Tawng iawng chow a-i tuk piak khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">Tawng iawng chow naiawng khowt pat a-i tuk ka rukrai khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">A-i kowh kim ün dow piak bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">Naiawng rakowi pren hownia a-i powt kown takla,’ pabüah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20" />Aw Juda masiuüa hawmh, CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">aia kowh laiklow nasünta kownkow enni kowh param uowah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Tawng iawng chow nakar kown mih enni chowlowkkow chamauüa kowi tüngsangla diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">now akeng miuüa kowi paw kar meng natek kown mih tüngsangla büa diah.<verse eid="JER 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21" />Kowngra dow anging kowh tawngpawk hownia uang pün khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">Nami dow anging kowh mang kim kowi uang kup khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">Nami kowngra dow tiama kowi kowh ngawk mih ngeuüa hawmh kowi kowngta bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">now marow viadawng kowi kowh uowi mih klanguüa hawmh kowi paw kowngta bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">“Maru kawmuüa kowh uak dow chia kih iawng dowm kowi natakuak hüah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:22">amatni kowh uak dow cha ngen kung cha cheng ta tamawng hüah mih iawng nata takuak hüah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">Amatni kowi dow amiapaw nakuaah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Chanlaima mih maru-uüa dow amatni kowh chanlaira hown hang pacham chang bawri lah, akürma mih maru-uüa paw amatni kowh kür hown hang pacham chang bawri lah, now kurengma miuüa paw amatni kowh kurengra hown hang pacham chang bawri lah. <verse eid="JER 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24" />Tawkche chang bawri kown nau miuüa dow maiawng mih lawnguan hown pacham chang bawri lah: Aia dow ang CHAKRAMANG pami tuk rakowi pacham chang bawri lah. Aia dow ang kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura, lusa kowi ang kowh lup anowmma mih hai achinawmma mih tuk rakowi pacham chang bawri lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow sakraura, anowmma mih hai achinawmma mih kowi awmrawm reng chekhai. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="JER 9:25-26" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Buk nga kowi kowh hiah khampha uanpik krowngchow miuüa kowi ang naripah kown mih khin nauang ting kown. Nami khin khe dow Aiguptauüa, Edawmuüa, Amawnuüa, Moabuüa, süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh kep ngeupa sam mih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25-26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kep ngeupa sam mih </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mih dow akeng thuraiuüa kowi chup mih amatra chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawng nachang kown mih Israeluüa kowi dow Thurai hangah khai. Nami lawnguan kowi Levi 19:27 uan kowi arui uowi.</char></note> maru-uüa hai Judauüa kowi ang naripah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow sak hownia hiah khampha uanpik dowi chekhai. Israeluüa maten paw sak hownia hiah khampha uanpik dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 9:25-26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10" />
  <para style="s">Anowmma mih Thurai hai arup aren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1" />Aw Israel chenchap, CHAKRAMANG tek enni mih laiklow sünta diah. <verse eid="JER 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 10:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">“Akeng chenchapuüa kowh chowm krang uowi krang iawng hang tawi uowi büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">akeng chenchapuüa dow mukuang kowi kowh lowra mih amatra khi hanow kram reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">nami iawng enni hang tawi kram büa diah.<verse eid="JER 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün chenchapuüa kowh rirow dow asung uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">Amatni dow kaurawng hownia uang tula singh lowk hanow singh hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa kowi peah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">now uanh thawp sarauüa dow kowk hown thawp pe arup aren khai.<verse eid="JER 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4" />Nami arup aren kowi dow kuh hai tai hown tawngah büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:4">now nami natim dowi kownkow matul hown asima tak pe khir büah khai.<verse eid="JER 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5" />Amatni kowh arup aren dow ngui khang kowi kowh thawpah mih arup iawng nowng lai dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow nowng mang dowi kowh akawt takla reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow hangkow kram büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">amatni dow nowngia piak enni kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">now aiung paw nowngia chang enni kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en iawng mih amiapaw uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:6">en dow akürma chekhai, now en ming dow kri kraingma chekhai.<verse eid="JER 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7" />Aw Thurai, en kowi dow maru ringkawma hown kram en reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">en kowi dow maru naringkaw en kown mih tataing chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow pren maten kowh mang chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi dow chanlaima mih maru uowi chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">Tawkche en iawng chanlaima mih amiapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8" />Arup aren kowi kowh chupiia miuüa dow prengia uowi dowi hai abualama chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh arup aren dow singh hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:8">naiawngün dow tawngpaw nowng tüng nowng sang maru dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9" />Amatni dow nathawpla arup aren kownkow Tarsis marow hownia tai pheng ia uang pawla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">now Ufaz marow hownia dow kuh uang pawla büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">Naiawngün hown uanh thawp sarauüa hai kuh hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa mih thawpla arup aren khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">now naiawngün arup aren kowi dow uan kawng sarauüa kawngah mih aruama mih uan hai anum rikma mih uan khup pe khai.<verse eid="JER 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10" />Tawkche Thurai ching dow CHAKRAMANG chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">aia dow masing Thurai hai chowngchowng saksakma mih mang chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Aia kowh kunmaraura hown dow lusa chür reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">aia kowh kunmaraura dow chenchapuüa nowng kham dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11" />Aw Israeluüa, akeng thurai kowi chupiia miuüa kowi krawi tek pe diah. Naiawngün arup aren dow mukuang hai lusa thawp mih nadowi chekhai; amatni dow mukuang hai lusa hownia napiak bowk kown taih.<verse eid="JER 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12" />CHAKRAMANG dow aiamat kür hown lusa mih thawpah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">aia kowh chanlaira hown lusa mih aia thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">now aia kowh prengia hown mukuang mih aia thawpah khai.<verse eid="JER 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13" />Aia kowh ana hown mukuang kowi dow tui tün nowk rumrum reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">aia dow prenchur nammowt hownia uangnim kowi uang pawla reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">Aia dow uang nauangla kownkow pla kowi pe nowiah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">now aia dow li krümra hownia li kowi uang lawtla reng.<verse eid="JER 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14" />Maru maten bualama hai chanlaira uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">kuh hown kowh uanthawp sarauüa dow amatni thawpah mih arup rakowi ka rukrai khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni thawpah mih arup dow tawngpaw asun uang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">now asak paw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15" />Naiawngün arup dow asung uowi dowi hai khare nichak müa uanh chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:15">tara chetra khin khe naiawngün dow napiak bowk kown.<verse eid="JER 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16" />Tawkche Jakawb kowh Thurai dow naiawngün arup aren iawng nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow uanh maten thawp miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">Israel kowi dow aia matia maru nachowng kownkow aia ruiah mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">aia kowh ming dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="JER 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judauüa piak mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17" />Jerusalem marowchakuüa low, enni kowh ransu-uüa dow uang rumta enni lut khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:17">Naiawng rakowi marow hownia napowt kownkow kowmatia kowh uanh kamrüt büah bowt.<verse eid="JER 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">“Khaleng dow Judauüa kowi mami pren hownia ang naprütta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:18">Amatni luk kowi dow krat pusara ahuma ang nauang pawla pe kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">nahanow amatni dow ang kunmarau mih natuk bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19" />Jerusalem maru-uüa kar se tek mih, “Owh, anging dow ahuma ka ngarau khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:19">anging kowh arau dow naiung naklak mih nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Nachenganchepaw mami arau dow anging kham takla.<verse eid="JER 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20" />Anging kowh tangbung dow tapiak bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">now atük müa leng maten tarai bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Anging kowh chauüa dow powtta anging bowk khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">amatni dow anging tut-e uowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Naiawng rakowi natük anging tangbung kown mih amiapaw uowi dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">now naiang anging tangbung kown mih paw amiapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21" />Tawkche amatni kowi Jeremia tek pe mih, “A-i kowh aluchowuüa dow abualama kangowh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi cham dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh lup dow chawn dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">now amatni kowh maru-uüa dow ruapur hawmh iawng mapra ne paipra ne cham krawi taset plawt khai.<verse eid="JER 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22" />Sünta büa diah, tawngphak hownia a-i kowh ransu siphaiuüa uang tarü khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">amatni dow nauang sen a-i kownkow aklow nowk lawmlawm se uang tarü khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">Amatni dow Juda marow mih nauang piakta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">now marow dow brenkhui hawmh uowi rah naphaw kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremia chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang tuk, lusa maru dow kowmatia kowh chownglawng nowng kruitown dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:23">now kowmatia low iawng amiapaw nowng uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24" />Naiawng rakowi aw CHAKRAMANG, hawi ang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:24">tawkche angak huma hown hauang hawi ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:24">Kunmarau hown che en hawi ang now ang napiak ün tarawng.<verse eid="JER 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25" />En kowh kunmaraura dow tuk en dowi miuüa luk kowi uang pe tingah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">now chupiia en dowi miuüa luk kowi paw uang pe tingah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow Jakawb krungchakuüa kowi piakta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">now Jakawb krungchakuüa kowh pren paw asaima piakta pe khai.<verse eid="JER 10:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11" />
  <para style="s">Chün lai dowi rakowi Judauüa ka ripra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="JER 11:1-3" />CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow Jeremia tut-e uang ting khai. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Mami sangbowk laitawm laiklow süntala now Judauüa hai Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi kowtek pe diah. CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Ang kowh sangbowk laitawm chün dowi mih maru dow naka piati kown. <verse eid="JER 11:1-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni pipu-uüa kowi dow Aigupta pren hownia, lawngha awp rah khuang hownia ang uang lawtla khai. Nakhowk khe amatni kowi ang peah ana mih, “Ang laiklow sünta büa diah, ang tek enni iawng chang büa diah. Nahanow enni dow ang kowh maru nachowng kown, now ang dow enni kowh Thurai nachowng kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5" />Enni pipu-uüa kowi dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawngpaw akhawr uowi dowi mih pren kowi ang napawla kown mih ang takham khai. Nami ang takhamta iawng ang nachang kown,’ pakhai. Nami dow kawmat kowh enni uowiah mih pren chekhai,” pape khai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi ang klangah mih, “Amen, CHAKRAMANG,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6" />CHAKRAMANG dow Judauüa kowh marow hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh tiama towng kowi maiawng krawi pe tek ang khai, “Ang kowh sangbowk laitawm sünta hanow chünah büa diah. <verse eid="JER 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7" />Aigupta pren hownia enni pipu-uüa kowi ang uang lawt mih khin hownia kawmat mowr pat nauowi kaneu kown mih plan plan ang tek pe khai. Amatni kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Enni mih ang tek iawng uowi büa diah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JER 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8" />Tawkche enni pipu-uüa dow ang laiklow sünta dowi, now chün paw chün dowi chekhai. Amatni dow ang kowh laiklow chün dowi kowi saktuak khawtma hown amatni nau iawng uowi büah khai. Naiawng rakowi sangbowk laitawm kowi arui uowi mih piati maten amatni luk kowi ang uang pawla pe khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Juda maru-uüa hai Jerusalem maru-uüa dow nakingküa ang kown mih akrüp sang sangkrang khai. <verse eid="JER 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10" />Judauüa hai Israeluüa dow amatni pipu-uüa changah iawng mih angak cham tawi chang khai. Amatni dow ang laiklow nuata büah hanow akeng thurai kowi cham tawi chupiia khai. Now amatni pipu-uüa hown ang tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm dow piakta büah khai. <verse eid="JER 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11" />Naiawng rakowi ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, amatni luk kowi dow phih kraingma ang nauang pawla pe kown. Nami phih hownia dow amatni naia powt kown nadowi. Nami khin khe amatni dow ang tut-e kar se nauang lü khowng kown. Tawkche amatni kowh kar klow dow ang nahawt sünta pe kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12" />Juda pren kowi kowh marow maten hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa luk kowi phih uang kla mih khin khe amatni dow amatni kowh thurai rup tut-e nacham kar büah kown, now naiawngün thurai rup pur kowi nam iungma mih maikhük nacham towk büah kown. Tawkche naiawngün thurai rup mih amatni kowi nanowng lawngah kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13" />Judauüa kowh marow maten kowi dow thurai uowi bowk chekhai. Now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh tiama towng kowi paw amatni thawp pe phuchuara khai. Naiawngün phuchuara dow suiiai kaniaima mih Baal thurai vüi kowi nam iungma mih maikhük natowkla kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="JER 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14" />“Juda maru-uüa vüi kowi ang tut-e en mih hauang lü khowng diah, now kar paw hauang kar diah. Tawng iawng mih akhowng paw ang tut-e hauang awr lü diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh laiklow mih ang nasünta en kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15" />Ang lang sakrauah mih maru-uüa dow ang kowh chup kim kowi naiawng nauang chang kown mih alow uowi dowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow lainowmma chang angak khai. Ang vüi kowi chang tawncher phuchua chepaw ripra hownia amatni dow naka lawtra kown nadowi. Naiawng chang chepaw amatni dow phih hownia naplai kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG mih Juda kowi auih chakma hai klangiungma mih kanrawn singh pahai hawah reng chowdiah. Tawkche Juda kowi dow kaikreng maih hown ang natowkah kown. Nahanow amatni dow singh mia iawng nataklowk kown. <verse eid="JER 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17" />Aia kowi singh iawng chowkah mih mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowi napiakah kown mih ana lawtta khowk chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Judauüa hai Israeluüa dow chang lup ngak khai, now Baal thurai vüi kowi nam iungma mih maikhük cham towk büah khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi towkah kunmarau khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremia kowi Anathawt marowchakuüa kingküaah mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18" />Anathawt marowchakuüa kingküa ang kown mih lawnguan ang tuk khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:18">nami laiklow dow CHAKRAMANG tek ang khai rakowi ang tuk khai.<verse eid="JER 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19" />Ang dow ruapur chah iawng adema chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">ang dow nangenah kownkow cham pawla mih ruapur chah iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">Naiawng amatni kingküa ang mih dow ang tuk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">Ang lawnguan kowi amatni tek mih, “Chu, auih hailawm singh krip iawng aia kowi a-i kripah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">Aia ming maru natukla dowi bowt kownkow aia kowi a-i saita bowt lah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JER 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20" />Jeremia chup Thurai mih, “Aw mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">en dow chet tara nowm reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">now maru saktuak paw en chaing reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">Naiawng rakowi amatni luk kowi en sat klai mih pe khi ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en tut-e uang chawk lai khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21" />Naiawng rakowi Anathawt maru-uüa lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Sai en kown nau miuüa tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG ming hown risi iawng hang krawi tek lai tham bowt. En che krawi tek rengreng now anging rut kowi en nakowng kown,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JER 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22" />Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, amatni kowi dow ang naripah kown. Amatni kowh klanguüa hawmh dow tasenra kowi nakowng kown, now amatni kowh chama chapauüa dow khown hown nakowng kown. <verse eid="JER 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23" />Anathawt maru-uüa kowi napiakah kown mih akhin ang khowm bowkta khowk chekhai. Ang piakah mih khin khe amatni dow amiapaw naia plai kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12" />
  <para style="s">Thurai tut-e Jeremia chawk lai mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow achinawmma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Nachenganchepaw en kowh tara nowm lawnguan kowi ang lünta en kown ang nau.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Tawngplawng kowchow maru ngakuüa phaw khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Tawngplawng kowchow kuanlama miuüa aiungma tuk uowi khai?<verse eid="JER 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi dow singh iawng en chowkah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">now en pe sawtah aprün khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Amatni dow awr iuk awr sown hanow awr uih awr pau khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">amatni dow atungma en laiklow tek reng chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Tawkche amatni kowh saktuak dow en hownia alakma chekhai.<verse eid="JER 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3" />Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow tuk ang reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">en dow tang mü ang reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">now mün khowt chow ang ringkaw en mih en chaing ang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Maru ngakuüa kowi dow ngenah kown mih ruapur iawng küngla diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">amatni kowi dow angen khin khe nangenah kownkow lang towah diah.<verse eid="JER 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4" />Mün ni tak chow anging kowh pren kar hown nguk hown nauowi kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">mün khowt tak chow dowm kowi kowh pram akeuma nauowi kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Mami pren kowi kowh uowi mih maru ngakuüa rakowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">asadua hai uakling uaber hawmh dow piak bowk khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">“Tawng chow a-i chang mih CHAKRAMANG tawngpaw khi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG klangah mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5" />Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG klangah mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">“En dow maru hown taowt iowm kown mih khowm en bowm khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">nami kowi tawng iawng chow kawrnga hown en naia taowt iowm kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">En dow dowm nai kowi khowm tatheu rengreng tak chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">nami kowi tawng iawng chow Jawrdan aw pang kowi kowh kaurawng kowi en naiowmah kown?<verse eid="JER 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6" />En tainau-uüa hai en pa krungchakuüa dow kuan en khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">amatni dow tawi kingküa en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">amatni dow kingküa en kown mih maru-uüa hown tawi tahum khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">Naiawng rako wi en lawnguan kowi aiungma amatni tek laiklow chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">en mih amatni kowi hangkow owm diah.<verse eid="JER 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7" />“Ang maru-uüa kowi dow ang prütta khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">ang changla dawngthawnguan mih Israeluüa kowi dow ang nuata khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">ang sakrauah mih Israeluüa kowi dow ransu-uüa rut kowi ang apta khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8" />Ang changla dawngthawnguan miuüa dow krangsi iawng phaw khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">amatni dow kaurawng kowi kowh krangsi iawng phaw khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">Amatni dow kingküa ang kownkow krangsi iawng hek rangrang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ang suiah khai.<verse eid="JER 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9" />Ang kowh dawngthawnguan Israeluüa dow uamu iawng phaw khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">amatni dow ang tut-e krawi kram chak reng mih uamu iawng phaw khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Tawkche kawmat dow akeng chap uakling hawmh rumah now thürah prungrung mih iawng phaw khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Ang maru-uüa kowh uak nauang tawi cha kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowi kowkrawi haw diah.<verse eid="JER 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10" />Akeng pren kowi kowh kruitown miuüa dow uang hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">grep krum iawng mih ang kowh maru-uüa kowi uang piakta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">Amatni dow ang maru-uüa kowi thuata nak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">ang kowh klangiungma mih grep krum kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma iawng changta ang büah khai.<verse eid="JER 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11" />Ang kowh grep krum dow piaknama hown ang tut-e uang kar khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">Paprenma dow piak bowk khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:11">Naiawng rakowi nami pren prakowi amiapaw pe ching dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JER 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12" />Ransu-uüa dow Jerusalem marow nauang piak kownkow süngrüp süngkangma iawng uang tarü khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">Nami marow napiakta kownkow CHAKRAMANG dow nami ransu-uüa kowi tawngah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">Nahanow nami marow kowi kowh maru-uüa maten dow ka ripra khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">miapaw thaulangma uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13" />Amatni sawt khe dow püm chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">tawkche amatni ngen khe dow chuh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Amatni dow kawmkratma hown chang lup chowdiah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">tawkche tawngpaw ka dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">CHAKRAMANG kunmarau rakowi enni kowh luprak dow phaw dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">Naiawng rakowi enni ka rukrai khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh kimping namkhetuüa vüi laikham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang maru Israeluüa kowi kowh ang peah mih pren dow amatni riaret kowi kowh angakma mih kimping namkhetuüa piakta pe khai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün maru ngakuüa kowi dow amatni kowh pren hownia ang naprütah kown, now amatni rut hownia Judauüa kowi dow ang lawngah kown. <verse eid="JER 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15" />Tawkche amatni kowi dow akung kowi ang naplan saksing sanaah iawk kown, now amatni chowlowkkow uowi rah pren kowi dow amatni kowi ang naplan pe uowiah iawk kown. <verse eid="JER 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16" />Akat khe amatni dow ang maru-uüa kowi Baal thurai ming hown nakham sawi kown mih tüngsangah khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni che ang maru tiama kowi uang tawi mang khai, now, ‘Masing Thurai ming hown ang takham khowk,’ pahai ang ming hown kham sawi khai hanow amatni dow ang maru-uüa hown natawi ka prasi kown. <verse eid="JER 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17" />Nachenganchepaw amatni che ang laiklow sünta dowi hanow asaima ang napiakta kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13" />
  <para style="s">Adipükchow mih la hown kowh kraksa dawngh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Adipükchow mih la hown kowh kraksa dawngh kowran lowk hanow ü diah. Tawkche nami dow tui kowi hangkow sikah diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2" />Nahanow ang dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng kraksa dawngh kowran lowk hanow ang ü khai.<verse eid="JER 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek ang mih, <verse eid="JER 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4" />“En ranah kowh en ü-ah mih kraksa dawngh dow Iufratis aw re-e kowpawla diah, now nakowi kowh hua takra kowi kowpetah diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5" />Naiawng rakowi nami atowngchow mih dawng dow CHAKRAMANG tek iawng Iufratis aw re-e kowh hua takra kowi ang kowpetah khai.<verse eid="JER 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6" />Khin krama kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Kawmat Iufratis aw re-e kowkowi diah, now nakowi kowh ang pe pet en mih kraksa dawngh dow uang pawla diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7" />Naiawng rakowi Iufratis aw re-e ang kowkowi khai, now ang petah mih rah hownia uatah hanow nami kraksa dawngh dow ang uang laila khai. Tawkche nami dow piak khai bowt; mapaw kaah tawng dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JER 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, <verse eid="JER 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, naiawng hai Judauüa kowh bawrira hai Jerusalem maru-uüa kowh bawrira dow ang napiakta pe kown. <verse eid="JER 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10" />Naiawngün maru ngakuüa dow ang laiklow chün dowi chekhai. Amatni dow saktuak khawtma uowi büah khai. Akeng thuraiuüa kowh lup ün cham tawi chang büah khai, now chupiia paw cham tawi chupiia büah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow nami kaah atawng dowi mih kraksa dawngh iawng ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="JER 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11" />Kraksa dawng dow kelang kowi tasük krowk iawng maru ü-ah reng. Nami iawng Israeluüa hai Judauüa kowi dow ang tut-e atawnchow ang towah reng chekhai. Naiawng ang towah mih dow ang maru-uüa hownia ang kowh ming iung nang iung, kiowrira hai ringkawra ang nakala kownkow chekhai. Tawkche amatni dow ang laiklow sünta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Towla grep tui mih bawn kawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12" />“Amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih maiawng kowtek pe diah, ‘Grep tui dow bawn kawng towng atekma natowah kown takla,’ pape diah. Nakhowk khe amatni natek en kown mih, ‘Bawn kawng towng kowi grep tui atekma natow kown mih anging tuk dowi pabow?’ napa kown. <verse eid="JER 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi maiawng ang tekah mih kowtek pe diah, ‘Mami pren kowi kowh uowi mih maru maten kowi dow rak pua iawng ang nachangah kown. Now mang David kowh mang chowm rah kowi kowh chowm mih manguüa, uamowuüa, risiuüa hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowi paw nami iawng ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="JER 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14" />Grep tuikawng lowkkowlowk takhing khe kowh teu prawt mih iawng amatni kowi dow ang napiakta nak kown. Pa lah, chapa lah bowkbowk kowi ang napiakah kown. Amatni kowi dow tawng iawng paw ang nasaksing sanaah kown nadowi, ang napiakah ngengche kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bawrira hownia nauowi kaneu kown mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15" />Judauüa low, sünta büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">pe ching büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">now hang chang bawri büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG tek khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16" />CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi ringkaw diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">aia kowi kiow diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">Nadowi kowh chalow now aia dow aiiu mih nauang pawla enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">now aiiuma mih hungh kowi enni natatheu kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">Nakhowk khe dow enni krawi cham anowi chepaw aiiu chowtaih enni nakrum kown.<verse eid="JER 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17" />Enni che CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta dowi hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">enni kowh bawri rakowi kukpa ang nacham kar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">now ang kowh mik tui dow nahawr dawilawi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa kowi dow ransu-uüa nakhümla kown chekhai.<verse eid="JER 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Mang hai a-u kowi en nakowtek pe kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">‘Mang chowm rah hownia uang iu dowm iüa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">Tawngplawng kowchow panow enchi kowh mang lukruk dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">enchi kowh klangiungma mih lukruk dow enchi lu hownia nadowh bowt kown.<verse eid="JER 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19" />Mrawkphak prakowi kowh Negeb kowi kowh Judauüa kowh marow ün dow ransu-uüa nauang rumta lut kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">naiawngün marow kowi dow amiapaw nauang nowng lawngah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:19">Judauüa maten kowi dow ransu-uüa mih khümla hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">akeng pren kowi nacham pawla kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Jerusalem, kü mik hanow mü diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">tawngphak hownia ransu-uüa uang tarü khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:20">Aia pe en mih ruapur hawmh iawng mih maru-uüa tawng kowi chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">En dow naiawngün maru-uüa hown lainowmma en chang bawri khai.<verse eid="JER 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21" />Akeng mih maru-uüa nakhowng enni kown mih enni owm khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow amatni kowi mih enni luk kowi ang nape kruitownah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:21">Nami lawnguan kowi tawng chow enni natek kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">Enni dow penchow kimuowi mu rau iawng enni nangare kown.<verse eid="JER 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22" />‘Tawngplawng kowchow maiawng a-i luk kowi uang tuk ting khai?’ pahai enni naka tuak kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">Naiawng enni luk kowi uang ting mih dow enni chang ngak lai rakowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">Enni kowh tawnguat mih ransu-uüa nathekta enni nak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">now enni kowh ransu-uüa mih kür hown naphua naiua enni kown.<verse eid="JER 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23" />Ethiawpia pren kowi kowh maru-uüa dow amatni kowh pik mia rawng nowngia klowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:23">now pri rengchow paw aia buk kowi kowh apriama mih nowngia plim dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">Nami iawng enni kowh angak kiang dow enni nowngia tow dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24" />“En kowh maru-uüa kowi dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:24">li rownla mih chapli iawng ang nauetah kown.<verse eid="JER 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25" />Enni kowh kakbak dow nami chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">enni vüi kowi kowh ang kamrütta mih dow nami chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:25">Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow tamata ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">now anowm nadowi mih thurai kowi enni cham tawi owm khai.<verse eid="JER 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26" />Naiawng rakowi enni khupah mih tawnguat dow ang naklüpta enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:26">now ang natüng enni siri hanow enni narukrai kown.<verse eid="JER 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27" />Enni chang iang mih hai enni kowh manau hown enni taphua taiua mih ang khi khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">now rukraira uowima mih chawkkrawma lup enni chang mih paw ang khi khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Nami klen kowi hungh towng kowi hai dowm towng kowi ün</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">suiiai kaniaima mih lup enni chang mih paw ang khi khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Aw Jerusalem, en luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">Mün ni tak chow asür alawkma hown en nauowi kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 13:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14" />
  <para style="s">Kramra uowima mih sat kang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1" />Sat nakang kown mih lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Jeremia mih,<verse eid="JER 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2" />“Juda prenchakuüa dow uowila uiting uangtak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh marowchakuüa dow kür uowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">Nakowi kowh maru-uüa dow krawng kowi mawk se kar büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">now Jerusalem maru-uüa dow Thurai tut-e naka khowng kownkow atünma awr kar khai.<verse eid="JER 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3" />Maru iukuüa dow anaruüa kowi cham pe towngah tui reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">Tawkche tuikuam maten dow akangma kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Naiawng rakowi anaruüa dow tuikawng akhawma plan khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">amatni dow sak ngama hown rukrai kowh mumta lumowr büah khai.<verse eid="JER 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4" />Pren kowi uang kla dowi rakowi krawng cheng khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:4">Naiawng rakowi üa hai laih chang miuüa dow ka tuak ka cha dowi bowt kowh phek kaucha khai.<verse eid="JER 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5" />Dowm kowi pram awm dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:5">Naiawng rakowi nahiuma khowm penla chah hüah now powt khai.<verse eid="JER 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6" />Kaurawng kawrngaramchük hawmh dow singh kau uowi dowi mih hungh luk kowi iowngla dawng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:6">amatni dow iowng dawnglawng se brenkhui iawng taha phala büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">Amatni dow ka pram dowi rakowi kü mik kown mih khowm kür uowi dowi bowt chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7" />Maru kawmuüa tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging dow en hownia cham powtta en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">now ahuma anging chang ngak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Kawmat dow anging kowh ngak rakowi anging ka ripra khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">Nachenganchepaw en nakala ming iung nang iung kownkow uang khowng anging diah.<verse eid="JER 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow Israeluüa kowh sakowmra chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">en dow kla phih mih khin khe kowh lawng miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">Tawkche kawmat dow tawngplawng kowchow prenlang maru iawng en uowi khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">Tawngplawng kowchow iakla pauarchow mih khari kowi iawng anging tut-e en tuk uang khai?<verse eid="JER 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9" />Tawngplawng kowchow amawlawma mih maru iawng en tuk uowi khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">Tawngplawng kowchow kür uowi dowi mih siphai iawng en tuk uowi khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow anging tut-e tawi uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">now anging dow en kowh maru chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">Naiawng rakowi hauang nuata anging diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10" />Judauüa lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">“Judauüa dow ang hownia alakma kowi cham krawi len kown mih lang nau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">now amatni dow amatni kowh khawk towah phülü dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi ang maru iawng ang napawah kown nadowi bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">khaleng dow amatni kowh angak ang naka tuak pe bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">now amatni kowh ngak rakowi ang naripah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:11">“Juda maru-uüa iung müa ang tut-e hauang lü khowng diah.<verse eid="JER 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12" />Amatni dow khang hawm se ang tut-e nauang awr lü kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:12">now amatni kowh kar klow dow ang nahawt sünta pe kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:12">Tikah mih uanap hai kawmdi uanap paw ang napaw pe kown nadowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:12">ang napaw pe lak dow tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi hown amatni kowi ang napiakah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13" />Nakhowk khe ang tek pe CHAKRAMANG mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, nga lai bowt kowbow! En maru-uüa kowi akeng mih risiuüa tek pe mih, ‘Tasenün enni nakrum kown nadowi, now khown hown paw enni nakawm kown nadowi. Mami arah re-e dow CHAKRAMANG mih thaulangma natow enni ngengche kown,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Risiuüa dow ang ming hown pur prakowi nauang phaw kown mih lawnguan kowi krawi küa dai khai. Amatni kowi dow ang uang chinah dowi chowdiah, amatni kowi dow naiawng nakrawi tek kown mih ana ang peah dowi chowdiah; tawng iawng mih laiklow paw ang tek pe dowi chowdiah. Amatni dow enni tut-e dai lai mukmang, dai lai hawra hai amatni sak nau iawng krawi tek enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="JER 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15" />Naiawng rakowi naiawng dailama mih risiuüa kowi dow ang naripah kown. Amatni kowi dow ang krawi chinah dowi chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni tek mih, ‘Mami pren kowi tawng iawng mih khown paw nauang ting kown nadowi,’ pakhai. Naiawngün risiuüa dow tasenra kowi lah, khown hown lah napiak kown. <verse eid="JER 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16" />Maru kawmuüa tut-e risi iawng krawi tek lai miuüa dow naiawng nakowng kown, now amatni kowh laiklow chün miuüa paw nakowng kown. Amatni kowh uak dow Jerusalem tiama towng kowi natakuakla pan kown. Amatni, amatni kowh masi hai amatni kowh chauüa dup mih dow amiapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Naiawng hai amatni kowh angak sung dow ang napeah kown.<verse eid="JER 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17" />“Maru kawmuüa kowi maiawng tek pe diah, ‘Ang kowh mik tui dow ni chut uar prowt hawr khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang chenchapuüa dow ka ngarau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">ang maru-uüa kowh chimsaima mih chama dow ka ngarau mih lainowmma hu khai.<verse eid="JER 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18" />Dowm kowi ang kowkowi mih khin khe tasen hown maru kowng mih ang khi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">now marow kowi ang kowkowi khe paw khown hown maru kowng mih ang khi khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Tawkche risiuüa hai uamowuüa dow pren kowi tawng chow own mih tawngpaw tuk dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">amatni dow amatni sak nau iawng cham krawi lenla pang khai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremia chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, Judauüa kowi en hing nuata mih chowbowt bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">Zaiawn kowi en suiah mih chowbowt bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Nowng iungah dowi pat mih arau tawngplawng kowchow en tuk pe anging khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">Anging hawt sakowm mih dow aiung chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">Tawkche tawng iawng mih iungra paw uang ting dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Anging kowh arau naiung kown mih anging sakowm chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">Tawkche anging luk kowi dow kramra kangowh uang ting khai.<verse eid="JER 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging kowh angak anging uang taphuang khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:20">anging pipu-uüa kowh angak lawnguan kowi paw anging uang taphuang khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:20">Anging dow kingküala en mih angak changta khai nowm.<verse eid="JER 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21" />En kowh ming iung nang iung naia townla kownkow hangkow cham dangta anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">en kowh rowsira uowima mih mang chowm rah uowi mih Jerusalem kowi hauang pawla pe rukraira diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">Anging vüi kowi kowh en towah mih sangbowk laitawm dow ka tuakah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">nami dow hangkow piakta diah.<verse eid="JER 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22" />Akeng chenchapuüa kowh asung uowi dowi mih arup aren dow uang nowng pawla uang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">mukuang paw aia low hown nowngia pe uang dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Aw CHAKRAMANG, naiawngün nowngia pe mih dow en chowtaih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">Naiawng rakowi anging dow en luk kowi owmsak reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng nowng chang mih dow en chowtaih chekhai.<verse eid="JER 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15" />
  <para style="s">Judauüa piak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Judauüa vüi kowi Mosi hai Samuel iüah ang pur kowi kar chepaw amatni kowi dow ang nasaksing sanaah kown nadowi. Judauüa kowi dow ang pur hownia prütta diah; amatni pacham powt lah. <verse eid="JER 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2" />Nakhowk khe amatni dow, ‘Tawng kowi chow anging napowt kown?’ pahai nalünta en kown. Nakhowk khe amatni kowi dow ang CHAKRAMANG ang kowh laiklow maiawng en natek pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">“‘Nakowng kownkow khowm bowkta khowk miuüa dow nakowng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:2">saidawng hown nakowng kownkow khowm bowkta khowk miuüa dow tasenra kowi nakowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">Khown hown nakowng kownkow khowm bowkta khowk miuüa dow khown hown nakowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:2">now nar kowi uowi kown khowm bowkta khowk miuüa kowi dow maru nakhümah kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Amatni luk kowi dow piakra tali chaing ang nauang chin pe kown. Naiawngün dow amatni kowi nasaiah kownkow saidawng dowkma mih ransu siphaiuüa kowi ang nauang chin pe kown. Amatni uak naküngla kownkow kui hawmh kowi ang nauang chin pe kown. Amatni kowi dow uakling uaber hawmh nachaah kown, now ta lat miuüa kowi dow kaurawng uaramchak hawmh nachaah kown. <verse eid="JER 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4" />Juda pren kowi Hezekia kowh chapa Manase chowm mang mih khin khe Manase dow Jerusalem marow kowi chang angak khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh maru-uüa kowi dow ang naripah kown. Naiawng ang ripah mih khi hanow lusa maru maten nakram kown.<verse eid="JER 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5" />“Aw Jerusalem, amia chow nasaksing sana en kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">En vüi amia chow nakar nanguk kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Tawng iawng chow en uowi mih amia chow nauang lünta en kown?<verse eid="JER 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6" />Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, en dow nuata ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">now tiama ngak prakowi en cham mang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">Naiawng rakowi ang kowh rut hown ang napiak en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">en kowi dow ang nasaksing sana en kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7" />Ang maru-uüa kowi dow marow tapplawt re-e chapli iap iawng ang naiapah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">ang maru-uüa luk kowi dow chapa kowng mih taprüa tangukra ang nauang pawla pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">Ang maru-uüa kowi dow ang napiakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang prakowi uang plan dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8" />Juda pren kowi dow mamaimow akawmma ang nachangah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">amatni kowi dow sata pang kowi kowh sema lak-e hu ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Klanguüa hawmh kowi ang nasaita pe hanow u-uüa kowi ang nauang pawla pe kawm kratra kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">Amatni luk kowi dow takrow takraira hai akrat pusara amaisang ang nauang pawla pe kown.<verse eid="JER 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9" />Chah uowi ranit ia mih masiuüa dow namaw kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">sat uowi reng tak chepaw amatni tut-e uar naiiu bowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Amatni dow chah uowi dowi mih rukrai hown nachowm phulu kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Ta sing uowi miuüa kowi dow ransu-uüa kowh saidawng kowi ang naap-ah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremia chawk lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10" />Uh! A-u, tawngplawng kowchow mami lusa kowi en tuk pen ang khai? Ang kowi dow lusa kowi kowh maru maten kingküa ang khai, now amatni dow sen ang khai. Ang dow cham paw lowi dowi chowdiah, now maru paw pe ang lowi dowi chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw lusa maru dow pe ang piati khai.<verse eid="JER 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “En naiungla kownkow ang nalawng en ngengche kown. En kowh ransu-uüa dow amatni krat mih khin khe en tut-e nauang lü khowng kown. <verse eid="JER 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12" />Tawngphak pra kowh pren kowi kowh lawngha hai kri nowng piak mih amia chow uowi? <verse eid="JER 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13" />Aw Juda, en chang ngak rakowi en kowh dawngthawnguan dow cham rupah mih uanh iawng paprenma kowi aiawng ang naretah kown. <verse eid="JER 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14" />En kowi dow en tukah dowi mih pren kowi ransu-uüa kowh nar ang nachang en kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh kunmaraura dow maih iawng nalün kown, now nami maih dow katpaw namit kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow bowkbowk tuk chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">naiawng rakowi ang laiklow tuakah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">now ang prakowi pe ching diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Chang ang anowng apowng miuüa luk kowi sat pe klai diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">amatni luk kowi dow hangkow town sak tham bowt diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Amatni rut kowi dow hauang pe piak ang diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">en vüi kowi kowh ang kham rukrai mih dow sak kowi towah reng diah.<verse eid="JER 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16" />Ang tut-e kowh en laiklow uang ting mih dow sak kowi ang towah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">nami en kowh laiklow dow ang kowh piawra hai ang kowh awmrawmra chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aw mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">en dow ang kowh Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="JER 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17" />Ang dow kham rak se how sawmlawm mih thum kowi tawi uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">amatni hown dow katpaw ang tawi piaw dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">Ang dow en ana pek iawng lang uowi phülü reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh angak rakowi ang kunmarau khai.<verse eid="JER 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18" />Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowh arau iung dowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowh ma lep dowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">Tawngplawng kowchow nami ma rau uowi rengreng?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">Satma khin khe kowh tui kang mih awchawng iawng khowng ang dowi kowi en nauowi kown bow?<verse eid="JER 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “En che ang tut-e uang plan hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">auown khe kowh iawng ang kowh lup aiungma en naia chang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">En che asung uowi dowi mih laiklow tek dowi hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">risi iawng ang naplan chang en iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Naiawngün maru-uüa mih pacham sünta en laiklow lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">Tawkche amatni kowh laiklow dow en nasünta pe kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20" />Naiawngün maru-uüa tut-e dow kri hown kowh akhawtma mih tap iawng ang nachang en kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">Amatni dow en kowi nasen en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">Tawkche amatni mih naiata en kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">natowkala en kownkow hai nalawng en kownkow en tut-e ang natawi uowi reng kown.<verse eid="JER 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21" />Ransu-uüa hownia ang natowkala en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:21">now maru ngakuüa rut hownia ang lawng en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16" />
  <para style="s">Piakra uang ting kown mih khin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow mih ang tut-e uang plan ting khai. CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, <verse eid="JER 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2" />“En mih Juda pren kowi hang paw masi diah, now chauüa paw hang paw diah. <verse eid="JER 16:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="JER 16:3-4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, nami pren kowi kowh dia mih chauüa hai amatni kowh upa-uüa dow rawka dikma hown nakowng kown. Amatni vüi kowi dow amiapaw nakar kown nadowi, now amatni kowh uak dow amiapaw nadupah kown nadowi. Amatni kowh uak dow chia kih iawng krawng kowi natakuakla pan kown. Amatni dow tasen hai khown hown nakowng kown, now amatni kowh uak dow uaklinguüa hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowh chakkham nachowng kown.<verse eid="JER 16:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5" />“Uowila uiting uangtak mih maru kim kowi dow hang pün diah. Amatni vüi kowi natawi kar kownkow hai natawi taprüa taiia kownkow nakowi hangkow kowi diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow ang kowh thaulangra, ang kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hai saksing sanara ang pawta pe khai bowt. <verse eid="JER 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6" />Nami pren kowi kowh maru iukuüa hai maru sowmuüa dow nakowng bowk kown. Amatni kowi dow amiapaw nadupah kown nadowi, amatni vüi kowi dow amiapaw nauowila uiting uangtak kown nadowi, sak piak kowh kowmatia kowpaw amiapaw natata kown nadowi, now kowmatia sam paw amiapaw nakhai kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7" />Uowila uiting uangtak miuüa kowi dow nadepah kownkow amiapaw nauang pawla pe chakkham kown nadowi, now u-pa vüi kowi kowh uowila uiting uangtak miuüa kowi paw nadepah kownkow amiapaw nauang pawla pe tui kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8" />“Chang pawi mih kim kowi hang cham cha hang cham kham büa diah. <verse eid="JER 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk, nami pren kowi dow maru-uüa piaw sawmlawm mih klow ang narimta bowk kown. Tapün talo mih masi huaiu sar kowh piaw klow nata kown nadowi bowt. Naiawngün dow en sing uowi reng tak khe nauang phaw kown.<verse eid="JER 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10" />“Naiawngün laiklow amatni kowi en tek pe mih khin khe maiawng amatni nalünta en kown, ‘Anging luk kowi phih nauang ting kown mih laiklow tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG tuk tek anging khai? CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai kowi kingküala mih angak tawng chow anging changta khai?’ napa kown. <verse eid="JER 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11" />Nakhowk khe ang CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow maiawng amatni kowi en natek pe kown, ‘Enni pipu-uüa dow nuata ang khai. Amatni dow akeng thuraiuüa kowi cham tawi chupiia khai. Amatni dow nuata ang khai, now ang kowh ari aiang chün büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12" />Tawkche enni dow enni pipu-uüa lak-e enni lang chang angak khai. Enni dow ang laiklow chün dowi kowi enni kowh angakma mih sak nau iawng enni uowi khai. <verse eid="JER 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13" />Naiawng rakowi ang dow enni tukah dowi mih pren kowi ang nakuakta enni kown. Nami pren dow enni pipu-uüa khowm tuk dowi chekhai. Nami pren kowi dow ni towng iak towng akeng thurai kowi enni nachupiia kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow nasaksing enni kown nadowi bowt,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel kowi alai kowh iawng Thurai plan towah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Maiawng mih akhin nauang ting kown. Nami khin dow maru kawmuüa mih, ‘Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi uang lawtla mih masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang takham khowk,’ pami natek kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15" />Nami takcha amatni natek kown mih, ‘Israeluüa kowi tawngphak pra kowh pren kowi hai akeng pren kowi prütah mih hownia uang lawngla mih masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang takham khowk,’ napa kown. Naiawng amatni natek kown mih dow amatni pipu-uüa kowi kowh ang peah mih pren kowi amatni kowi ang nauang pawla kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="JER 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16" />“Tawkche kawmat dow amatni kowi nakhümah kownkow ransu-uüa kowi ang nakowchin pe kown. Nahanow ransu-uüa dow amatni kowi dam khüm iawng nakhümah kown. Nami kung kowi dow chakmit miuüa kowi ang nauang chin pe kown. Naiawngün chakmit miuüa dow aiukma mih hungh hownia, asowmchow mih hungh hownia hai hua pheng krüa hownia amatni kowi nakhümah kown. <verse eid="JER 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi dow ang krawi tang müah reng chekhai. Amatni kowh angak dow ang khi reng. Amatni kowh angak dow ang tut-e ia tapet dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18" />Amatni chang angak rakowi amatni kowi dow pre dungna mowr ang naripah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang kowh pren mih sürlawkta ang khai. Amatni dow ang kowh pren kowi suiiai kaniaima mih arup kangowh changah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow ang ko kür hai ang kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">en dow kawmkratma ang uowi khe kowh tatung tanimra chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">En tut-e dow prenchur nammowt hownia akeng chenchapuüa nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">now amatni natek kown mih, “Anging pipu-uüa dow asung uowi dowi mih arup aren kowi chupiia khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">Tawkche naiawngün arup aren dow amatni kowi tawngpaw nowng khowngah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20" />Kowmatia vüi kowi maru nowng thawp Thurai khai bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:20">Thawp khai chepaw naiawngün dow Thurai ching nadowi chekhai,” napa kown.<verse eid="JER 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Naiawng rakowi khaleng dow chenchapuüa kowi ang kowh nowng changra hai ang kowh kür ang natüng pe kown. Nakhowk khe dow amatni mih ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17" />
  <para style="s">Juda kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Judauüa kowh angak dow lawngha her müa hai maiak chukchem hown ruiah khai. Amatni kowh angak dow naiawngün uanh hown hua iawng akhawtma mih amatni kowh sak kowi hai phuchuara nang kowi ruiah khai. <verse eid="JER 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2" />Amatni kowh chauüa khowm padow akeng thuraiuüa kowh phuchuara kowi hai <char style="w">Asera limpu chüng</char> kowi cham tawi chupiia khai, now aram chakma mih singh tut kowi hai alowngma mih hungh kowi ün cham tawi chupiia arup khai. <verse eid="JER 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3" />Aw Juda, en dow chang ngak khai. Naiawng rakowi ang narip en kown. En kowh dawngthawnguan hai en kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kowi kowh uanh maten ransu-uüa napawta en bowk kown. Now paprenma kowi kowh arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara ang napiakta en bowk kown. <verse eid="JER 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4" />Ang pe en mih pren dow en kowh angak rakowi en namata kown. En kowi dow en tukah dowi mih pren kowi en ransu-uüa kowh nar ang nachang en kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow maih lün pluplup mih iawng en towk ang kunmarau khai; nami kunmaraura dow katpaw naprowng kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek mih, “Maru luk kowi neplawng nesak mih dow naka piati kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:5">kowmatia kür kowi owmsak mih paw naka piati kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">Nami klen kowi ang luk kowi owm dowi mih maru paw naka piati kown.<verse eid="JER 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6" />Naiawng mih maru dow apiaknama mih laih kowi kowh chuh mung iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:6">aia dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi aden dawng kowi nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">Aia dow khin iung uang ting khe natawi khi kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7" />Tawkche CHAKRAMANG luk kowi neplawng nesak mih dow prasira uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:7">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia owmsak mih dow CHAKRAMANG luk kowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8" />Aia dow aw pang kowi chowkah mih singh aprün ka tui reng mih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">satma khin uang ting chepaw aia dow kram dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Aia kowh aram dow asingma uowi reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">sat kang chepaw aia dow tawngpaw taprüa dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">now aia dow uih chakma mih singh iawng uih reng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9" />“Maru kowh saktuak dow kuanlama chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:9">sak hown tawng chow maru tuak mih amiapaw tuk dowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:9">Sak kowi dow amiapaw nowngia iungah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10" />Ang CHAKRAMANG dow maru kowh sak hai saktuak mih chaing reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:10">ang dow maru kowh chowm krang uowi krang hai amatni kowh lup chang krang iawng peah asung reng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11" />Lup ngak hown kram dawngthawnguan mih maru dow akeng mih uakling dui kowi cham krawi awr mih uamuk iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">naiawngün dawngthawnguan dow aia chownglawng dawnglang khe natama bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">now chownglawng chur prakowi aia dow abualama pami natatuk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12" />Anging kowh Thurai chup kim dow kri kraingma mih mang chowm rah iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:12">Nami dow achük alai hownia alowngma mih hungh kowi iowng dawnglawng khai.<verse eid="JER 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, Israeluüa kowh sakowmra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">en kowi nuata en miuüa dow naka rukrai kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">Amatni dow lusa kowi kowh bawn kowi natadup kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow masing tuikuam CHAKRAMANG kowi nuata büah khai.<verse eid="JER 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG tut-e Jeremia lü khowng mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh arau iungta ang diah, nahanow ang naiung kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:14">lawng ang diah, nahanow ang naka lawngra kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:14">En kowi chowtaih ang narowsi en kown.<verse eid="JER 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15" />Juda maru-uüa dow lünta ang mih, “Tawng kowi chow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:15">Tawngplawng kowchow aia kowh laiklow uang tachi dowi?” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en maru-uüa kowi nakruitown kown mih hownia ang powt dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:16">amatni luk kowi phih nauang ting kown mih ang nau dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:16">Ang nawr hownia kowh lawt mih laiklow maten dow en tuk bowk khowk.<verse eid="JER 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17" />Hauang tüng ang kram diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:17">en chowtaih ang kla phih khe kowh tatung tanimra.<verse eid="JER 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18" />Chang ang anowng apowng miuüa kowi dow peah rukrai diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">Tawkche ang kowi dow rukraira hownia lawng ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Amatni kowi dow piakah diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">Tawkche ang kowi dow hauang piak ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Amatni kowi dow kramra uowima mih ni uang pawla pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">now piak chamang piakah diah.<verse eid="JER 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tanai Ni chimsaima nasunah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19" />CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Juda manguüa uang mang uang katla reng mih Maru Kawm Tapplawt re-e kowkowi now kowiowng diah, now ang kowh laiklow hawt phuang diah. Jerusalem marow kowi kowh akeng mih tapplawt ün kowi paw naiawng kowkrawi phuang diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20" />CHAKRAMANG pe tek ang mih, “Mami marow tapplawt iawng uang kup mih Juda manguüa, maru kawmuüa hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa low, enni mih CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta büa diah. <verse eid="JER 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Kaneuma uowiah büa diah. Tanai Ni khe tawng iawng mih kurdik paw enni nachang kown nadowi, now Jerusalem marow tapplawt iawng paw enni nauang kupla kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22" />Tanai Ni khe dow kim kowi kowh tawng iawng mih uanh paw enni nacham kurla kown nadowi. Nami ni kowi dow lup paw enni nachang kown nadowi. Tanai Ni dow chimsaima enni nasunah kown. Mami ana dow enni pipu-uüa kowi paw ang peah khowk chekhai. <verse eid="JER 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23" />Tawkche enni kowh pipu-uüa dow ang laiklow sünta dowi, ching paw pe büah dowi chekhai. Amatni dow saktuak akhawtma changah khai. Amatni kowi dow ang ripah khowk chowdiah. Tawkche tawngpaw mrawk dowi chekhai. Amatni dow ang kowh tawng iawng mih laiklow paw chün dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24" />“‘Nachenganchepaw enni che ang laiklow kaneuma sünta khai, Tanai Ni khe che marow tapplawt iawng uang changla kurdik dowi, now cham chang lup dowi kowi Tanai Ni che chimsaima enni sunah khai hanow <verse eid="JER 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25" />enni kowh manguüa dow mang David kowh mang chowm rah kowi chowm se nakruitown pren kown. Now amatni, amatni kowh maru iukuüa, Juda maru-uüa hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa dow kawrnga kari hai kawrnga hown marow tapplawt iawng nauang mang nauang kat kown. Mami marow dow katpaw akhaw aklaima nauowi kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26" />Juda pren kowi kowh marow maten hownia maru kawmuüa dow Jerusalem marow kowi nauang kown. Jerusalem riaret kowi kowh kua hownia, Benjamin süng hownia, hungma mawngma süng hownia, laina süng hownia hai Negeb süng hownia maru kawmuüa mih Jerusalem marow kowi nauang kown. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi tikah mih uanap, tawncher phuchua, kawmdi uanap, nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa hai awmrawm lai tek müa uanap nauang pawla kown. <verse eid="JER 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27" />Tawkche enni che ang kowh laiklow chün dowi, Tanai Ni paw ang vüi kowi chimsaima enni sunah dowi, now nami ni khe Jerusalem marow tapplawt lak kowi uang kupla kurdik khai hanow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh tapplawt maten ang natowkta kown. Now nakowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün ang natowkta bowk kown. Nami maih dow amiapaw naia mit kown nadowi,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18" />
  <para style="s">Bawn hown kowh uanh thawp mih maru kim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow Jeremia tut-e maiawng uang ting khai, <verse eid="JER 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2" />“Awr rü hanow bawn hown kowh uanh thawp mih maru kim kowi kowkowi diah. Nakowi en kowting khe ang naklang en kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3" />Naiawng rakowi ang dow bawn hown kowh uanh thawp mih maru kim kowi kowkowi khai. Nakhowk khe nami maru dow lawngkua kowi bawn hown hawt chang lup thüm chekhai. <verse eid="JER 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4" />Tawkche bawn hown kowh aia thawpah mih puh dow aia nau iawng phaw dowi rakowi aia piakta khai. Now nami bawn hown aia nau iawng plan thawpla puh lowk khai.<verse eid="JER 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow mih ang tut-e uang ting khai. CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, <verse eid="JER 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, ‘Aw Israeluüa, nami bawn hown kowh uanh thawp mih maru iawng ang nowng chang enni dowi tham pabow? Aw Israeluüa, bawn hown kowh uanh thawp mih maru rut kowi kowh bawn iawng enni dow ang rut kowi uowi khai. <verse eid="JER 18:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JER 18:7-8" />Maiawng mih khin uang ting chepaw naia kown. Nami khin khe dow chenchapuüa kowi hai prenchakuüa kowi aprün hailawm singh chawi iawng nachawiah kown mih hai napiakah kown mih laiklow ang natek kown. Tawkche nakhowk khe amatni che naiawngün laiklow tata hanow angak hownia uang plan mih prenchak hai chenchapuüa luk kowi ang khowm bowkta mih ripra ang nauang pe tingah kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 18:7-8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="JER 18:9-10" />Now tawngbak mih chenchap hai prenchak kowi naiuk nasownah kownkow hai aiung nachangah kownkow ang phuang chepaw naia kown. Tawkchedow amatni che ang laiklow sünta dowi, now ang pur kowi chang angak khai hanow amatni kowi nachangah iung kownkow ang tekta mih dow ang nachang pe kown nadowi,’ pape diah.<verse eid="JER 18:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11" />“Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih Judauüa hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowi ang CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow maiawng kowtek pe diah, ‘Sünta büa diah, enni vüi kowi phih hai kingküara ang kamrütta enni hüah khowk. Naiawng rakowi lup ngak chang hownia uang plan büa diah, enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang klowita büa diah, now lup iung chang büa diah,’ pape diah. <verse eid="JER 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12" />Tawkche amatni natek en kown mih, ‘Naiawng en tek anging chepaw anging nasünta kown nadowi. Anging sangkrangta iawng anging nachang kown. Anging chowlowkkow saktuak ngak iawng anging nauowi reng kown,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">“Ang kowh chama malauüa Israel dow suiiai kaniaima mih lup ngak chang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:13">naiawng mih lup ngak nami dowi rawn khe chang mih ta ne chünchü akeng chenchapuüa tut-e krawi lünta madiah.<verse eid="JER 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14" />Lebanawn süng kowi kowh nangkhe ter tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:14">Hungh hownia kowh uang hawr mih tui kang kakat tak bow?<verse eid="JER 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15" />Tawkche ang maru-uüa dow tamata ang büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">now asung uowi dowi mih arup aren kowi nam iungma mih maikhük cham towk büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Amatni dow amatni kowh tiama nowm hownia tatheu hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">tiama prim kowi mang büa dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Amatni dow tiama iung auarma mih kowi towta hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">tiama ngak abiuchow kowi mang büa khai.<verse eid="JER 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh pren dow apiaknama mih laih iawng naphaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">nami pren dow suiiai kaniaima mih uanh iawng naphaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">Nami pren iawng kowmang miuüa dow naawda kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">amatni dow awda rakowi nalekla lu büah kown.<verse eid="JER 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17" />Amatni kowi dow ransu-uüa pur kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:17">satlawt li uang khe kowh iawng ang nauetah plawt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">Amatni kla phih mih khin khe ang nadangta pe kung kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremia kowi ransu-uüa kingküaah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18" />Nakhowk khe ransu-uüa tek mih, “Chu, Jeremia kowi kingküala kown mih prengia a-i thawp lah. A-i tut-e uamowuüa, chanlai miuüa hai risiuüa akawmma uowi chekhai. Aia kowh tüngsangra lai, prengia lai hai risi laiklow a-i lakke dowi. Chu, aia lawnguan kowi a-i krawi uet nang ngak lah, now aia krawi tek mih maten a-i nuata lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh laiklow sünta diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:19">Ang ransu-uüa ang lawnguan kowi tawng chow tek mih pe ching diah.<verse eid="JER 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20" />Ang dow amatni kowi aiung hown ang klangah reng chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">Tawkche amatni dow sai ang kownkow thai ang kuam khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">Tuakah diah, en pur kowi iowngah now amatni vüi ang tek lai khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">nami dow en kowh kunmaraura amatni luk kowi hauang pacham ting lah pakowh chekhai.<verse eid="JER 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh chauüa kowi dow khown hown pe kowngah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">ransu-uüa kowh saidawng hown pe kowngah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">Amatni kowh masi hawmh dow chah uowi dowi mih mamaimow iawng pacham phaw lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">amatni kowh kachakuüa hawmh dow rawka hown pacham kowng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">now amatni kowh klanguüa hawmh dow tasenra kowi kowh saidawng hown pacham kowng lah.<verse eid="JER 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22" />Amatni kowi dow uang chin pe ransu-uüa hanow uang senah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">nahanow amatni kowh kim hownia kar klow nata kown towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow khüm ang kownkow thai ang kuam büah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">now ang natasowkla kownkow chak ang leng büah khai.<verse eid="JER 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23" />Tawkche aw CHAKRAMANG, nakowngta ang kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">naiawng amatni sangkrang mih dow en tuk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Amatni kowh angak dow hangkow lawtta pe diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">now amatni kowh angak mih hangkow iawtta pe diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Amatni kowi dow en pur kowi pe piakah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">en kowh kunmaraura hown amatni kowi ripah diah.<verse eid="JER 18:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19" />
  <para style="s">Ateuma mih puh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Jeremia mih, “Bawn hown kowh uanh thawp sara tut-e kowi now kowran bawn puh lowk diah. Nami puh en kowran mih khin khe lawngtang aluchow hai uamow lawngtang kowi hawla pre sum ia diah. <verse eid="JER 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2" />Nami kung kowi dow Puh Teu Tapplawt kupra tiama re-e kowh Ben-Hinawm lawngrawi kowi kowkowi diah. Nakowi dow ang pe tek en mih laiklow kowtek diah. <verse eid="JER 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3" />En natek pe kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng: Aw Juda manguüa hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa, ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG, Israeluüa kowh Thurai laiklow sünta büa diah. Nami lawngrawi kowi dow ang nauang pawla phih kown, now nami laiklow ta miuüa dow kram kowh pikchu narü kown. <verse eid="JER 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa dow nuata ang khai, now amatni dow nami lawngrawi kowi akeng thuraiuüa chupiiara changla büah khai. Amatni dow amatni pipu-uüa hai Juda manguüa tukah dowi mih arup aren kowi cham towk nam iungma mih maikhük büah khai. Nami klen kowi amatni kowh chauüa hown paw chang phuchua büah khai. Naiawng hai nami arah dow aprek uowi dowi miuüa vi kangowh changah büah khai. <verse eid="JER 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5" />Amatni dow Baal thurai vüi arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara thawp lowk khai, now nami phuchuara kowi dow amatni kowh chauüa kowi nawmah büah khai. Tawkche naiawng nachang kown mih amatni kowi ang peah ana dowi chekhai. Naiawng natek kown mih sak kowi khowm ang ka tuak dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6" />Naiawng rakowi maiawng mih khin nauang ting kown. Nami khin khe dow mami arah kowi mih Tofet phuchuara pahai maru natek kown nadowi bowt, now Ben-Hinawm lawngrawi papaw natek kown nadowi bowt. Tawkche Maru Saira Lawngrawi padow maru natek bowt kown.<verse eid="JER 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7" />“‘Judauüa hai Jerusalem maru-uüa kowh sangkrangra dow mami arah kowi ang napiakta pe kown. Krawi paw asak kown nau miuüa kowi dow tasenra kowi ransu-uüa rut kowi ang nape kowngah kown, now amatni kowh uak dow uakling hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowi ang nape cha kown. <verse eid="JER 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8" />Nami Jerusalem marow dow ang napiakta kown, now ang nachangla rensi küakau kown. Nami marow ria iawng mang miuüa dow naiawng piak mih khi hanow nakram kown, now naprawng narenah kown. <verse eid="JER 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9" />Amatni kowi kowh saiah kown nau mih amatni kowh ransu-uüa dow amatni kowi narumta lut kown. Nami khin khe amatni dow chakkham uowi dowi rakowi amatni kowh chauüa kowi nacha büah kown, now amatni kowh kimping namkhetuüa kowi paw nacha büah kown,’ pape diah.<verse eid="JER 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="JER 19:10-11" />“Nami kung kowi dow en hown kowh tawi uowi mih lawngtanguüa pur kowi nami bawn puh mih en nateuah iawm kown. Nakhowk khe amatni kowi maiawng en natek pe kown: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Nami teuta mih puh nowng chawk dowi mih iawng Juda maru-uüa kowi dow ang napiakta nak kown. Tofet süng uowi mowr amatni kowh uak dow maru nadupah kown. <verse eid="JER 19:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12" />Nami marow hai nakowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi dow Tofet kowi iawng ang napiakah kown. <verse eid="JER 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13" />Jerusalem kowi kowh kim maten hai Juda manguüa kowh kim ün dow Tofet iawng sürlawkma naphaw kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh kimluk kowi dow sat, lama hai krek vüi kowi nam iungma mih maikhük towk büah khai, now akeng thurai vüi kowi hüngah mih uanap paw chang büa khai,’ pakhai,” pape diah.<verse eid="JER 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14" />Nami kung kowi Jeremia dow Tofet hownia uang mang khai bowt. Jeremia kowi nakowi CHAKRAMANG kowchinah mih dow aia kowh laiklow nakowtek kownkow chekhai. CHAKRAMANG kim viadawng kowi awr iowngah hanow maru kawmuüa kowi Jeremia tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15" />“Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Sünta büa diah, Jerusalem marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten luk kowi phih uang kla kown mih lawnguan kowi ang tekta khowk iawng nauang phaw kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow saktuak khawtma uowi khai, now ang laiklow sünta dowi chekhai,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 19:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20" />
  <para style="s">Jeremia kowi uamow Pasur bawpah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1" />CHAKRAMANG chup kim re-e risi iawng Jeremia krawi tek lai mih khin khe Imer chapa Pasur dow tawi ta khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi kowh uamow lang kri mih chekhai. <verse eid="JER 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2" />Aia dow risi Jeremia kowi bawpah khai, now CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi kowh Benjamin tapplawt re-e kowh arah lowngma mih kangchawngra kim lak kowi tawmta hüah khai. <verse eid="JER 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3" />Auai ni khe Pasur dow Jeremia kowi uang latta khai. Nakhowk khe Pasur kowi Jeremia tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG mih klowita en ming khai bowt. Pasur pami takcha kawmat dow en ming mih Magawr-Misabib chowbowt. Auan dow ‘Aria aret kowi kramra kangowh’ pami chekhai. <verse eid="JER 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘En kowi dow en matia tut-e hai en auiuauüa tut-e kramra uowima mih maru ang nachang en kown. Tasenra kowi ransu-uüa rut kowi Judauüa kowng mih en nakhi kown. Judauüa maten kowi dow Babulawn pren mang rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Amatni kowi dow aia mih Babulawn pren kowi napawla kown, now pawla dowi miuüa kowi dow aia nasaita kown. <verse eid="JER 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5" />Nami klen kowi mami marow kowi kowh luprak, asung khakma mih uanh hai Juda manguüa kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kim kowi kowh uanh maten dow ang napawta pe kown, now naiawngün dawngthawnguan dow amatni kowh ransu Babulawnuüa rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Amatni dow naiawngün dawngthawnguan mih Babulawn pren kowi napawla kown. <verse eid="JER 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6" />Aw Pasur, en kowi hai en kimchakuüa maten kowi khümla now Babulawn pren kowi ang napawla enni kown. Nakowi dow en nakowng hanow nadup en kown. Nami klen kowi en daiah mih en kowh auiuauüa paw en iawng napiak kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG tut-e Jeremia chawk lai mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kuan ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">now ang lak-e en lang kür khai rakowi en awng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">Ang dow ni chut maru kowh rensi küakau chowng khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">Naiawng rakowi ang kowi dow maru maten prawngren ang khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8" />Ang tek laiklow mih khin khe irsira lawnguan kowi ang phuang reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">now piakra lawnguan kowi paw atünma ang phuang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">Naiawng CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow ang krawi tek reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">Naiawng rakowi atungma maru pe ang rukrai hai prawngren ang khai.<verse eid="JER 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9" />“CHAKRAMANG ming ang rük dowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">now CHAKRAMANG ming hown paw ang krawi tek lai dowi bowt,” pahai ang tek chepaw naia kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">Tawkche aia kowh laiklow dow ang sak kowi maih iawng lün pluplup khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">nami dow hut kowi paw maih iawng lün pluplup khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">Aia kowh laiklow dow sak kowi ang towah rengreng kowh ang kawm khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">Nami dow ang sak kowi ang ia tow dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JER 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10" />Ang lawnguan kowi maru kawmuüa ku tatek laisin mih ang ta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">naiawngün laiklow mih ang ta hanow ang kram khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Ang auiuauüa paw kingküa ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">amatni dow ang natim kown mih kowi chawng büah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Amatni tatek mih, “Chu, aia dow angakma mih lup chang khai pahai a-i küa dai lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">naiawng che a-i chang hanow aia kowi a-i naiata kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">now a-i naia sat klai kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11" />Tawkche CHAKRAMANG dow tasen kiakma mih maru iawng tawi uowila ang reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">naiawng rakowi chang ang nowng powng miuüa dow natatheu kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">now amatni dow nasum kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Amatni dow sum hanow narukrai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">amatni ka rukrai mih dow amiapaw natamata kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12" />Aw mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">en dow achinawmma miuüa kowi chaingah reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">now maru sak hai saktuak dow en tuk bowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">Ang kowh ransu-uüa luk kowi en sat klai mih dow pe khi ang diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en tut-e uang chawk lai khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13" />CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi tek meng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:13">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">Aia dow maru ngakuüa rut hownia ngarai miuüa kowi lawngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14" />Ang uang dia mih ni dow pacham ka piati lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:14">au uang pen ang mih ni dow prasira hang pacham uowi lah.<verse eid="JER 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15" />“En ka chapa lowk ia khowk,” pami satang hown</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:15">apa kowi pe awmrawmah mih maru dow pacham ka piati lah.<verse eid="JER 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16" />Nami maru dow CHAKRAMANG saksing sanaah dowi kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">piakta mih marow iawng pacham phaw lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">Aia dow rau-e khe pacham ta kar klow lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">now sat downg khe dow tasen khe kowh maru hek klow plak klow pacham ta lah.<verse eid="JER 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow mu lak kowi ang uowi reng tak khe kowngta ang dowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:17">kowngta ang khai panü ang kowh tadupra mih au mu lak kowi towbowt diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:17">now katpaw ang uang dia dowi bowt tham diah.<verse eid="JER 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18" />Kratra hai ngarera nakhi kownkow tawngplawng kowchow mu lak hownia ang uang tuk dia khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">Mami lusa kowi ang khi mih srui dow krat pusara kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">now ang kowh chownglawng nachur kown mih dow kratra hai rukraira hown chekhai.<verse eid="JER 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21" />
  <para style="s">Mang Zedekia kowh laiklow Thurai nuata pe mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow risi Jeremia tut-e uang ting khai. Nami khin khe mang Zedekia dow Pasur hai uamow Zefania iüah kowi maiawng nakowtek pe kownkow Jeremia tut-e kowchinah khai. Pasur dow Malkija kowh chapa chekhai, now uamow Zefania dow Maseia chapa chekhai. Amatchi dow Jeremia kowi tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2" />“Babulawn pren mang dow uang sen anging khai. Naiawng rakowi en mih anging vüi kowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü anging khowng diah. CHAKRAMANG dow auown khe kowh iawng anging vüi natüng anging awdara lup chepaw naia kown. Aia dow Babulawn pren mang uang sen anging mih taingta anging chepaw naia kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3" />Amatchi kowi Jeremia tek pe mih, “Mang Zedekia tut-e kowplan hanow maiawng kowtek pe diah: <verse eid="JER 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Babulawn mang hai aia kowh siphaiuüa hown en natasenla kown mih en kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng asung uowi dowi iawng ang nachangta en kown. Naiawngün ransu-uüa kowi dow marow kowi arasang ang nakuaah kown. <verse eid="JER 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5" />En kowi dow ang kowh akürma mih rut parah khükhü ang sak-ih dowi mih hown, ang kowh kunmaraura matiow hown ang nasen en kown. <verse eid="JER 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6" />Now mami marow kowi kowh uowi mih maru hai tawncher kowi dow makowng hawi hown ang napiakta bowk kown. <verse eid="JER 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7" />Now nami makowng hawi, tasen hai khown hown kowh tawi kowng dowi mih Juda pren mang, aia kowh maru iukuüa hai nami marow kowi kowh maru maten kowi dow Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar rut kowi hai amatni kowi kowngta kown nau mih ransu-uüa rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Amatni kowi dow mang Nebuknezar mih nasaiah kown. Aia dow amatni kowi mapaw nasaksing sanaah kown nadowi. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8" />Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Maru kawmuüa kowi maiawng tek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Sünta büa diah, enni pur kowi dow masing tiama hai makowng tiama ang towta enni khowk. <verse eid="JER 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9" />Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow tasenra kowi lah, khown hown lah, makowng hawi hown lah nakowng kown. Tawkche marow uat kowi lawt hanow amatni kowi kowh senah mih Babulawnuüa tut-e kowtaap mih dow nasing kown. Amatni kowh asak dow naplai kown. <verse eid="JER 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10" />Ang dow mami marow kowi aiung nadowi kowi angak nachang kown mih ang khowm bowkta khowk. Mami marow dow Babulawn pren mang rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Aia dow nami marow mih maih hown towkah kown,’ pape khai.<verse eid="JER 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11" />“Nami klen kowi Juda pren kowi kowh mang krungchakuüa kowi paw mami ang kowh laiklow pe süntaah diah. Ang tek mih,<verse eid="JER 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12" />“‘Aw David krungchakuüa, ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">enni mih rau towng chet tara nowm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">now maru pawta pe dawngthawnguan miuüa kowi nowng chang miuüa rut hownia lawngah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">Naiawng enni chang dowi now enni kowh lup ngak rakowi ang kowh kunmaraura nalün pluplup kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">Nami kunmaraura maih iawng lün pluplup mih dow amiapaw nanowng mit kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13" />“‘Aw Jerusalem, en dow lawngrawi luk kowi kowh hungh chut iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">en dow anaima mih arah luk kowi kowh tachowm hüah mih hua iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">Nachenganchepaw en kowi mih ang nakingküa en kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">En tek mih, “Miapaw uang ia kingküa ang kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">now ang kowh tatung tanimra kowi miapaw uang nowng kup kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14" />Tawkche en chang lup ngak rakowi ang narip en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:14">en kowh süng ün dow maih hown ang natowkta en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:14">now nami maih dow en riaret kowi uowi mih maten nakamta en bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:14">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 21:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22" />
  <para style="s">Mang ngakma miuüa kowh tara chet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1" />CHAKRAMANG mih Juda kowi kowh mang kim kowi kowchin ang hanow mami satang kowpe phowng ang khai: <verse eid="JER 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2" />“Aw David kowh mang chowm rah kowi chowm mih Juda pren mang, en, en kowh maru iukuüa hai Jerusalem tapplawt iawng uang miuüa maten CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta büa diah. <verse eid="JER 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Anowmma mih hai anama mih lup chang büa diah. Maru pawta pe dawngthawnguan mih maru kowi nowng chang powng chang miuüa rut hownia lawngah büa diah. Prenlang maru-uüa, saratchowuüa hai mamaimowuüa luk kowi hang chang anowng apowng büa diah, now nami Jerusalem marow kowi kowh aprek uowi dowi mih maru-uüa kowi hangkow sai büa diah. <verse eid="JER 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4" />Naiawngün ana che enni chün khai hanow enni kowh manguüa mih mang David kowh mang chowm rah hownia naia kruitown pren kown. Now enni kowh manguüa mih amatni kowh maru iukuüa hown, iawngpa mih maru-uüa hown, kawrnga kari hai kawrnga hown nami Jerusalem marow tapplawt iawng mang kim kowi nauang kup büah kown. <verse eid="JER 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5" />Tawkche ang kowh ana che enni chün dowi hanow mami mang kim dow natapiak kown. Mami laiklow mih ang CHAKRAMANG ang ming lüklau se ang takham khowk,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6" />Juda pren kowi kowh mang kim lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">“Ang tut-e en mih Gilead süng iawng hai Lebanawn hungh chut iawng chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:6">süngrüp süngkangma hai apiaknama mih marow iawng ang nachang en kown.<verse eid="JER 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7" />Napiak en kownkow ransu-uüa kowi ang nauang chin en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:7">naiawngün ransu-uüa rut kowi dow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng nauowi bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">Amatni dow en kowh aiung aiungma mih sidar singh ün nakripta en hanow natowkta en kown.<verse eid="JER 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8" />“Nami marow ria iawng kowmang kowkat mih khin khe prenlang maru-uüa dow lowkkowlowk natalünta kown mih, ‘Tawngplawng kowchow mami kri kraingma mih marow kowi maiawng CHAKRAMANG tuk changah khai?’ napa kown. <verse eid="JER 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi akeng maru-uüa naklangah kown mih, ‘Naiawng phaw mih dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai sangbowk laitawm nuata hanow akeng thurai kowi cham tawi chupiiara kowi chekhai,’ napape kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Jehoahaz lawnguan kowi Jeremia kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10" />Mang Josia kowng mih vüi kowi hangkow kar büa tham bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">nami lak-e mang Jehoahaz vüi kowi phai kar büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow prenlang kowi cham takhang khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">aia dow katpaw nauang plan kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">now aia kowh dia rah pren paw aia nakhi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JER 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11" />Josia kowh chapa dow Salum chekhai. Salum kowh ming uowi lowk tak mih dow Jehoahaz chekhai. Aia dow a-pa kowng kung kowi Juda pren kowi ta chowm mang khai. Tawkche aia dow Jerusalem marow hownia powt khai. Naiawng rakowi aia lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aia dow katpaw nauang plan kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12" />Aia dow aia cham takhangra kowi nakowng kown. Mami pren dow aia nauang khi kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Jehoiakim lawnguan kowi Jeremia kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Mang Jehoiakim chowng kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow lup ngak chang hown kowh tangka hown thawp kim khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">Krawi ling krawi kuanla mih tangka pawisa hown aia dow krowngla kim khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">aia dow nami kim mih maru-uüa kowi peah akha dowi kowi kür hown pe changah khai.<verse eid="JER 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14" />Maiawng tek mih maru luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">Aia dow, ‘Ang matia vüi kim iukma ang nathawp lowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">nami kimkrowng luk kowi dow towklak aiukma ang nathawp pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Nami towklak kowi dow tawngpawk aiukma ang nachang pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">nami tawngpawk kep müa ün dow sidar singh ang nangen pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">now aringma mih rawng ang nasowah kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15" />Sidar singh ahuma hown en chang kim khai pache</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">akeng mang lak-e en lang iung khai pabow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">En pa Josia dow aiungma mih chakkham cha reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">aia dow anowmma hai anama mih lup chang reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Naiawng rakowi aia chowm mang mih khin khe lup maten aiungma phaw khai.<verse eid="JER 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16" />Aia dow ngarai miuüa hai akhawr hown uowi miuüa kowi tangila rakowi aiungma uowi reng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">CHAKRAMANG kowi tuk pami dow naiawng chang mih chekhai.<verse eid="JER 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17" />Tawkche en kowh mik hai sak dow lup ngak chang hown naka kown mih prakowi kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">now achinawmma mih maru kowi nasai kown mih prakowi kangowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">Nami klen kowi nakrawi chang nowng kown mih prakowi kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">now kür hown nakrawi rup maru uanh kown mih prakowi kangowh chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18" />Naiawng rakowi Juda pren mang Josia kowh chapa Jehoiakim lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">“Mang Jehoiakim vüi auiua kowi iawng maru nanguk nakar pe kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">maru kawmuüa mih amatni kowh mang vüi kowi nakar nanguk kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19" />Jehoiakim kowi dow kawrngaramchük kowi dupah iawng maru nadupah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:19">aia kowi dow küngla now Jerusalem marow tapplawt uat kowi nacham kuakah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem maru-uüa ka ripra mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Jerusalem, Lebanawn hungh kowi atünma kowkar diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:20">Basan hai Abarim kowi kowkowi hanow kowkar diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh auiuauüa mih piak bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21" />Aiungma en uowi mih khin khe nauowi kaneu kown mih ang tek en khowk chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:21">Tawkche en tek mih, ‘Ang sünta kown nadowi,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">En dow en klanguüa tadowklowt hownia ang laiklow en sünta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22" />En kowi dow li uang khe kowh iawng alenma ang nauang rip en kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">nami li dow en kowh aluchowuüa kowi nacham rownla bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">now en kowh auiuauüa dow akeng pren kowi nacham takhang bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">Nakhowk khe en kowh lup ngak rakowi en narukrai kown.<verse eid="JER 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23" />Aw Lebanawn hungh kowi kowh sidar singh hown thawpah mih kim kowi uowi mih maru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:23">en luk kowi dow penchow kimuowi mu rau iawng mih ngarera nauang ting kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">Nami khin khe dow lainowmma en napla kown!” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoiakhin kowi CHAKRAMANG ripah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Juda pren mang Jehoiakim kowh chapa Jehoiakhin, ang ming lüklau se ang tek khowk, ang hawmlawm rut kowi kowh mur tuk müa rutbüt en chowng chepaw ang naklüpta en hanow nakuakta en kown. <verse eid="JER 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25" />En kowi dow paw en asak kownkow en kramah mih Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar rut kowi hai Babulawn prenchakuüa rut kowi ang naap en kown. <verse eid="JER 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26" />En hai en u enchi kowi dow akeng pren kowi ang nacham kuakta enchi kown. Nami pren kowi dow amiapaw enchi dia dowi chekhai. Enchi dow nami pren kowi nakowng kown. <verse eid="JER 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27" />Enchi uang planah kown nau mih pren kowi dow katpaw enchi nauang ia plan kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28" />Jehoiakin dow teu kowh kuakta mih puh iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">aia dow maru nauah dowi mih puh iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">Tawngplawng kowchow Jehoiakin hai aia kimchakuüa kowi nakuakta kown?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">Tawngplawng kowchow amatni kowi akeng pren kowi nacham kuakta kown?<verse eid="JER 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29" />Aw prenchakuüa, prenchakuüa, prenchakuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:29">CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta diah.<verse eid="JER 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Jehoiakhin lawnguan kowi kowh naiawngün laiklow mih ruiah diah:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">Aia dow ka chah dowi mih maru iawng nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">aia chownglawng kowi dow katpaw aiungma naphaw kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">now aia kowh chauüa dow mang David kowh mang chowm rah kowi katpaw naia chowm kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23" />
  <para style="s">Achinawmma mih Mia Prek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ruapur hawmh iawng mih ang kowh maru kowi piak mih hai cham setta plawt mih kruitown miuüa kowh piakra dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow aia maru-uüa kowh kruitown miuüa lawnguan kowi tek mih, “Enni dow ang kowh ruapur hawmh iawng mih maru-uüa kowi setta plawt khai, now amatni kowi enni prütah khai. Amatni kowi dow enni mingkhetah kaneu dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang narip enni kown. <verse eid="JER 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3" />Tawkche ang cham setta plawt mih pren hownia ang kowh maru-uüa kowi dow amatni kowh tawkra süng kowi ang nauang pawla kown. Nakowi dow amatni krungchak naprung kown, now amatni maru iun dow ahuma nauang phaw kown. <verse eid="JER 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4" />Amatni kowi dow naming nakhetah kownkow ang natow pe kruitown miuüa kown. Nahanow ang kowh ruapur hawmh dow nakram kown nadowi bowt, amatni dow amawlawma naphaw kown nadowi bowt, now natamata ang büah kown nadowi bowt. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Maiawng mih khin nauang ting kown. Nami khin khe dow David krungchak hownia Achinawmma mih Mia Prek kowi ang nape chowmah mang kown. Aia dow prengia hown nakruitown pren kown, now pren kowi anowmma hai anama nachang lup kown. <verse eid="JER 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6" />Nami khin khe Judauüa dow naka lawngra kown, now Israeluüa dow athaulangma nauowi kown. Aia kowi dow, ‘CHAKRAMANG dow anging kowh tachi tanawmra chekhai,’ pahai maru nahawah kown.<verse eid="JER 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7" />“Maiawng mih khin nauang ting kown. Nami khin khe dow, ‘Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi uang lawtla mih masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang tek khowk,’ pami maru natek kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8" />Nami takcha amatni dow natek kown mih, ‘Mrawkphak pra kowh pren hai akeng pren kowi cham prütta mih hownia Israeluüa kowi uang pawla iawk mih masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang tek khowk,’ napa kown. Nami kung kowi amatni dow amatni chowlowkkow pren kowi nauowi büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Risi iuauüa napiak kown mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9" />Risiuüa kowi napiakah kown mih lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tekah mih laiklow ta hanow lainowmma ang sak piak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">now ang kowh hut maten chür nukluk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Nami CHAKRAMANG kowh chimsaima mih laiklow rakowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">ang dow khamta grep tui kak kowh pua dikma mih maru iawng phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10" />Pren kowi dow iang chang miuüa tek khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">ka piati rakowi pren dow uowila uiting uangtak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">now süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh dowm dow akang khawngma phaw khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">Maru kawmuüa dow angakma mih tiama kowi mang khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">amatni kowh nowng changra dow angak prakowi tawngah büah khai.<verse eid="JER 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Risi hai uamowuüa mih ringkaw hai kram ang dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:11">amatni kowh angak dow ang kim kowi pat ang khi khai.<verse eid="JER 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh tiama dow aklaima hai aiiuma ang nachang pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">nahanow amatni dow nakowi natim kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">Amatni ka ripra mih khin khe amatni luk kowi ang nauang pawla pe phih kown.<verse eid="JER 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13" />Samari kowi kowh risiuüa dow suiiai kaniaima mih lup chang mih ang khi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:13">amatni dow Baal thurai ming hown risi iawng krawi tek dai lai khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">Naiawng rakowi ang maru Israeluüa dow ang hownia alakma kowi powtta ang khai.<verse eid="JER 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14" />Nami klen kowi Jerusalem marow kowi kowh risiuüa kramra uowima mih lup ngak chang mih ang khi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">amatni dow chang iang khai, now krawi dai maru khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Amatni dow angak chang miuüa kowi tawi peah sakkhawtra khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">naiawng rakowi chang ngak miuüa dow angak hownia amiapaw uang plan dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Amatni dow chang lup ngak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">amatni dow Sawdawm hai Gawmawra maru-uüa iawng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15" />Naiawng rakowi risiuüa lawnguan kowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">“Amatni kowi dow akhakma mih chakkham ang nape chaah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">now akru uowima mih tui ang nape khamah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh risiuüa kowh angak dow paprenma kowi krawi tauet khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16" />Aia maru-uüa kowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Risiuüa tekah mih laiklow hangkow sünta büa diah. Amatni dow dai lai hown pe enni sakowmra khai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow ta kowh tek enni mih nadowi chekhai. Amatni krawi tek enni mih dow sakdawng hownia kowh amatni thawnah mih mukmang laiklow chekhai. <verse eid="JER 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17" />Ang kowh laiklow sui miuüa tut-e naiawngün risiuüa dow maiawng krawi tek khai: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Enni dow thaulangma nauowi kown’ pakhai. Now saktuak akhawtma hown uowi miuüa kowi amatni tek pe mih, ‘Enni nakla phih kown nadowi,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18" />Tawkche naiawngün risiuüa mih CHAKRAMANG laiklow nasünta hai natukta kownkow amiapaw aia pur kowi iowng dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:18">now aia kowh laiklow kowi miapaw pe param dowi hai miapaw pe ching dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19" />Sünta, CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura dow liku iawng maru ngak luk kowi nauang kla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:19">now nami dow liku uangchak iawng amatni luk kowi nauang kla kown.<verse eid="JER 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20" />Ang kowh kunmaraura dow sak ta-ih iawng changta dowi mowr naprowng kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">Nami dow pur prakowi achima enni natuk kown.<verse eid="JER 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Naiawngün risiuüa kowi ang chinah dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow amatni sak nau iawng krawi küa dai khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:21">Amatni kowi dow ang pe tekah laiklow dowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">Nachenganchepaw amatni dow risi iawng krawi tek lai khai.<verse eid="JER 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22" />Amatni che ang pur kowi uang iowng khai e dow ang kowh laiklow ang maru-uüa tut-e amatni nakowtek diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:22">now amatni kowh tiama ngak hownia ang maru-uüa mih nauang plan diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang dow atawnchow mih Thurai paw na chekhai, now alakma mih Thurai paw na chekhai. <verse eid="JER 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24" />Ang khi-ah dowi mih arah kowi amiapaw nowngia tapet dowi chekhai. Ang dow mukuang pren hai lusa kowi kowh bowkbowk mih arah kowi krawi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25" />“Ang ming hown kowh krawi dai mih risiuüa kowh laiklow dow ang ta khowk chekhai. Amatni tek mih, ‘Ang khi mang lowk, ang khi mang lowk,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JER 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26" />Mün ni tak chow naiawngün risiuüa amatni saktuak hown nakrawi dai maru kown? <verse eid="JER 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27" />Amatni kowh pipu-uüa dow Baal thurai kowi cham chupiia mih hownia tamata ang büah khai. Nami iawng ang maru-uüa paw pacham tamata ang lah pakowh naiawngün risiuüa dow amatni kowi dai lai mukmang hown nakuanah kown mih sangkrang büah khai. <verse eid="JER 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28" />Khi mang miuüa dow amatni khi-ah mih mang iawng pacham tek lah. Tawkche ang laiklow ta miuüa dow kaah sakowmma hown ang kowh laiklow pacham tek lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow chama hai chahau dow alangma chekhai. <verse eid="JER 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29" />Ang kowh laiklow dow maih iawng nadowi bow? Ang kowh laiklow dow bawpla hua reng mih matul iawng nadowi bow?<verse eid="JER 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30" />“Akeng mih maru hownia kuah mih laiklow ang kowh laiklow pahai krawi phuang mih uowi. Naiawng mih maru-uüa kowi dow ang nakingküaah kown. <verse eid="JER 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31" />Amatni kowh laiklow kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow pahai küa dai mih risiuüa kowi dow ang nakingküaah kown. <verse eid="JER 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32" />Krawi tek dai lai mang mih risiuüa kowi dow ang nakingküaah kown. Amatni dow abawrima hown krawi tek dai lai hanow ang kowh maru-uüa kowi angak tiama prakowi pawla khai. Tawkche amatni kowi dow ang chinah mih nadowi, now naiawng nakrawi tek kown mih paw ang peah ana dowi chekhai. Amatni dow Judauüa kowi tawng iawng paw naia khowng kown nadowi. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33" />“Maru-uüa, risiuüa hai uamowuüa nalünta en kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG tawng chow tek en?’ Napa kown. Nakhowk khe amatni kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Enni dow ang kowh kurdik chekhai, now nami kurdik dow ang hownia ang nakuakta kown,” pape diah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JER 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34" />Risi, uamow hai maru-uüa mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow anging vüi kurdik chowtaih,’ pahai tek chepaw naia. Tawkche naiawng tek mih maru kowi hai aia kimchak kowi dow ang naripah kown.<verse eid="JER 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35" />“Nami takcha amatni bowkbowk dow amatni kowh auiuauüa hai tasin taken miuüa kowi nalüntaah kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG tawng iawng chow klang enni? Tawng chow aia tek enni?’ napape kown. <verse eid="JER 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36" />Naiawng rakowi, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow anging vüi kurdik chowtaih,’ pahai katpaw natek büah kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow lusa maru dow kowmatia kowh laiklow kowi changla Thurai kowh laiklow khai. Naiawng hai mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG masing Thurai kowh laiklow dow enni klowiah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Risi iawng krawi tek lai mih maru kowi en lüntaah kown mih, ‘Tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG klang en? Tawng iawng chow aia tek en?’ pape diah.<verse eid="JER 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38" />“Naiawng chepaw amatni che ang hangah mih kowi chün dowi kowi, ‘Mami dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow chekhai,’ pahai kham khai hanow <verse eid="JER 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39" />ang pur hownia amatni kowi ang nakuakta kown, now amatni hai amatni pipu-uüa kowi kowh ang peah mih marow paw ang napiakta kown. <verse eid="JER 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40" />Amatni luk kowi dow ang nauang pawla pe rukraira kown. Nami rukrai dow chowngchowng saksakma maru sak kowi nauowi reng kown, now katpaw natamata kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 23:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24" />
  <para style="s">Uidut uih kharang pre buk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1" />Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar dow Jehoiakim chapa mang Jehoiakhin, aia kowh maru iukuüa, uanh thawp sarauüa hai kuh hai tai hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa kowi Jerusalem marow hownia khümla now Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG dow pe khi ang mukmang lowk khai. Nami mukmang kowi dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim pur kowi uidut uih uowi pre kharang mih ang khi khai. <verse eid="JER 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2" />Nami pre kharang mih kowi lowk mih kharang kowi dow rik min mih uidut uih iawng aiungma chekhai, now alowk mih kharang kowi kowh uowi mih uidut uih dow akenama panow kaah achak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3" />CHAKRAMANG lünta ang mih, “Jeremia tawng chow en khi?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 24:3">Nakhowk khe ang klangah mih, “Uidut uih. Aiungma mih uidut uih dow aiungma chekhai, now angakma mih uidut uih dow nga krang kaah achak dowi mowr chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, <verse eid="JER 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk, Juda pren hownia Babulawn pren kowi ang cham pe takhangah miuüa kowi dow aiungma mih uidut uih iawng ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="JER 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6" />Amatni naiungla kownkow amatni kowi dow ang namüah kown, now amatni kowh pren kowi ang nauang pawla iawk kown. Amatni kowi dow ang naiuk nasownah kown, ang napiakah kown nadowi. Amatni kowi dow singh chowk iawng ang nachowkah kown, ang nachawiah kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7" />Amatni kowi dow ang CHAKRAMANG pami natukla kown mih saktuak ang napeah kown. Amatni dow ang kowh maru nachowng kown, now ang dow amatni kowh Thurai nachowng kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow saktuak maiow hown ang tut-e nauang plan kown.<verse eid="JER 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8" />“Tawkche Juda pren mang Zedekia, aia kowh maru iukuüa, Jerusalem maru-uüa hai Aigupta pren kowi kowh uowi mih Judauüa kowi dow kaah chak dowi mih angakma mih uidut uih iawng ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="JER 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9" />Amatni kowi dow ang cham prütah mih arah kowi kramra uowima mih maru iawng ang nachangah kown. Nahanow amatni kowi dow lusa maru maten nasak-hiaah kown, maru nakhare nichakah kown, maru nacham changla lai lawt kown, now amatni kowh ming hown maru nacham tape piati kown. <verse eid="JER 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10" />Amatni hai amatni pipu-uüa kowi ang peah mih pren kowi tapiak büah bowk dowi mowr amatni luk kowi tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi ang nauang chin pe kown. Nami pren kowi miapaw nata lat kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25" />
  <para style="s">Judauüa 70 ning cham takhang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1" />Judauüa lawnguan kowi kowh Thurai kowh laiklow mih Jeremia tut-e uang ting khai. Nami laiklow uang ting mih dow Juda pren kowi Josia chapa Jehoiakim chowm mang mih tali ning khe chekhai. Nakhowk khe Babulawn pren kowi Nebuknezar chowm mang mih dow paningchow taih tak chekhai. <verse eid="JER 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2" />Judauüa hai Jerusalem maru-uüa kowi risi Jeremia tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3" />“Juda pren kowi Amawn kowh chapa Josia chowm mang mih laisum ning hownia 23 ning mowr CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow mih ang tut-e uang ting khai. Nami laiklow dow plan plan ang tek enni khowk. Tawkche ang laiklow enni sünta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4" />“CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh nar risiuüa kowi plan plan uang chin enni khai. Tawkche naiawngün risiuüa laiklow enni sünta dowi chekhai, now ching paw enni pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow krawi tek mih, ‘Enni mih tiama ngak hai lup ngak hownia plan büa diah. Nahanow enni hai enni pipu-uüa kowi kowh ang peah mih pren kowi chowngchowng saksakma enni naka uowi kown. <verse eid="JER 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6" />Akeng thuraiuüa kowi nachupiia kown mih prakowi hang cham tawi krawi büa diah. Enni rut hown kowh enni thawpah mih uanh hown hauang towk ang kunmarau büa diah. Enni che towk ang kunmarau dowi hanow ang napiak enni kown nadowi,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7" />Jeremia plan tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Tawkche enni dow ang laiklow sünta dowi. Sünta lak dow enni rut hown kowh enni thawpah mih uanh hown enni towk ang kunmarau hanow enni matia luk kowi enni uang pawla piakra khai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8" />“Now kawmat dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Enni dow ang laiklow sünta dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9" />Naiawng rakowi tawngphak prakowi kowh chenchapuüa kowi hai ang nar Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar kowi ang nauang hawla pe kown. Mami pren hai aia kowh maru-uüa kowi nakingküaah kownkow hai aria aret kowi kowh chenchapuüa kowi nakingküaah kownkow amatni kowi dow ang nauang pawla pe kown. Naiawngün maru-uüa maten kowi dow asaima ang napiakta kown, now kramra uowima hai rensi küakau ang nachangah kown. Amatni kowh pren dow chowngchowng saksakma piaknama ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="JER 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10" />Now nami pren kowi kowh piaw klow, how klow, masi huaiu piaw klow hai mi tung klow ang narimta pe kown, now amatni kowh maibu nowi paw ang namitta pe kown. <verse eid="JER 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11" />Nami pren maten dow napiak bowk kown, now lainowmma kramra nauowi kown. Naiawngün chenchapuüa dow Babulawn pren mang tut-e 70 ning mowr nauowi nar kown. <verse eid="JER 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12" />Tawkche 70 ning chi kung kowi dow Babulawn pren mang hai aia chenchapuüa kowi amatni kowh angak rakowi ang naripah kown. Now Babulawn pren kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi apiaknama ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="JER 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13" />Babulawn pren kowi hai chenchap maten luk kowi ang nauang pawla piakra kown mih lawnguan dow risi Jeremia tek enni khowk. Naiawngün laiklow dow chabowih kowi arui uowi bowk khowk chekhai. Nami chabowih kowi kowh arui uowi iawng nami pren kowi ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="JER 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14" />Babulawnuüa kowi dow aiukma mih chenchapuüa hai kri kraingma mih manguüa nachangla nar kown; amatni kowi dow amatni chang angak mih iawng ang naripah kown,’ pakhai” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai kowh kunmaraura bia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek ang mih, “Ang hownia grep tui tek mawp mih bia paw diah. Nami grep tui dow ang kowh kunmaraura chekhai. Nami dow ang kowchin en mih chenchapuüa kowi pe khamah diah. <verse eid="JER 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16" />Amatni dow nami grep tui khamta hanow pua mih maru iawng natim bawilawi kown, now thuklama mih maru iawng nakrawi tek naklak kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni luk kowi dow tasenra ang nauang pawla pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG hownia dow grep tui atekma mih bia ang haipaw khai. Now aia chin ang mih chenchap tut-e ang kowkowi hanow amatni kowi dow nami grep tui ang pe khamah khai. <verse eid="JER 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18" />Nami grep tui dow Jerusalem marowchakuüa, Juda pren kowi kowh marowchakuüa, Juda pren manguüa hai maru iukuüa kowi ang pe khamah khai. Naiawng amatni kowi ang pe khamah mih dow ani hownia amatni luk kowi piakra, kramra, kharera hai piatira pauang cham ting lah pakowh chekhai. <verse eid="JER 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19" />Nami klen kowi Aigupta pren mang Faraw, aia kowh maru iukuüa, aia pren kowi kowh aluchowuüa hai aia kowh maru kowi paw nami grep tui mih ang pe khamah khai. <verse eid="JER 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20" />Aigupta kowi kowh prenlang maru-uüa, Uz pren manguüa hai Filistin pren kowi kowh Askelawn marow, Gaza marow, Ekrawn marow hai Asdawd marow manguüa kowi dow nami grep tui ang pe khamah khai. <verse eid="JER 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21" />Edawm prenchakuüa, Moab prenchakuüa hai Amawn prenchakuüa kowi ang pe khamah khai. <verse eid="JER 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22" />Tura pren mang, Sidawn pren manguüa hai sata paipra pown kowi kowh pren manguüa kowi paw ang pe khamah khai. <verse eid="JER 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23" />Dedan prenchakuüa, Tema prenchakuüa hai Buz prenchakuüa kowi paw ang pe khamah khai, now kep ngeupa sam miuüa kowi paw ang pe khamah khai. <verse eid="JER 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24" />Arab pren kowi kowh mang maten hai süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh prenlang mang maten kowi paw ang pe khamah khai. <verse eid="JER 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25" />Zimri pren, Elam pren hai Media pren manguüa kowi paw ang pe khamah khai. <verse eid="JER 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26" />Nami klen kowi tawngphak prakowi kowh atawnchow hai alakma uowi mih manguüa kowi paw ang pe khamah khai. Nami grep tui dow lusa kowi kowh uowi miuüa chenchap maten kowi ang pe khamah khai. Bowkbowk kung kowi Babulawn pren mang paw nami grep tui mih nakham kown.<verse eid="JER 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27" />Nami kung kowi dow cham krawi tek kownkow CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, “Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Enni tut-e ang nauang chin enni tasenra kown. Naiawng rakowi grep tui iawng mih ang kowh kunmaraura dow kham büa diah, pua büa diah, hük büa diah, tim büa diah, now hang rü büah tham bowt,’ pape diah. <verse eid="JER 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28" />Tawkche amatni mih en rut hownia nami grep tui kham kown nau dowi hanow maiawng tek pe diah, ‘Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih: Enni nakham ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="JER 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29" />Sünta, auown khe ang kowh marow kowi ang narik piakah kown, now enni kowi paw ang naripla enni kown. Enni dow naka ripra ngengche kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow lusa maru maten luk kowi ang nauang pawla tasenra kown. Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow tek khowk,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 25:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30" />“Kawmat dow amatni tut-e risi iawng kowtek laiklow diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">‘CHAKRAMANG dow mukuang hownia nauang iiu tüng klow kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">aia dow aia kowh chimsaima mih uowi rah hownia nauang iiu tüng klow kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">now aia prenchakuüa kowi nakingküa kownkow aia dow atünma natüng klow kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Küa grep uih khe kowh maru chang klow mih iawng atünma aia natüng klow kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">lusa kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi nakingküa kownkow atünma aia natüng klow kown.<verse eid="JER 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31" />Aia kowh klow dow prenchur nammowt hownia pat nata kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">chenchapuüa maten kowi aia mih napeah aprek kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">Aia dow maru maten kowi nachet pe tara kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">now maru ngakuüa kowi dow saidawng hown aia nasaiah kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">“Sünta, phih dow mami chenchap hownia alowk mih chenchap tut-e krawi tauet khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:32">Prenchur nammowt hownia dow liku uangchak iawng mih piakra tarowng khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG saita mih maru-uüa dow mami lusa mapra chur hownia paipra chur mowr natakuakla pan kown. Amatni vüi kowi amiapaw nauowila uiting uangtak kown nadowi. Amatni kowh uak dow amiapaw nakuaah kown nadowi, now dup paw nadupah kown nadowi. Tawkche amatni dow krawng kowi kowh takuakla pan mih chia kih iawng natakuakla pan kown.<verse eid="JER 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34" />Aw angakma mih ruapur thing miuüa, kar hai uowila uiting uangtak büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">aw aluchowuüa, se dawng kowi taiüa büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nasaita enni kown mih khin dow uang ting khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">enni dow klangiungma mih bia teu mih iawng natapiak nak kown.<verse eid="JER 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35" />Enni dow naia tapet kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:35">now powt paw enni naia powt kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36" />Ruapur thing miuüa kowh kar klow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:36">now aluchowuüa kowh kar meng tün sünta büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:36">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh ruapur thing rah süng dow CHAKRAMANG piakta pe nak khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37" />Athaulangma mih dowm ün dow apiaknama naown kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:37">nami dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura hown apiaknama mih süng iawng nauowi kown.<verse eid="JER 25:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38" />Aia kowh uowi rah hownia aia dow krangsi iawng nauang lawt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:38">CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmarau hai ransu-uüa kowh saidawng hown amatni kowh pren dow napiak kown.<verse eid="JER 25:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26" />
  <para style="s">Jeremia kowng ngialia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1" />Juda pren kowi Josia chapa Jehoiakim uown chowm mang mih ning khe CHAKRAMANG dow Jeremia kowi tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, ang kowh chupiiara kim viadawng kowi kowiowng diah. Now Juda kowi kowh marow maten hownia nauang chupiia ang kownkow ang kowh chup kim kowi uang mih ang kowh maru-uüa maten kowi ang pe tek en mih laiklow maten tek pe diah. Laiklow panawrchow paw hangkow itta diah. <verse eid="JER 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3" />Amatni dow nami laiklow nasünta chepaw naia kown, now amatni kowh angakma mih tiama hownia nauang plan chepaw naia kown. Amatni che uang plan hanow amatni kowh ngak rakowi ang khowm bowkta mih piakra dow ang nauang pe tingah kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4" />Amatni kowi dow maiawng en natek pe kown: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Enni dow ang laiklow sünta dowi chekhai, now enni pur kowi kowh ang towah mih ari aiang ün enni chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5" />Nami klen kowi ang nar risiuüa kowi dow enni tut-e plan plan ang uang chin enni khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh laiklow dow enni sünta dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6" />Naiawng che enni chang rengreng hanow nami Thurai chup kim dow Silo marow kowi ang piakah iawng ang napiakah kown, now lusa kowi kowh maru maten dow Jerusalem marow ming hown nacham tape piati kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7" />CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi naiawng Jeremia tek laiklow mih khin khe uamowuüa, risiuüa hai maru kawmuüa dow tawi sünta khai. <verse eid="JER 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8" />Tawkche aia ki tek lai kung kowi dow uamowuüa, risiuüa hai maru kawmuüa tek pe Jeremia mih, “En nakowng ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="JER 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9" />Tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG ming hown Silo marow piak iawng mami chup kim napiak kown mih en tuk tek khai? Tawngplawng kowchow nami Jerusalem marow napiak hanow akhaw aklaima nauowi kown mih en tuk tek khai?” pakhai. Naiawng tek rakowi maru kawmuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowh chup kim kowi Jeremia kowi mih rumta lut khai.<verse eid="JER 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10" />Naiawngün laiklow ta hanow Juda pren kowi kowh maru iukuüa dow mang kim hownia CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowkowi khai, now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kupla mih Tapplawt Sar tiaplawt re-e hawt chowm khai. <verse eid="JER 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11" />Nakhowk khe uamowuüa hai risiuüa dow nami maru iukuüa hai maru kawmuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Nami maru dow kowngla kown mih ripra kak taing chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow mami marow napiak kown mih lawnguan tek khai. Now naiawng aia tek mih dow enni matia param hown enni ta khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12" />Nakhowk khe Jeremia dow maru iukuüa hai maru kawmuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Mami kim hai mami marow lawnguan kowi kowh enni taah mih laiklow dow nauang tek kownkow CHAKRAMANG uang chin ang mih chekhai. <verse eid="JER 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang klingklaita büa diah, now lup iung chang büa diah. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai laiklow chün büa diah. Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni luk kowi aia nauang pawla enni piakra kownkow aia tekta khowk mih dow aia nachang kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14" />Sünta büa diah, ang dow enni rut kowi uowi hüah towbowt. Enni sak kowi iung iawng chang ang büah towbowt. <verse eid="JER 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15" />Tawkche enni che kowngta ang khai hanow aprek uowi dowi mih maru kowi enni kowngta mih ripra enni luk kowi, mami marow luk kowi hai makowi kowh uowi miuüa luk kowi nauang ting ngengche kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün laiklow enni tut-e nauang tek kownkow CHAKRAMANG uang chin ang mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16" />Nakhowk khe maru iukuüa hai maru kawmuüa dow uamowuüa hai risiuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Nami maru dow kowngla pat mih ripra kak tataing dowi chekhai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai ming hown a-i tut-e uang tek laiklow mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17" />Nami kung kowi dow pren kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa pungmadawng hownia kowkowi pre sum ia hanow takua talawm miuüa kowi tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18" />“Juda pren kowi Hezekia chowm mang mih khin khe Mawreset marow hownia kowh risi Mika tek lai reng chekhai. Judauüa kowi aia tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 26:18" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">“‘Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mih Zaiawn kowi laih iawng nalupah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">Jerusalem marow dow mawngchawng kuakra nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">now Thurai chup kim kowi kowh hungh dow ruih namungta klum kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19" />“Risi iawng Mika krawi tek lai mih khin khe mang Hezekia hai Juda maru-uüa mih aia kowi saiah dowi chekhai. Nasaiah lak dow amatni kowh angak hownia uang plan büah khai, now CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiia büah khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow amatni luk kowi nauang chin pe ripra kownkow tekta khowk mih iawng uang chin pe dowi chekhai. Tawkche a-i dow a-i matia luk kowi phih kraingma a-i uang pawla khai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JER 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20" />(Nami khin khe Thurai satang phowng mih Uria pami maru uowi lowk ia. Uria dow Samaia kowh chapa chekhai. Aia kowh uowi rah dow Kiriat-Jearim marow kowi chekhai. Aia dow Jeremia iawng mami marow hai mami pren kowi kingküala mih laiklow tek khai. <verse eid="JER 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21" />Mang Jehoiakim, aia kowh siphai hai maru iukuüa dow Uria kowh laiklow tata khai. Nakhowk khe mang dow Uria kowi saita kown mih sangkrang khai. Tawkche Uria dow nami laiklow ta hanow kram kowh Aigupta pren kowi powt khai. <verse eid="JER 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22" />Nakhowk khe mang Jehoiakim dow Akbawr chapa Elnathan kowi Aigupta pren kowi kowchinah khai, now aia hown maru pre sum ia kowi paw mang krawi chin pe khai. <verse eid="JER 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23" />Amatni dow Aigupta pren hownia Uria kowi uang khümla hanow mang Jehoiakim tut-e uang pawla khai. Nahanow mang dow Uria kowi saidawng hown saiah khai, now aia kowh uak dow iawngpa mih maru tadupra kowi kuakta hüah khai).<verse eid="JER 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24" />Tawkche Safan kowh chapa Ahikam dow Jeremia prakowi tawi tangila khai. Naiawng rakowi Jeremia kowi dow nasaita kownkow maru kawmuüa rut kowi ap-ah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 26:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27" />
  <para style="s">Mang Nebuknezar tut-e Judauüa takhang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1" />Juda pren kowi Josia kowh chapa Zedekia uown chowm mang mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow Jeremia tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="JER 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2" />Zedekia kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Thawp laithawn tim lowk diah, now nami laithawn tim dow chak pik leng hown en ngawng kowi bakah diah. <verse eid="JER 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3" />Nami kung kowi dow Juda pren mang Zedekia tut-e Jerusalem marow kowi uang mih Edawm, Moab, Amawn, Tura hai Sidawn pren manguüa kowh satang phowng miuüa hown amatni kowh manguüa kowi krawi phowng pe satang diah. <verse eid="JER 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4" />Amatni kowi dow amatni kowh manguüa kowi nakowtek pe kownkow peah ana diah. Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, <verse eid="JER 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5" />‘Ang kowh kri kraingma mih kür hai ang kowh nowng changra hown mami lusa hai lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maru hai tawncher dow ang thawpah mih chekhai. Ang nauah mih maru kowi dow ang nowng peah kür reng chekhai. <verse eid="JER 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6" />Kawmat dow enni kowh pren maten mih ang kowh nar Babulawn mang Nebuknezar rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Nami klen kowi kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowi paw aia nimkrüa kowi ang natowah kown. <verse eid="JER 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7" />Aia kowh piak khin uang ting dowi mowr dow chenchap maten mang Nebuknezar, aia kowh chapa hai aia kowh chu-uüa tut-e nauang chowng nar kown. Nami kung kowi dow Babulawn mang Nebuknezar kowi chenchap ahuma hai aiuk aiukma mih manguüa nachangla nar kown.<verse eid="JER 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8" />“‘Tawkche tawngbak mih prenchakuüa dow Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar nar kowi uowi kown nau dowi mih paw nauowi kown, now aia kowh laithawn tim ngawng kowi bak kown nau dowi mih paw nauowi kown. Naiawng mih prenchakuüa kowi dow asaima Nebuknezar piakta dowi mowr tasen, khown hai makowng hawi hown ang naripah kown. <verse eid="JER 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9" />Naiawng rakowi enni mih enni kowh risi, hawra mük mih, mukmang nowng phuang mih, püi howng mih hai mantan chang mih kowh laiklow hangkow sünta büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow Babulawn pren mang kowh nar enni nachowng kown nadowi pahai krawi dai enni khai. <verse eid="JER 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10" />Naiawng hai amatni dow nakrawi dai enni kown. Naiawngün dai lai che enni sünta hanow enni kowi ang naprüt enni kown. Nahanow enni dow enni matia pren hownia enni nacham taset plawt kown, now enni napiak kown. <verse eid="JER 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11" />Tawkche amia iawng mih chenchap chow Babulawn pren mang kowh laiklow chün hai aia krüa kowi uowi khai hanow nami chenchap kowi dow amatni pren kowi ang nape uowiah kown, now nakowi dow ang nape lupah üa hai laih kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12" />Juda mang Zedekia kowi dow nami satang ang phowng pe khai. Aia kowi ang tek pe mih, “En che sing kown nau khai hanow Babulawn mang hai aia kowh maru iukuüa nau iawng chang diah. <verse eid="JER 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13" />Tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi hown en hai en maru-uüa kowng mih en nau bow? Babulawn pren mang low kowi uowi kown nau dowi mih maru-uüa dow naiawng naphaw kown mih CHAKRAMANG tekla khowk. <verse eid="JER 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14" />‘Babulawn pren mang kowh laiklow hangkow chün büa diah’ pahai tek mih risi kowh laiklow dow hangkow sünta büa diah. Naiawngün risiuüa dow krawi dai enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="JER 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Naiawngün risi kowi dow ang uang chinah mih nadowi chekhai. Amatni dow ang ming hown krawi küa dai khai. Naiawng rakowi enni hai enni tut-e kowh krawi küa dai mih risiuüa kowi dow ang naprütta kown, now enni dow napiak bowk kown,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16" />Nakhowk khe Uamowuüa hai maru kawmuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow ang krawi tek khai. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Risiuüa dow maiawng krawi tek enni khai, ‘CHAKRAMANG kim hownia kowh Babulawn pren kowi pawla mih uanh dow alenma nauang pawla kown,’ pakhai. Naiawng amatni dow enni tut-e krawi küa dai khai. <verse eid="JER 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17" />Amatni kowh laiklow hangkow sünta büa diah; Babulawn pren mang krüa kowi uowi büa diah. Nahanow enni nasing kown. Now enni kowh marow paw napiak kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18" />Kawmat paw Juda pren mang kim, Thurai chup kim hai Jerusalem marow uanh ta uowi ne tak. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün uanh Babulawn pren kowi naia pawla dowi kownkow CHAKRAMANG tut-e pacham lü khowng büah lah. Amatni che risi na khai, now amatni tut-e che Thurai laiklow uowi khai hanow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tut-e pacham lü prasi büah lah. <verse eid="JER 27:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="JER 27:19-20" />Juda pren mang Jehoiakim chapa Jehoiakhin, Judauüa kowi hai Jerusalem kowi kowh maru iukuüa kowi dow mang Nebuknezar mih khümla now Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. Nami khin khe mang Nebuknezar dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh asung khakma mih kri kimchüng, kri biatum, tawkpla hai akeng mih uanh ün pawla dowi chekhai. Naiawngün lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, <verse eid="JER 27:19-20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="JER 27:21-22" />‘Ang kim kowi, Juda pren mang kim kowi hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi mih naiawngün uanh dow Babulawn pren kowi napawla kown. Nauang plan pawla kown mih ang sangkrangta dowi mowr dow naiawngün uanh mih nakowi nauowi kown. Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün uanh mih makowi ang nauang plan pawla iawk kown. Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow tek khowk,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 27:21-22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28" />
  <para style="s">Risi iua Hanania ka ripra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1" />Juda pren kowi Zedekia chowm mang mih tali ning kowi kowh tanga la khe risi Hanania mih Jeremia kowi uang klangah khai. Naiawng Jeremia kowi Hanania uang tek pe mih dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi kowh uamowuüa hai maru kawmuüa pur kowi chekhai. Hanania dow Gibeawn marowchak Azur kowh chapa chekhai. Jeremia kowi Hanania tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2" />“Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Babulawn pren mang kowh kürra dow ang napiakta pe kown. <verse eid="JER 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3" />Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi kowh uanh maten amatni pren kowi pawla khai. Naiawngün uanh dow pre ning takra kowi Jerusalem marow kowi ang nauang plan pawla iawk kown. <verse eid="JER 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4" />Nami klen kowi Juda pren mang Jehoiakim kowh chapa Jehoiakin hai Babulawn pren kowi cham takhang mih Juda maru-uüa maten kowi paw Jerusalem marow kowi ang nauang pawla kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Babulawn pren mang kowh kürra dow ang napiakta pe kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5" />Nakhowk khe Jeremia dow uamowuüa hai CHAKRAMANG kim kowi iowng miuüa pur kowi risi Hanania kowi klangah khai. <verse eid="JER 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6" />Hanania kowi aia tek pe mih, “Amen! En tekah iawng CHAKRAMANG pacham chang lah. CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh uanh hai Babulawn pren kowi kowh cham takhang miuüa maten Jerusalem kowi CHAKRAMANG pauang cham pawla lah. Naiawng hai en tekah mih laiklow dow aia pacham pe tachiah lah. <verse eid="JER 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7" />Tawkche en tut-e hai maru kawmuüa tut-e ang nau tekah kown mih laiklow sünta diah. <verse eid="JER 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8" />En hai ang dowi rawn kowh rik uowi mih risiuüa dow pur prakowi pren hai aiuk aiukma mih pren kowi tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi nauang ting kown mih lawnguan kowi ün rik tekla khowk chekhai. <verse eid="JER 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9" />Thaulangra uang ting kown mih lawnguan kowi krawi tek mih risi laiklow uang tachi khe dow aia kowi CHAKRAMANG uang chinah mih chekhai pami natuk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10" />Nami kung kowi risi Hanania dow risi Jeremia pangkawt hownia laithawn tim mih pawah hanow klowkta pe khai. <verse eid="JER 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11" />Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa pur kowi Hanania tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Naiawng hai pre ning takra kowi dow chenchapuüa pangkawt hownia Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar kowh laithawn tim ang napiakta pe kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai. Naiawng Hanania ki tek lai now risi Jeremia dow nami hownia powt khai.<verse eid="JER 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12" />Hanania klowkta laithawn tim mih pre sum ni kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow maiawng Jeremia tut-e uang plan ting khai: <verse eid="JER 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13" />“Hanania tut-e kowkowi hanow maiawng kowtek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘En klowkta mih dow singh hown kowh laithawn tim chowtaih. Tawkche nami takcha kowi lawngha hown kowh laithawn tim en thawpah khai. <verse eid="JER 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14" />Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk, naiawngün chenchap kowi dow Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar kowh nar nachangah kownkow amatni kowh pangkawt kowi ang natang pe lawngha laithawn tim kown. Now amatni dow aia kowh lup nachang ngengche kown. Nami klen kowi kaurawng uaramchak hawmh paw aia nimkrüa kowi ang natowah kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15" />Nami kung kowi risi Hanania kowi Jeremia tek pe mih, “Hanania, sünta diah. En kowi dow CHAKRAMANG uang chin en mih nadowi. Tawkche en dow naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi owm iawng en krawi dai khai. <verse eid="JER 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘En kowi dow mami lusa hownia ang naprütta en kown. Mami ning kowi ngengche en nakowng kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow Thurai kowi kingküala mih laiklow en krawi tek khai,’ pape khai,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17" />Pre la kung kowi risi Hanania dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 28:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29" />
  <para style="s">Cham takhang miuüa tut-e Jeremia sak cha mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1" />Jeremia dow Babulawn pren kowi cham takhang miuüa tut-e Jerusalem marow hownia krawi sak cha lowk khai. Nami chasak dow takhang miuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ta sing mih lawngtang aluchowuüa, uamowuüa, risiuüa hai akeng mih maru-uüa tut-e kowh aia sak pe mih chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow mang Nebuknezar mih Jerusalem marow hownia khümla hanow Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. <verse eid="JER 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2" />Nami chasak Jeremia ruiah mih dow Juda pren mang Jehoiakhin, a-u, <char style="w">akletia</char> maru iukuüa, Juda hai Jerusalem kowi kowh aluchowuüa, singh hown kowh uanh thawp sara hai kri hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa kowi Jerusalem marow hownia khümla hanow Babulawn pren kowi pawla kung kowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3" />Safan kowh chapa Elasa hai Hilkia kowh chapa Gemaria iüah kowi dow Juda pren mang Zedekia mih mang Nebuknezar tut-e kowchinah khai. Amatchi kung kowi Jeremia dow nami chasak krawi ap pe khai. Nami chasak kowi dow maiawng arui uowi:<verse eid="JER 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai mih Jerusalem hownia khümla hanow Babulawn pren kowi cham pe takhangah miuüa kowi tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5" />“Nakowi khin krama enni nauowi kown. Naiawng rakowi thawp kim büa diah, now chang bakan büah hanow uih-ak mih cha büa diah. <verse eid="JER 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6" />Paw masi hanow prek chu prek chah büa diah. Enni kowh chauüa kowi paw pe masi diah, now amatni kowi pe kaah chah diah. Nakowi mih prung büah diah, maru iun a-echow hang uowi büa diah. <verse eid="JER 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7" />Nami klen kowi ang cham pe takhang enni mih marow kowi taking tasangra hai iuksownra nauowila kownkow chang lup büa diah. Nami marow vüi kowi ang tut-e uang lü uang leng büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami marow che iung now enni paw naiung kown. <verse eid="JER 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8" />Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh risiuüa hai hawra sarauüa nowng kuan enni dowi iawng uowiah kaneu diah. Amatni khi-ah mih mukmang prakowi hang tawi pe ching büa diah. <verse eid="JER 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9" />Amatni dow ang ming hown krawi dai maru reng chekhai. Amatni kowi dow ang CHAKRAMANG uang chinah mih nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10" />“Babulawn pren mang nar kowi 70 ning enni uowi kung kowi dow enni prakowi ang naplan pe ching iawk kown. Nakhowk khe dow ang takhamta mih iawng ang nachang enni aiung kown. Now enni kowh uowi rah Jerusalem marow kowi ang nauang plan pawla enni iawk kown. <verse eid="JER 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11" />Enni vüi kowi kowh ang kowh sangkrangra dow ang tuk. Nami ang kowh sangkrangra dow enni iung müa chekhai, enni piak müa nadowi. Nami sangkrangra dow pur pra kowh enni kowh sakowmra nauang tachila kown mih müa chekhai. <verse eid="JER 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12" />Nami khin khe dow enni mih nauang haw ang kown, now ang tut-e nauang lü nauang leng kown. Nahanow ang dow enni kowh laiklow nahawt sünta kown. <verse eid="JER 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13" />Enni che sak maiow hown cham ang hanow enni naka ang kown. <verse eid="JER 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14" />Ang kowi dow enni natuk ang kown, now cham takhangra hownia ang nauang pawla enni hanow alai kowh iawng ang natow enni iawk kown. Ang cham krawi uet enni mih chenchap hai arah hownia arasang ang nakua enni kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15" />Enni natek kown mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow Babulawn pren kowi anging vüi uang chin anging risiuüa khai,” napa kown. <verse eid="JER 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16" />Tawkche David mang chowm rah kowi kowh chowm mang mih mang lawnguan kowi hai cham tawi takhang dowi kowh marow kowi ta uowi miuüa lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, <verse eid="JER 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17" />“Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk. Amatni kowi dow tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi ang nauang chin pe kown, now kaah chak dowi mih uidut uih su iawng amatni kowi ang nachangah kown. <verse eid="JER 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18" />Amatni kowi dow tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi hown ang naprütah kown, now amatni kowi dow klang nga lai bowt rakowi lusa kowi kowh maru maten nakramah kown. Nami khin khe amatni dow naiawngün maru-uüa tut-e nachowng rensi kau kown, now maru nasuiah kown. Naiawng amatni own mih khi hanow maru kawmuüa dow amawlawma naphaw kown, now amatni ming hown maru mih natape piati kown. <verse eid="JER 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ang nar risiuüa kowi kowh plan plan amatni tut-e ang pe tekah mih laiklow sünta büah dowi, now enni cham takhang miuüa paw sünta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20" />“Naiawng rakowi Jerusalem hownia Babulawn pren kowi ang cham pe takhangah miuüa low, ang laiklow enni bowkbowk sünta büa diah. <verse eid="JER 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21" />Kawlai kowh chapa Ahab hai Maseia kowh chapa Zedekia iüah dow ang ming hown enni tut-e krawi tek dai lai khai. Naiawng rakowi ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, amatchi kowi dow mang Nebuknezar rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Mang Nebuknezar dow enni pur kowi amatchi kowi nasaiah kown. <verse eid="JER 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22" />Babulawn pren kowi kowh cham takhang mih Judauüa maten dow amatchi ming hown maiawng natape piati kown, ‘Zedekia hai Ahab iüah kowi dow maih hown Babulawn pren mang towkah khai. Nami powm iawng en kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pacham chang en lah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JER 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatchi dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi suiiai kaniaima mih lup ngak chang khai. Amatchi dow kimping namkhetuüa kowh masi hown chang iang khai, now amatchi dow ang ming hown krawi dai maru khai. Naiawng amatchi chang mih dow ang tuk chekhai, now nami saksi dow ang chekhai. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Semaia luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24" />Mami laiklow dow Nehelam krungchak Semaia kowi pe tekah diah: <verse eid="JER 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “En ming hown Jerusalem kowi kowh uowi mih maru-uüa tut-e, Maseia chapa uamow Zefania tut-e hai akeng mih uamowuüa tut-e en krawi sak cha khai. <verse eid="JER 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26" />Zefania kowi en rui pe mih, ‘Jehoiada takcha kowi CHAKRAMANG mih pe en uamow rah khai. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa kowi en pacham ia kruitown lah pakowh chekhai. Naiawng rakowi athukma mih maru che risi iawng chang lup khai hanow aia kowi dow lawngha leng hown ngawng kowi en nakhuowkah kown takla. <verse eid="JER 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27" />Nachenganchepaw enni tut-e uang chang risi iow now uang tek lai chepaw Anathawt marowchak Jeremia kowi dow tawngplawng kowchow enni ripah dowi? <verse eid="JER 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28" />Aia dow Babulawn pren kowi anging tut-e maiawng uang krawi sak cha khai. Nami chasak kowi arui uowi mih dow Babulawn pren kowi khin krama anging nauowi kown mih, nakowi nachang kim üa kown mih hai kowmatia chak müa nachang bakan kown mih lawnguan kowi chekhai,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29" />Nami chasak dow Zafania mih risi Jeremia pur kowi phat pe khai. <verse eid="JER 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow Jeremia tut-e maiawng uang ting khai: <verse eid="JER 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31" />“Mami satang dow cham takhang miuüa maten tut-e kowphowng pe diah. Nehelam krungchak Semaia lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Semaia kowi ang uang chinah mih nadowi. Nachenganchepaw aia dow enni tut-e risi iawng uang tek dai lai khai. Dai lai kowi aia dow pe owm enni khai. <verse eid="JER 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32" />Nehelam marowchak Semaia kowi ang naripah ngengche kown, now aia krungchakuüa kowi paw ang naripah kown. Aia chenchap pungmadawng kowi amiapaw nauowi kown nadowi, now ang maru-uüa kowi ang changah aiung mih paw amatni mih nakhi kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow kingküala ang mih laiklow krawi phuang khai. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 29:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowh lawngra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1" />CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow Jeremia tut-e maiawng uang ting khai: <verse eid="JER 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk, ang tek en mih laiklow maten chabowih lowkchow kowi ruiah diah. <verse eid="JER 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow maiawng mih khin dow nauang ting kown. Nami khin khe dow ang maru Israeluüa hai Judauüa kowi amatni cham takhangra hownia ang nauang pawla kown, now amatni kowi dow amatni pipu-uüa kowi kowh ang peah mih pren kowi ang nape uowiah kown. Nami pren dow amatni nimkrüa kowi nauowi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4" />Israel hai Judauüa lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,<verse eid="JER 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, kram kowh maru hek klow ang ta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:5">amatni dow thaulangra uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6" />Krawi lünta büa madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">kachakuüa nowng pen chah tak bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Naiawng now tawngplawng kowchow akürma mih kachakuüa hawmh penchow kimuowi mu rau khe kowh masiuüa iawng tuk bet mu khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Tawngplawng kowchow kowng miuüa lumowr iawng aboma amatni kowi ang tuk khi khai?<verse eid="JER 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7" />Naiawng nauang ting kown mih ni dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">Naiawng mih ni dow katpaw uowi dowi tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">Nami dow Jakawb kowh krat pusara ni naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">Tawkche achur khe dow aia kowi ang nalawngah kown.<verse eid="JER 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8" />“Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk. Nami khin khe dow amatni pangkawt kowi kowh laithawn ting mih ang naklowkta pe kown, now amatni takhuowkla mih leng paw ang nalatta pe kown. Nahanow amatni kowi dow prenlang maru-uüa mih naia changla nar kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9" />Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai lup nachang bowt kown, now David krungchak hownia kowh ang towah kown mih mang kowh lup nachang büah kown.<verse eid="JER 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10" />“Naiawng rakowi aw ang kowh nar Jakawb, hangkow kram büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">aw Israel, hangkow sak nen diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">En hai en krungchakuüa dow akeng pren kowi cham takhang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Nachenganchepaw nami hownia ang nauang lawng enni ngengche kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">Jakawb dow uang plan hanow thaulangma nauowi iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">now aia dow mia kowi paw nakram kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JER 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow en tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">now en kowi dow ang nalawng en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Ang cham uet en mih chenchapuüa kowi dow asaima ang napiakah kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">Tawkche enni kowi dow asaima ang napiak enni kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Rip enni dowi matchang ang nalawt enni kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">Tawkche tara nowm hown ang nahawi enni kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Enni kowh ma dow nowng iung dowi bowt chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:12">now raw paw nowng rawah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="JER 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13" />Enni kowi natawi tangila enni kown mih miapaw uowi dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">enni kowh ma vüi chakhang uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">now enni vüi iungra uowi dowi bowt.<verse eid="JER 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14" />Sakrau enni miuüa tamata enni tüng khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">amatni dow enni lawnguan kowi tuak dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">Enni kowi dow ransu-uüa pe enni ngarau iawng ang pe enni ngarau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">now rip chamang ang rip enni khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni kowh angak dow hu mih nowm khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">now enni kowh aprek paw hu mih nowm khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15" />Tawngplawng kowchow enni kowh ma rakowi enni lang kar rereng?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">Enni kowh arau dow ia iung dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">Naiawng ang chang enni mih dow enni kowh ngak hu lai rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16" />“Tawkche enni kowi kowh piak enni miuüa maten kowi dow ang napiakah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">now enni ransu-uüa dow nacham takhang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">Rupta enni dawngthawnguan miuüa kowi dow amatni kowh dawngthawnguan ang narupta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">rupta enni uanh miuüa kowi dow amatni kowh uanh ang narupta pe kown.<verse eid="JER 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17" />Tawkche enni kowi dow kow iungma ang nachang enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">now enni kowh ma dow ang naiungta enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru natek enni kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">‘Nami dow alakma kowi kowh maru prütta mih Zaiawn marow iawng taih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">aia kowi dow amiapaw krawi chamah dowi bowt,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Jakawb krungchakuüa kowi ang nauang pawla pe iungra iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">now amatni kowi dow ang nasaksing sanaah iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">Marow dow piak mih arah kowi naplan thawpah iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">now mang kim paw auown khe kowh arah kowi naplan thawpah iawk kown.<verse eid="JER 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19" />Maru-uüa mih natek awmrawm meng hai napiaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">Amatni kowh maru iun dow akawmma ang nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">now amatni dow maru iun na-e kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">Amatni kowi dow ringkawma mih maru ang nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">amatni kowi dow amiapaw nasuiah kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20" />Amatni kowh chauüa dow alai khe kowh iawng naphaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:20">now amatni kowi dow ang pur kowi akürma mih chenchap ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:20">Amatni kowi kowh changah nowng miuüa kowi dow ang naripah kown.<verse eid="JER 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21" />Amatni pungmadawng hownia aluchow nauang uowi lowk ia kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">amatni pungmadawng hownia kruitown mih nauang uowi lowk ia kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Aia kowi dow ang nahawah hanow aia mih ang tut-e nauang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">Ang hawah dowi hanow mia chow ang tut-e uang uam uang kown?<verse eid="JER 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22" />Enni dow ang maru nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:22">now ang dow enni kowh Thurai nachowng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23" />Sünta büa diah, CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura dow liku uangchak iawng nauang kla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:23">nami kunmaraura dow maru ngakuüa luk kowi nauang kla kown.<verse eid="JER 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura dow sak ta-ih iawng changta dowi mowr naprowng kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">Nami dow pur prakowi achima enni natuk kown.<verse eid="JER 30:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31" />
  <para style="s">Kar ngukra hownia piawra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Nami khin khe ang dow Israel krungchakuüa kowh Thurai nachowng kown, now amatni dow ang kowh maru nachowng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2" />Nami kung CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Israeluüa mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:2">“Ransu-uüa hownia plai miuüa dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi naka tanaira kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:2">amatni kowi dow nakowi ang nape tanaiah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG dow alakma hownia uang hanow mukmang kowi tek anging mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:3">“Enni kowi dow ang kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura hown ang sakrau enni khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:3">chowngchowng saksakma mih sakraura hown ang tut-e ang uang pawla enni khai.<verse eid="JER 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4" />Aw malauüa iawng mih Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">en kowi dow asar ang naplan thawp en iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">Nahanow en naplan phaw iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">En napaw sawkchow iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">now piaw miuüa hown en natawi plai iawk kown.<verse eid="JER 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5" />Samari hungh kowi dow en naplan chang grep krum iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:5">chang grep krum miuüa dow naka cha auih kown.<verse eid="JER 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6" />Maiawng mih khin nauang ting kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">nami khin khe dow Efraim hungh luk kowi kangchawng miuüa how se natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">‘Chu, CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai uowi rah Zaiawn hungh kowi a-i kowkowi lah,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Jakawb vüi kowi tek awmrawm meng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">now lang iung mih chenchap vüi kowi piaw büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">Amatni kowi kiowah se maiawng tek büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">‘Aw CHAKRAMANG, en maru ta sing mih Israeluüa kowi lawngah diah,’ pabüa diah.<verse eid="JER 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8" />Sünta büa, tawngphak pra kowh pren hownia Israeluüa kowi ang nauang pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">now prenchur nammowt hownia amatni kowi ang nakuaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Amatni pungmadawng hownia mikdu mih hai klowng khawn tabai mih maru ün nauang tawi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">amuma mih masiuüa hai kimuowi mu rau mih masiuüa ün nauang tawi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">Naiawng hai amatni dow thum iukma nauang plan büah kown.<verse eid="JER 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9" />Amatni dow kar se kar se ang tut-e nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">amatni kowi ang uang pawla mih khin khe amatni dow chupla Thurai se nauang kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Anaima mih tiama iawng tui hawrra re-e amatni kowi ang nauang pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">nakowi dow amatni natatheu kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow Israel kowh pa chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">Efraim dow ang kowh chapa ta chekhai.<verse eid="JER 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10" />“Aw chenchapuüa, ang laiklow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">now alakma mih pren kowi enni mih maiawng krawi phuang büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">‘Israeluüa kowi cham setah mih Thurai mih amatni kowi nakua nalawmah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">now aia dow ruapur thing mih iawng aia kowh ruapur hawmh kowi natakhula kown,’ pabüah diah.<verse eid="JER 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Jakawb kowi ang uang lawngla khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:11">now amatni kowi amatni lak-e kowh lang kür miuüa rut hownia ang uang lawngla khai.<verse eid="JER 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12" />Amatni dow Zaiawn hungh kowi nauang hanow napiaw kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">amatni dow ang peah mih luprak hai grep tui sar ka hanow naawmrawm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">now sau ün, ruapur hai chia chah ün ka hanow naawmrawm büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Amatni dow thut pe tui reng mih pau khang iawng naphaw kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">now katpaw nangawi büah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JER 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13" />Malauüa dow awmrawm rakowi naplai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">now klanguüa hai lawngtanguüa paw napiaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">Amatni kowi dow uowila uiting uangtak mih takcha kowi apiawma ang nachangah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">amatni kowi dow akawm akrat takcha kowi sakklamra hai piawra ang napeah kown.<verse eid="JER 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14" />Uamowuüa kowi dow ahuma ang napeah chakkham kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:14">ang kowh maru-uüa kowi dow aiungma mih uanh ün ang napeah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:14">nahanow amatni dow nasak-ih kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:14">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Rama marow hownia kar klow nguk klow ta khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">Rahel dow aia chauüa rakowi lainowmma kar khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia chauüa dow kowng bowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16" />Hang kar tham bowt, iawtta mik tui bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh awmrawm sung en naka kown chowbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">now en kowh chauüa mih ransu-uüa pren hownia nauang plan kown chowbowt.<verse eid="JER 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17" />Naiawng rakowi en vüi dow pur prakowi sakowmra uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:17">en kowh chauüa dow amatni matia pren kowi nauang plan kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:17">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18" />Efraim kowh kar klow ang ta khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">CHAKRAMANG tut-e kar se aia tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">‘Chün lai dowi mih chia kowi chia iah hawiah iawng en hawi ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">En prakowi plan pe dang ang hanow alai kowh iawng tow ang iawk diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai dow en chowtaih.<verse eid="JER 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19" />Ang chang ngak mih hownia ang uang plan khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">ang chang ngak mih ang tatuk hanow ang sak kowi rau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">now kowmatia kowi lainowmma ang tarukrai khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Klanguüa khe ang chang ngak rakowi ang ka rukrai khai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Efraim mih ang lang sakrauah mih chapa nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">Aia dow ang lang awmrawmah mih chapa nadowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Aia kowi dow kingküala mih laiklow ang tek pe chepaw sak kowi atungma ang tuakla reng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">naiawng rakowi ang kowh sak dow aia vüi kar reng;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Aia kowi dow ang nasaksing sanaah reng kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21" />“Tiama athikma natuk matla kownkow amat müa krawi ruang tamkhuown diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">enni krawi kowiah mih tiama dow sak kowi towah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Aw Israel malauüa, uang plan diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">en kowh marow kowi uang plan diah.<verse eid="JER 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22" />Aw tiama ngak kowi kowh mang mih masiuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">mün ni tak chow en nacham mang panglang kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">Lusa kowi ang thawpta uanh sar pachap khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">Nami dow kachakuüa kowi natowkala kownkow masiuüa narumah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang dow cham takhang mih arah hownia maru kawmuüa kowi ang nauang pawla kown. Nakhowk khe Juda prenchak hai marowchakuüa natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 31:23" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:23">“‘Aw anowmma mih uowira, aw chimsaima mih hungh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:23">CHAKRAMANG dow pacham pe en prasi lah,’ napa kown.<verse eid="JER 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24" />“Naiawngün maru-uüa dow Juda pren kowi hai marow kowi nakrawi uowi kown, now laih chang miuüa hai tawncher thing miuüa paw nakowi nauowi kown. <verse eid="JER 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow kawm miuüa kowi ang nape chingah kown, now kür uowi dowi miuüa kowi ang napeah kür kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26" />Nami kung kowi ang awr thowr müi hanow aria aret kowi ang krawi tang mü khai. Ang müi mih dow lainowmma sowr uowi chowdiah.<verse eid="JER 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Maiawng mih khin nauang ting kown. Nami khin khe dow Israeluüa hai Judauüa kowi maru iun akawmma ang nachangah kown, now amatni kowh tawncher paw ang nape prungah kown. <verse eid="JER 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28" />Achük alai khe Israeluüa kowi dow ang piakah khai, amatni kowi dow ang ripah khai, now ang pe klaah phih reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow naiuk nasownah kownkow hai akürma nachangah kown mih prakowi ang nape ching kown. <verse eid="JER 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29" />Nami khin khe maru mih maiawng natek kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 31:29" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">“‘Cha sur mih dow u-pa chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:29">tawkche iüng krüm mih dow chauüa chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30" />“Nami takcha kowi chang ngak mih maru chowtaih nakowng kown, cha sur mih maru chowtaih iüng nakrüm kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Natatow sangbowk laitawm sar kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Israeluüa hai Judauüa hown ang natatow sangbowk laitawm sar kown mih khin uang tawn khowk chekhai. <verse eid="JER 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32" />Nami sangbowk laitawm sar dow Aigupta pren hownia amatni pipu-uüa kowi ang uang lawtla mih khin khe kowh amatni hown ang tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm iawng nadowi chekhai. Ang dow amatni kowh hua iawng chowdiah. Tawkche amatni dow ang kowh sangbowk laitawm piakta büah khai. <verse eid="JER 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33" />Akung kowi amatni vüi dow ang nathawp pe sangbowk laitawm lowk kown: Ang kowh ari aiang mih amatni sak kowi ang natow pe kown, now amatni sak kowi ang narui pe kown; nahanow ang dow amatni kowh Thurai nachowng kown, now amatni dow ang maru nachowng kown. <verse eid="JER 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34" />Nami kung kowi dow kowmatia kimping namkhet kowi hai kowmatia tainau kowi, ‘CHAKRAMANG kowi tuk büa diah,’ pahai amiapaw natüng nasang kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aiuk asowm amatni natuk ang bowk kown towbowt. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh angak dow ang nalawtta pe kown, amatni kowh angak dow sak kowi ang natowah kown nadowi bowt. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35" />CHAKRAMANG dow ni-e khe nanowila kownkow sat kowi peah ana khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">now iak-e khe nanowila kownkow lama kowi hai krek kowi peah ana khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">Now aia dow sata tui kowi paw pe talowngah phunglung khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">naiawng chang mih dow mukuang siphai kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="JER 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Sat, lama hai krek ün katpaw natama kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:36">nami iawng Israel chenchapuüa dow ang pur hownia katpaw natama kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37" />Mukuang dow nowng khaiah dowi, now lusa chüng paw ka chamah dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">nami iawng Israeluüa changta lup ngak chepaw amatni kowi ang nanuata kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naplan thawp Jerusalem marow kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Maiawng mih khin nauang ting kown. Nami khin khe dow Hananel kowh Kimkrowng hownia Anui Tapplawt mowr ang vüi Jerusalem marow mih naplan thawpah iawk kown. <verse eid="JER 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39" />Akhai müa leng dow nami hownia Gareb hungh mowr atengma naiangah kown, now nami kung kowi dow Goah prakowi naiu takui kown. <verse eid="JER 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40" />Kowng mih uak hai plawi kuakra lawngrawi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi nalang towah kown, now satlawt pra kowh Kawrnga Tapplawt nui mowr mih Kidrawn lawngrawi kowi kowh dowm maten paw CHAKRAMANG vüi nalang towah kown. Nami hownia now nami Jerusalem pamarowma katpaw nanowng piak kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32" />
  <para style="s">Jeremia ran krawng parah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1" />Juda pren kowi Zedekia chowm mang mih hamüt ning khe CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow Jeremia tut-e uang ting khai. Nakhowk khe Nebuknezar chowm mang mih dow lairiat ning chekhai. <verse eid="JER 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2" />Nami khin khe Babulawn pren mang kowh siphaiuüa dow uang sen Jerusalem marow kownkow uang umta lut khai, now amatni dow Jeremia kowi Juda pren kowi kowh mang kim chawngra viadawng kowi tawmta hüah khai. <verse eid="JER 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3" />Jeremia kowi mang Zedekia tawmah mih auan dow risi iawng Jeremia krawi tek lai rakowi chekhai. Jeremia aplan aplan krawi tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Jerusalem marow kowi Babulawn pren mang rut kowi ang naap-ah kown, now aia dow nami marow napowngta kown. <verse eid="JER 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4" />Juda pren mang Zedekia dow Babulawn pren mang rut hownia naplai kown nadowi. Aia kowi dow Babulawn pren mang rut kowi ang naap-ah ngengche kown. Nakowi aia dow Babulawn pren mang kowi nakhi kown, now Babulawn pren mang hown natalawp kown. <verse eid="JER 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5" />Mang Zedekia kowi dow Babulawn pren mang mih Babulawn pren kowi napawla kown, now mang Zedekia mih ang lawngah dowi mowr nakowi nauowi kown. Naiawng rakowi Babulawnuüa hown enni tasen chepaw enni naawng kown nadowi,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6" />Nami khin khe Jeremia tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, <verse eid="JER 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7" />‘En pahi Salum kowh chapa Hanamel mih en tut-e nauang kown. Now aia natek en kown mih, “Anathawt marow kowi kowh ang kowh krawng uowi mih en matia vüi ran diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tasin taken mih maru iawng nami krawng naklan kown mih dow en kowh alow uowi chekhai,” napa kown,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JER 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek iawng ang pahi kowh chapa Hanamel mih kangchawngra viadawng kowi ang tut-e uang khai, now tek ang mih, ‘Benjamin süng kowi kowh Anathawt marow kowi ang kowh krawng uowi mih ran diah. Nami krawng naklan kown mih hai napowng kown mih low en kowh uowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami krawng mih en matia vüi ran diah,’ pakhai. Nami ang tata hanow nami dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow iawng phaw mih chekhai pami ang tuk khai. <verse eid="JER 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9" />Naiawng rakowi Anathawt marow kowi kowh Hanamel kowh krawng mih tai 17 iun hown ang ranta pe khai. Nami tai dow khaiah now ang peah khai. <verse eid="JER 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10" />Nami tasum taran mih charam kowi dow ang kla pe saing hanow ang tuk pe mur khai, now saksi ün ang towla pe khai. Nami klen kowi tai paw set kowi ang khai pe khai. <verse eid="JER 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11" />Nami kung kowi tasum taran müa charam ang paw pre buk khai. Lowk mih charam kowi dow mur tuk uowi chekhai, now ari arow hai laikham laiklow ün arui uowi chekhai. Tawkche alowk mih charam kowi dow mur tuk uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12" />Nami kung kowi dow nami charam mih Neria kowh chapa Baruk kowi ang ap pe khai. Neria dow Maseia kowh Chapa chekhai. Nami khin khe Hanamel, saksi thuak miuüa hai kangchawngra viadawng kowi kowh chowm mih Juda maru-uüa maten tawi uowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 32:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="JER 32:13-14" />Naiawngün maru-uüa pur kowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai ana pek iawng Baruk kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Nami tasum taranla krawng bawn mih mur tuk uowi mih hai mur tuk uowi dowi mih charam pawla hanow bawn kawng kowi towah diah. Nahanow akhin krama chepaw napiak kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 32:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami pren kowi dow kim, üa, krawng bawn hai grep krum mih naplan tasum taran iawk kown. Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremia chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16" />Ranla krawng mih charam Neria chapa Baruk kowi ang peta kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e maiawng ang lü prasi khai: <verse eid="JER 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, en kowh kri kraingma mih kür hai akürma mih rut hown mukuang hai lusa dow en thawpah khai. En nowng changah dowi mih tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18" />En dow athawng aiawng maru kowi en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en tüng pe reng. Tawkche u-pa kowh angak ripra dow amatni kung kowi kowh amatni kowh chauüa kowi pat en peah reng chekhai. Aw lang kri lang kraing mih hai akürma mih Thurai, en ming dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai. <verse eid="JER 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19" />En kowh sangkrangra dow kri kraingma chekhai, now en kowh lup maten paw akürma chekhai. Maru kowh chowm krang uowi krang prakowi en tang mü reng. En dow chowlowkkow chowm krang uowi krang hai lup chang krang iawng pe asung reng chekhai. <verse eid="JER 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20" />En dow Aigupta pren kowi amatra ahuma en tüngah khai, now awdara uowima mih lup paw en chang khai. Kawmat mowr kowi Israel hai maru maten pungmadawng kowi naiawngün lup en chang reng tak chekhai, nahanow en dow ka ming iung nang iung reng chekhai. <verse eid="JER 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21" />Aigupta pren hownia en maru Israeluüa kowi dow amatra hown, awdara uowima mih lup hown, kürra hai kramra uowima mih nowng changra hown en uang lawtla khai. <verse eid="JER 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22" />Amatni pipu-uüa kowi dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawngpaw akhawr uowi dowi mih pren napeah kownkow en khamah khai, now nami dow amatni kowi en peah khai. <verse eid="JER 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23" />Amatni dow nami pren kowi uang hanow uang powngta khai. Tawkche amatni dow en laiklow sünta dowi, now en kowh ari aiang paw chün büah dowi chekhai. Amatni dow en pe changah mih lup lowkchow paw chang dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün phih maten dow amatni luk kowi en uang pawla pe khai. <verse eid="JER 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24" />Jerusalem marow nauang powngta kownkow tap rinrin ransu-uüa uang chun bawn mih mü diah. Nami marow kowi dow tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi mih Babulawn siphaiuüa rut kowi naap-ah kown. En tek iawng uang phaw mih dow en matia mik hown en khi khowk chekhai. <verse eid="JER 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25" />Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, Jerusalem marow dow Babulawnuüa napawta kown chowbowt. Nachenganchepaw tai hown naran krawng bawn hanow natowla saksi kown mih en tek ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26" />Akung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow maiawng Jeremia tut-e uang ting khai: <verse eid="JER 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG dow maru maten kowh Thurai chekhai. Ang tut-e dow tawng mih lup paw krat dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28" />Naiawng rakowi mami Jerusalem marow dow Babulawn prenchakuüa hai amatni kowh mang Nebuknezar rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Aia dow mami marow napowngta kown. <verse eid="JER 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29" />Kowsen Jerusalem marow mih Babulawn siphaiuüa dow marow kowi nakowkup hanow natowkta kown. Nami marow kowi kowh maru-uüa dow amatni kowh kimluk kowi Baal thurai vüi nam iungma mih maikhük towk büah khai, now akeng thurai vüi paw hüngah mih uanap pawi chang büah khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow towk ang kunmarau khai. Naiawngün kim hailawm amatni dow marow mih natowkta kown. <verse eid="JER 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30" />Israel hai Juda maru-uüa dow sowm hownia ang mik kowi lup ngak kangowh chang khai. Israeluüa dow amatni kowh lup ngak chang hown towk ang kunmarau khai. <verse eid="JER 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31" />Jerusalem marow thawp mih ni hownia kawmat mowr pat Jerusalem marowchakuüa dow towk ang sak-hiah hai towk ang kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi nami marow dow ang pur hownia ang napiakta kown. <verse eid="JER 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa, Judauüa, amatni kowh manguüa hai maru iukuüa dow lup ngak chang hown towk ang kunmarau khai, now uamowuüa, risiuüa, Judauüa hai Jerusalem maru-uüa paw lup ngak chang hown towk ang kunmarau khai. <verse eid="JER 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33" />Amatni dow dangta ang kung khai. Amatni kowi dow plan plan ang tüngsangah khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow ang laiklow chün dowi chekhai, now sünta kown paw nau dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34" />Amatni dow amatni kowh suiiai kaniaima mih arup aren ün ang kim kowi towah büah khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow ang kim sürlawkah khai. <verse eid="JER 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35" />Amatni dow Ben-Hinawm lawngrawi kowi Baal thurai vüi kowi arah kroma mih kowi kowh chupiiara thawp büah khai. Nami phuchuara kowi amatni dow amatni kowh chauüa kowi Molek thurai vüi changla phuchua khai. Naiawng nachang kown mih amatni kowi dow ang peah ana dowi chekhai. Naiawng Juda maru-uüa nachang lup ngak kown mih tuak khowm ang ka tuak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36" />“Mami marow lawnguan kowi enni tek mih, ‘Tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi hown Jerusalem marow dow Babulawn pren mang rut kowi apta khai,’ pakhai. Tawkche kawmat dow ang kowh laiklow sünta büa diah. <verse eid="JER 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37" />Ang sak-ih dowi mih hown, ang kowh kunmarau lün pluplup mih hai kramra uowima mih kunmaraura hown Juda hai Israeluüa kowi mih amatni pren hownia alakma mih pren kowi ang cham prütah khai. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi dow ang cham prütah mih arah hownia arasang ang nakua nalawmah kown. Amatni kowi dow Jerusalem marow kowi ang nauang plan pawla iawk kown, now thaulangma ang nape uowiah kown. <verse eid="JER 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38" />Amatni dow ang kowh maru nachowng kown, now ang dow amatni kowh Thurai nachowng kown. <verse eid="JER 32:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39" />Amatni kowi dow saktuak lowkchow hai sangkrangra lowkchow ang nachangah kown. Nahanow amatni dow amatni matia hai amatni kung kowi kowh amatni kowh chauüa naiungla kownkow atungma ringkawma hown nakram ang kown. <verse eid="JER 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40" />Amatni hown dow chowngchowng saksakma mih sangbowk laitawm ang natatow kown. Nami dow amatni kowi ang nachangah iung reng kown mih chekhai. Ang hownia amatni napowtla dowi kownkow amatni sak kowi dow ringkawma hown kramra ang napeah kown. <verse eid="JER 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41" />Amatni kowi dow awmrawmma hown ang nachangah aiung kown, now ang kowh saktuak maiow hown amatni kowi dow kaah sakowmma mami pren kowi singh chowk iawng ang nachowkah kown.<verse eid="JER 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42" />“Israeluüa hai Judauüa luk kowi phih kraingma ang uang pawla pe khai. Tawkche khaleng hownia dow ang takhamta mih iawng amatni kowi aiung maten ang nachang pe kown. <verse eid="JER 32:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43" />Mami pren lawnguan kowi enni tek mih, ‘Mami dow piaknama mih krawng chekhai. Mami krawng kowi dow maru paw uowi dowi, now tawncher paw uowi dowi chekhai. Mami krawng dow Babulawnuüa rut kowi apta khai bowt,’ pakhai. Nachenganchepaw nami pren kowi mih naplan taran krawng bawn iawk kown. <verse eid="JER 32:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44" />Benjaminuüa kowh süng, Jerusalem riaret kowi kowh süng, Juda marow ün, Negeb kowi kowh kua hai marow maten, alowngma mih süng hai anemchow mih süng maten kowi kowh kua hai marow kowi dow tangka hown naran krawng bawn iawk kown. Nami ranla krawng bawn mih charam kowi dow nakla pe saing kown, natuk pe mur kown, now saksi paw natow pe kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi dow amatni kowh pren mih ang naplan peah iawk kown chekhai. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 32:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33" />
  <para style="s">Thaulangra laikham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow Jeremia tut-e uang plan ting khai. Nami khin khe paw Jeremia dow kangchawngra viadawng kowi tatawm reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="JER 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang ming dow CHAKRAMANG, ang dow lusa thawp miia chekhai. Ang dow lusa mih thawpah hanow athikma mih arah kowi ang towah khai. <verse eid="JER 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3" />Ang tut-e uang lü uang leng diah, now ang naklang en kown taih. En kowi dow kri kraingma mih laiklow hai en tukah dowi mih <char style="w">laipet</char> ün ang natek en kown. <verse eid="JER 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4" />Ang dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai chekhai. Juda pren mang kowh kim lawnguan hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh kim lawnguan kowi ang tek khowk, naiawngün kim dow ransu-uüa napiakta kown. Amatni dow nami Jerusalem marow kowi kowh kimkrowng ün napiakta kown, now saidawng hown marowchakuüa kowi nasenah büah kown. <verse eid="JER 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5" />Jerusalem marowchakuüa dow lainowmma chang angak khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow ang sak-ihah dowi mih hai ang kowh kunmaraura hown sai chamang ang nasaiah kown. Jerusalem marow kowi Babulawn siphaiuüa uang sen mih khin khe amatni kowh uak dow marow kowi kowh kim kowi ün natakuakla pan kown.<verse eid="JER 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6" />“Nachenganchepaw ang dow marow hai nakowi kowh maru-uüa kowi dow aiungma ang nachangah kown, now kow iung lak iungma ang nachangah kown. Amatni kowi dow thaulangma ang nape uowiah kown. <verse eid="JER 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7" />Juda hai Israeluüa kowi dow nar kowi cham takhangra hownia ang nauang plan pawla iawk kown, now amatni kowh pren dow auown khe kowh iawng ang nachangah iawk kown. <verse eid="JER 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8" />Amatni kingküala ang mih angak amatni changta mih dow ang nasia sauta pe kown, now amatni kowh angak maten hai kingküara dow ang nalawtta pe kown. <verse eid="JER 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9" />Nakhowk khe dow Jerusalem marow mih palusama maru pur kowi kiowrira, piawra hai ringkawra nape ang kown. Jerusalem maru-uüa vüi kowi ang chang pe lup iung mih laiklow dow akeng chenchapuüa nata kown. Nami khin khe amatni dow nakiow ang büah kown. Jerusalem marowchakuüa vüi kowi iungra hai thaulangra ang uang pawla pe mih rakowi akeng chenchapuüa dow ang kowi kram hai naringkaw büah kown.<verse eid="JER 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="JER 33:10-11" />“Mami re-e kowh arah lawnguan kowi enni tek mih, ‘Mami dow apiakma mih krawng bawn chekhai; makowi dow maru lah, tawncher lah amiapaw uowi dowi chekhai,’ pakhai. Tawkche Juda pren kowi kowh marow hai Jerusalem marow kowi ün kawmat kowh akhaw aklaima mih tiama kowi ün piaw mih klow, awmrawm mih klow hai masi pawk pawi klow naplan ta iawk kown, now nachangla awmrawm laitek müa uanap kownkow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi uang pawla uanh mih maru-uüa klow paw naplan ta iawk kown. Naiawngün maru-uüa natek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:10-11">“‘Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe awmrawm lai diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:10-11">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aiungma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:10-11">now aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai,’ napa kown.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 33:10-11">“Nami pren kowi auown khe kowh iawng aiungma ang naplan changah iawk kown. <verse eid="JER 33:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12" />Maru hai tawncher uowiah dowi mih apiaknama mih arah kowi dow Juda maru-uüa uowira, ruapur thing miuüa uowi rah hai ruapur thing rah süng nachowng iawk kown. <verse eid="JER 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13" />Benjaminuüa kowh süng, Jerusalem riaret kowi kowh süng, Juda marow ün, Negeb kowi kowh kua hai marow maten, alowngma mih süng hai anemchow mih süng maten kowi kowh kua hai marow kowi ün naplan rüa ruapur iawk kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">David hown CHAKRAMANG tatow sangbowk laitawm mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang nachangah aiung kown mih Israel hai Judauüa tut-e ang takhamta mih iawng ang nachang pe kown mih akhin nauang ting kown. <verse eid="JER 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15" />Nami khin khe dow David krungchak hownia Achinawmma mih Mia Prek kowi ang nape chowmah mang lowk ia kown. Aia dow pren kowi anowmma hai anama mih lup nachang kown. <verse eid="JER 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16" />Nami khin khe dow Juda maru-uüa mih naka lawngra kown, now Jerusalem maru-uüa paw thaulangma nauowi kown. Jerusalem kowi dow, ‘CHAKRAMANG mih anging kowh tachi tanawmra chekhai,’ pahai nahawah kown. <verse eid="JER 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17" />Israel pren mang chowm rah kowi nachowm mang kown mih maru David krungchakuüa hownia nakhawr kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18" />Now ang pur kowi iowng se atungma tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai tawncher phuchua pawi nachang kown mih paw Levi chenchap hownia uamow nakhawr kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19" />Nami kung kowi Jeremia tut-e dow maiawng CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang ting khai: <verse eid="JER 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20" />“Towngla ni hai uar khükhü ang tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm dow amiapaw nowng piak dowi chekhai. Amatni dow akhin towng uang lawt reng chekhai. <verse eid="JER 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21" />Nami che enni ia piak khai hanow ang nar David hai Levi chenchap uamowuüa hown kowh ang tatowah mih sangbowk laitawm enni naia piak kown, now David kowh mang chowm rah kowi nachowm mang kown mih paw aia krungchak hownia nakhawr kown. <verse eid="JER 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22" />Ang kowh nar David krungchakuüa hai ang pur kowi chang lup mih Leviuüa kowi dow mukuang kowi kowh krek iawng ahuma ang nachangah kown, now sata pang kowi kowh sema iawng maru iun akawmma ang nachangah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23" />Nami kung kowi Jeremia tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang plan ting khai iawk. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24" />“Maru kawmuüa tek mih, ‘Israel hai Judauüa kowi CHAKRAMANG kloah mih chowdiah. Tawkche kawmat dow amatni kowi CHAKRAMANG nuata khai bowt,’ pakhai. Naiawng maru kawmuüa tek mih en khi dowi bow? Amatni dow ang maru-uüa kowi khare büah khai, now chenchap iawng khowm nüla dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JER 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25" />Tawkche ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, ni hai uar lawnguan kowi kowh ang kowh sangbowk laitawm dow tapiak dowi chekhai, now mukuang hai lusa lawnguan kowi kowh ang kowh rirow paw tapiak dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26" />Nami iawng Jakawb hai ang kowh nar David krungchakuüa vüi kowi ang kowh sangbowk laitawm nauowi reng kown, now Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb krungchakuüa luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow David krungchakuüa kowi ang nanuaah kown nadowi. Amatni kowi dow ang nachangah iung kown, amatni kowi dow ang nasaksing sanaah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 33:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34" />
  <para style="s">Babulawn kowi Zedekia nakowng kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JER 34:1-2" />Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar, aia kowh siphaiuüa, aia nimkrüa kowi kowh uowi mih pren maten hai akeng chenchapuüa dow Jerusalem marow hai aria aret kowi kowh marow ün kowsen mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai mih maiawng nakowtek kownkow Juda pren mang Zedekia tut-e Jeremia kowi kowchinah khai. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk, Jerusalem marow dow Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar rut kowi ang naap-ah kown, now nami marow dow aia natowkta kown. <verse eid="JER 34:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3" />Juda pren mang Zedekia dow Babulawn pren mang rut hownia naplai kown nadowi. Aia kowi dow Babulawn pren mang rut kowi ang naap-ah ngengche kown. Nakowi aia dow Babulawn pren mang kowi nakhi kown, now Babulawn pren mang hown natalawp kown.<verse eid="JER 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4" />“Aw Juda pren mang Zedekia, ang laiklow sünta diah. En lawnguan kowi ang tek khowk, en dow saidawng rut kowi nakowng kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5" />En dow thaulangma nakowng kown. En pipu-uüa dowi rawn kowh rik chowm mang miuüa kowi dow kowng khe natüng pe ringkawra kownkow towk pe maih reng chekhai. Nami iawng dow en kowi paw natüng en ringkawra kownkow nam iungma mih maikhük natowk en kown. Now maru kawmuüa sak nga kowh natek kown mih, ‘Nga lai bowt kowbow!’ napa kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6" />Nakhowk khe risi Jeremia dow naiawngün laiklow mih Jerusalem marow kowi Juda pren mang Zedekia kowi tek pe khai. <verse eid="JER 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7" />Nami khin khe Babulawn pren mang siphaiuüa dow Jerusalem, Lakhis hai Azeka marow kowi senah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Juda pren kowi kowh amatni napowng kown mih ta lat mih dow naiawngün tap tapat lut mih marow towbowt chekhai.<verse eid="JER 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cham uowi nar miuüa uang lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8" />Jeremia tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang plan ting khai. Nami dowi rawn nar kowi takhang mih Hebraiuüa kowi nalawtta kownkow mang Zedekia dow Jerusalem maru-uüa hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. <verse eid="JER 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9" />Nami sangbowk laitawm dow Hebrai narla hai narmauüa kowi nalawtta kown mih chekhai, now Judauüa kowi miapaw naia towah nar dowi kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="JER 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10" />Naiawng rakowi maru iukuüa hai maru kawmuüa dow nami sangbowk laitawm chün hanow amatni kowh narla hai narmauüa kowi nalawtta kown mih nauta khai, now amatni kowi natowah nar kown nadowi bowt pahai takham büah khai. Nahanow amatni dow amatni kowh naruüa kowi lawtta khai. <verse eid="JER 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11" />Tawkche amatni dow akung kowi planta saktuak büah khai, now amatni lawtta mih narla hai narmauüa kowi uang pawla büah hanow plan pe uowiah nar khai.<verse eid="JER 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12" />Naiawng rakowi Jeremia tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang ting mih, <verse eid="JER 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13" />“Ang CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk, Aigupta pren kowi cham uowi nar mih enni pipu-uüa kowi ang uang lawtla mih khin khe amatni hown ang tatow sangbowk laitawm khowk chowdiah. <verse eid="JER 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Hebraiuüa pungmadawng kowi mia iawng mih chünchü enni tut-e uang tasum khai hanow ranit ning khe aia kowi dow enni nalawtta kown. Taruk ning mowr tawi chang enni lup kung kowi aia kowi enni nalawtta kown,’ pakhai. Nachenganchepaw enni pipu-uüa dow ang laiklow sünta dowi, now ang laiklow kowi ching paw pe büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15" />Pre sum ni dowi rawn dow enni dia sar khowk chowdiah, now ang mik kowi iung mih lup paw enni chang khowk chowdiah. Enni kowh nar Hebraiuüa kowi enni nalawtta kown mih ün enni tek khowk chowdiah. Nami klen kowi ang kowh chup kim pur kowi ang kowh ari arow nachün kown mih ün enni nauta khowk chowdiah. <verse eid="JER 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16" />Tawkche kawmat dow enni kowh saktuak taplan khai iawk, now ang kowh ming enni sürlawk ang khai iawk. Amatni nau iawng nauowi kownkow enni lawtta khowk mih enni kowh narla hai narmauüa kowi enni uang pawla now enni pe uowiah nar khai iawk.<verse eid="JER 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17" />“Naiawng rakowi ang tek khowk, enni dow ang laiklow chün dowi chekhai. Enni dow enni kowh chenchap tainau-uüa kowi nalawtta kown mih enni phuang dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih ang krüa kowi uowi mih hownia ang lawtta enni khowk. Tawkche naiawng ang pe enni mih thaulangra khin kowi tasen, makowng hawi hai khown enni luk kowi nauang ting kown. Naiawngün piakra hown enni kowi dow ang napiak enni kown. Nami khi hanow lusa kowi kowh prenchakuüa dow kram hown natakrow kown. <verse eid="JER 34:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="JER 34:18-19" />Judauüa, Jerusalem aluchowuüa, maru iukuüa, uamowuüa hai prenchakuüa dow chia chah changah pre dung mih takra iawng mang hanow ang kowh rirow nachün kown mih takham khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow ang kowh ari arow piakta büah khai, now nami amatni takhamta iawng chang büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 34:18-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow kowngta kown nau mih ransu-uüa rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Amatni kowh uak dow kuang kowi kowh uaklinguüa hai kaurawng uaramchak hawmh kowh chakkham nachowng kown. <verse eid="JER 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21" />Juda pren mang Zedekia hai aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi dow kowngta kown nau mih ransu-uüa rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Enni kowi dow enni hownia amatni pren kowi plan mih Babulawn mang kowh siphaiuüa rut kowi ang naap enni kown. <verse eid="JER 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22" />Mami Jerusalem marow kowi nauang senah iawk kownkow Babulawn siphaiuüa kowi ang nahawah iawk kown. Amatni dow nami marow mih nauang sen kown, now nami dow powngta hanow natowkta büah kown. Judauüa kowh marow ün napiakah hanow akhaw aklaima ang nachangah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35" />
  <para style="s">Rekabituüa chün lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1" />Juda pren kowi Josia kowh chapa Jehoiakim chowm mang mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Jeremia mih, <verse eid="JER 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2" />“En mih Rekab krungchakuüa tut-e kowkowi diah. Amatni kowi dow ang chup kim kowi kowh towklak kowi uang pawla diah, now pe khamah grep tui büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3" />Naiawng rakowi Rekab krungchakuüa maten kowi Thurai chup kim towklak kowi ang kowpawla khai. Rekab krungchakuüa dow Habazinia kowh chu Jazania, aia tainau-uüa hai amatni chauüa chekhai. Jazania dow Jeremia kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="JER 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4" />Rekab krungchakuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi kowh Igdalia chapa risi Hanan kowh chapauüa towklak kowi ang kowpawla khai. Hanan kowh towklak dow maru iukuüa kowh towklak ria kowi chekhai. Hanan kowh chapauüa towklak adak krowng kowi uowi mih dow Salum chapa Maseia chekhai. Maseia dow Thurai chup kim kangchawng mih chekhai. <verse eid="JER 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5" />Nami kung kowi dow nami Rekabituüa pur kowi grep tui atekma kangowh mih bia hai bia cha ün ang tow pe khai, now amatni kowi ang tek pe mih, “Kham grep tui büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6" />Tawkche amatni tek mih, “Anging dow kham grep tui dowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging kowh pipu Rekab kowh chapa Jonadab pe anging ana mih, ‘Enni hai enni krungchakuüa dow katpaw naia kham grep tui kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7" />Nami klen kowi kim ün katpaw enni nachang kown nadowi, cha ün enni nasawt kown nadowi, grep krum ün enni naran kown nadowi, now grep krum ün chang paw enni nachang kown nadowi. Tawkchedow atungma tangbung kowi enni nauowi kown. Naiawng che enni uowi now prenlang maru iawng enni nakowuowiah kown mih pren kowi chowngdawng sakklangma hai aiungma enni naia uowi kown,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JER 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8" />Anging kowh pipu Rekab kowh chapa Jonadab pe anging mih ana dow anging bowkbowk chün reng. Anging, anging masi hai anging kowh chauüa dow amiapaw kham grep tui dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9" />Nauowila kown mih kim ün anging chang dowi chekhai, now grep krum, cha hai uih-ak rawng ün anging lup dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10" />Anging dow tangbung kowi kowh uowi mih chekhai, now anging kowh pipu Rekab kowh chapa Jonadab pe anging mih ana maten dow anging chün reng chekhai. <verse eid="JER 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11" />Tawkche Juda pren kowi Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar uang sen anging mih khin khe anging tatek mih, ‘Babulawn hai Siria siphaiuüa hownia Jerusalem marow kowi a-i kowpowt lah,’ pakhai. Naiawng rakowi anging dow Jerusalem marow kowi uowi khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="JER 35:12-13" />Nami kung kowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai mih Juda hai Jerusalem maru-uüa tut-e kowchin ang khai. Now kowpe tek ang mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Tawngplawng kowchow ang tüng ang sang enni mih enni chün dowi? Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowh laiklow enni sünta dowi? <verse eid="JER 35:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14" />Rekab kowh chapa Jonadab dow achapauüa kowi pe khamah grep tui dowi chekhai, now achapauüa dow nami ana pek chün reng chekhai. Kawmat paw amatni dow khang grep tui reng tak chekhai; tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow amatni pipu-uüa kowh ana pek chün khai. Tawkche enni dow plan plan ang tek enni chepaw ang laiklow enni chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15" />Ang kowh nar risiuüa kowi aplan aplan enni tut-e ang uang chinah khai. Amatni dow krawi tek enni mih, “Tiama ngak hownia uang plan büa diah, now enni kowh chowm krang uowi krang aiungma changah büa diah. Akeng thurai kowi hang cham tawi chupiia büa diah. Enni che cham tawi chupiia dowi kowh chalow now enni hai enni pipu-uüa kowi kowh ang peah mih pren kowi enni naka uowi kown,” pakhai. Tawkche enni dow ang laiklow kowi pe ching dowi chekhai, now sünta paw sünta dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16" />Rekab kowh chapa Jonadab krungchakuüa dow amatni pipu-uüa kowh ana pek chün reng; tawkche enni dow ang laiklow chün dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17" />“‘Naiawng rakowi ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk. Sünta büa diah, Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa luk kowi phih nauang ting kownkow ang tekta khowk mih ang nauang pe tingah kown. Amatni kowi dow ang laiklow nachün kown mih ang tek pe khowk chowdiah. Tawkche ang laiklow sünta büa dowi chekhai. Amatni kowi dow ang hawah khowk chowdiah. Tawkche klang ang büa dowi chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18" />Nami kung kowi Jeremia tek pe Rekabituüa mih, “Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Enni dow enni kowh pipu Jonadab kowh ana pek chün khai, now aia kowh ana pek iawng enni uowi hai aia tek iawng enni chang khai. <verse eid="JER 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19" />Naiawng rakowi ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk, ang kowi nachupiia kownkow Rekab kowh chapa Jonadab krungchakuüa hownia katpaw maru nakhawr kown nadowi,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 35:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36" />
  <para style="s">Jeremia ruiah mih charam tikta pe mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1" />Juda pren kowi Josia chapa Jehoiakim chowm mang mih tali ning khe CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow mih Jeremia tut-e uang ting khai. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2" />“Jeremia, tuata hüah mih charam paw lowk diah, now Josia chowm mang mih hownia ani mowr kowi Israeluüa, Judauüa hai akeng chenchapuüa kowi kingküala mih laiklow ang tek en mih nami charam kowi ruiah diah. <verse eid="JER 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3" />Juda maru-uüa kowi naripah kownkow ang khowm bowkta mih lawnguan ta hanow amatni dow lup ngak chang natowta chepaw naia kown. Nahanow amatni kowh aprek hai angak dow ang nalawtta pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4" />Nakhowk khe Jeremia mih Neria kowh chapa Baruk kowi hawah khai, now Baruk dow Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih laiklow maten Jeremia nawr hownia sünta hanow nami tuata hüah mih charam kowi ruiah khai. <verse eid="JER 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5" />Nami kung kowi Jeremia tek pe Baruk mih, “CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi maru iukuüa pe kowi ang dowi. <verse eid="JER 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6" />Naiawng rakowi khang hawm mih ni khe CHAKRAMANG kim kowi en kowkowi diah, now nami charam tua kowi kowh en ruiah mih CHAKRAMANG laiklow maru kawmuüa kowi phat pe diah, now amatni kowh marow hownia uang mih Judauüa paw natawi ta kown towbowt. <verse eid="JER 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7" />Amatni dow naka saksing sanara kownkow CHAKRAMANG tut-e nalü naleng chepaw naia, now amatni kowh lup ngak changra hownia uang plan chepaw naia. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün maru-uüa lawnguan kowi dow lainowmma aia kunmarau mih hai sak-ih dowi mih laiklow CHAKRAMANG tek khai,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8" />Baruk dow risi Jeremia tek pe iawng rowprowp chang khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi nami charam tua kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow kowphat khai. <verse eid="JER 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9" />Juda pren kowi Josia chapa Jehoiakim chowm mang mih tanga ning kowi kowh taku la khe Jerusalem marowchakuüa hai Juda marow hownia kowh uang miuüa maten mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi khang hawm khai. <verse eid="JER 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10" />Nami khin khe Baruk dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh maru kawmuüa pur kowi nami charam tua kowi kowh arui uowi mih Jeremia hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG laiklow phat khai. Nakhowk khe Baruk uowi mih dow Safan kowh chapa Gemaria kim kowi chekhai. Gemaria kim uowi mih dow Thurai chup kim Tapplawt Sar re-e kowh aluk viadawng kowi chekhai. Gemaria dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh cha rui mih chekhai.<verse eid="JER 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11" />Gemaria kowh chapa Mikaia dow nami charam tua kowi kowh laiklow Baruk phat mih khin khe tawi sünta khai. (Mikaia dow Safan kowh chu chekhai). <verse eid="JER 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12" />Nami kung kowi Mikaia dow mang kim kowi kowh cha rui mih kowh towklak kowi kowkowi khai. Nakowi dow mang kowh maru iukuüa maten hawt takua talawm khai. Naiawngün maru iukuüa dow cha rui mih Elisama, Semaia chapa Delai, Akbawr chapa Elnathan, Safan chapa Gemaria, Hanania chapa Zedekia hai mang kowh akeng mih maru iukuüa maten chekhai. <verse eid="JER 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13" />Maru kawmuüa pur kowi Baruk phatah mih charam tua kowi kowh laiklow maten dow Mikaia mih naiawngün maru iukuüa kowi lawp pe khai. <verse eid="JER 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14" />Nakhowk khe maru iukuüa dow Baruk kowi nakowhaw kownkow Nathania chapa Jehudi kowi kowchinah khai. Now amatni krawi tek pe mih, “Maru kawmuüa pur kowi en phatah mih charam tua uang pawla diah,” pabüah khai. Nathania dow Selemia kowh chapa chekhai, Selemia dow Kusi kowh chapa chekhai. Nakhowk khe Neria chapa Baruk dow nami charam tua mih rut kowi uang dowkla kowlow se uang pawla khai. <verse eid="JER 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15" />Maru iukuüa tek pe Baruk mih, “Sakrauma hown chowm diah, now nami charam tua kowi kowh laiklow phat anging diah,” pabüah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 36:15">Nahanow Baruk dow nami charam kowi kowh laiklow mih amatni kowi phat pe khai. <verse eid="JER 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16" />Naiawngün laiklow tata hanow amatni dow kram kowh lowkkowlowk tamüla mak büah khai. Now Baruk kowi tek pe mih, “Naiawngün laiklow mang kowi a-i tek pe kown takla,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17" />Nami kung kowi Baruk kowi amatni lüntaah mih, “Naiawngün laiklow tawng iawng chow en ruiah mih tek anging diah. Jeremia nawr hownia hawt süntaah kowh en ruiah mih bow?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="JER 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi Baruk klangah mih, “Ow, naiawngün laiklow dow aia tek ang kowh mami charam kowi mang tui hown ang ruiah mih chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="JER 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19" />Nakhowk khe mang kowh maru iukuüa tek pe Baruk mih, “Jeremia enchi cham tapet iüa diah. Tawng kowi chow enchi uowi mih maru kowi hang cham tekla iüa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20" />Akung kowi maru iukuüa dow nami charam mih cha rui mih Elisama towklak kowi towla hanow mang kim kowi mang tut-e kowkowi khai, now naiawngün laiklow maten mang kowi kowtek pe büah khai. <verse eid="JER 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21" />Nakhowk khe mang dow nami charam tua nauang pawla kownkow Jehudi kowi kowchinah khai. Nami charam dow Jehudi mih cha rui mih Elisama towklak hownia mang tut-e uang pawla khai, now aia pur kowi kowh iowng mih maru iukuüa pur kowi nami charam tua kowi arui uowi mih laiklow phat pe khai. <verse eid="JER 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22" />Naiawng phaw mih dow taku la khe chekhai. Nakhowk khe aia dow chungrau khe kowh aia uowiah mih kim kowi chowm phülü chekhai, now aia pur kowi dow mairing towk rah puh kowi maih lün pluplup chekhai. <verse eid="JER 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23" />Nami charam Jehudi iu phatta sangrum hanow mang mih cha rui mih kowh saichow hown Jehudi phatta mih mowr sekta khai, now mairing puh kowi nawmta khai. Naiawng hown mang dow nami charam tua mih hing tikta bowk khai. <verse eid="JER 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24" />Nami charam kowi kowh laiklow sünta mih mang hai maru iukuüa dow kram dowi chekhai, now amatni kowh tawnguat paw sek büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25" />Elnathan, Delai hai Gemaria büah dow, “Aw mangkri, sakrauma hown nami charam tua hangkow tikta diah,” pahai mang kowi tek pe rengreng khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh laiklow mih mang sünta pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26" />Sünta pe lak dow aia mih cha rui mih Baruk hai Jeremia iüah kowi nauang khümla kownkow mang chapa Jeramel, Azriel kowh chapa Seraia hai Abdel kowh chapa Selemia büah kowi peah ana khai. Nachenganchepaw amatchi kowi dow CHAKRAMANG petta khai.<verse eid="JER 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27" />Jeremia kowh laiklow Baruk ruiah mih charam tua mang towkta kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow mih Jeremia tut-e maiawng uang ting khai: <verse eid="JER 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28" />“Juda pren mang Jehoiakim tikta mih charam kowi kowh arui uowi mih laiklow maten cham paw pe charam lowk hanow nakowi plan ruiah iawk diah. <verse eid="JER 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29" />Now Juda mang Jehoiakim kowi maiawng tek pe diah: CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Mami pren mih Babulawn mang nauang piakta kown, now maru hai tawncher akhaw aklaima nachangah kown,’ pahai charam tua kowi arui uowi rakowi nami charam tua dow en towkta khai. <verse eid="JER 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30" />Naiawng rakowi en lawnguan kowi ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, David kowh mang chowm rah kowi en krungchakuüa mih miapaw naia chowm kown nadowi. En kowh uak dow prang kowi nacham kuakta hüah kown, now nami uak dow ni-e aden dawng kowi hai iak-e arua dawng kowi nauowi hüah kown. <verse eid="JER 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31" />En, en kowh chauüa hai en kowh maru iukuüa chang angak rakowi ang narip enni kown. Enni luk kowi, Jerusalem kowi kowh uowi miuüa maten luk kowi hai Judauüa maten luk kowi ang khowm bowkta mih phih maten ang nauang pawla kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow ang laiklow sünta dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32" />Nakhowk khe Jeremia mih tuata hüah mih charam pawah lowk hanow cha rui mih Neria kowh chapa Baruk kowi peah khai. Juda pren mang Jehoiakim tikta mih charam tua kowi kowh laiklow maten Jeremia nawr hownia sünta hanow Baruk mih plan ruiah khai. Naiawng hai nami charam kowi dow naiawng mih laiklow bawngla mih ahuma chekhai.<verse eid="JER 36:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37" />
  <para style="s">Jeremia kla thawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1" />Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar dow Josia kowh chapa Zedekia kowi Juda pren kowi pe chowmah mang khai. Naiawng rakowi Zedekia dow Jehoiakim kowh chapa Jehoiakin takcha kowi ta chowm mang khai. <verse eid="JER 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2" />Tawkche risi Jeremia kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih laiklow dow mang Zedekia, aia kowh maru iukuüa hai prenchakuüa mih amiapaw sünta dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3" />Nami kung kowi paw mang Zedekia dow Selemia chapa Jehukal hai Maseia chapa uamow Zefania iüah kowi maiawng nakowtek kownkow Jeremia tut-e kowchinah khai. Aia krawi tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown CHAKRAMANG tut-e anging vüi chup anging Thurai diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4" />Nami khin khe Jeremia dow kla thawng dowi tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow thaulangma cham ia mang ia kat khai. <verse eid="JER 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5" />Nakhowk khe Babulawnuüa dow Jerusalem marow mih umta lut khai. Tawkche Faraw kowh siphaiuüa amatni kowi nauang senah kownkow Aigupta pren hownia uang tarü mih satang ta hanow amatni dow Jerusalem marow hownia powt khai.<verse eid="JER 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6" />Nami kung kowi risi Jeremia tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang ting khai. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7" />“Ang tut-e nauang lünta kownkow uang chin enni mih Juda mang kowi maiawng tek pe diah, ‘Aigupta mang kowh siphaiuüa nauang khowng enni kownkow uang miuüa dow amatni pren kowi naplan iawk kown. <verse eid="JER 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8" />Nami kung kowi Babulawnuüa dow uang plan hanow nami marow nauang sen kown. Amatni dow nami marow napowngta hanow natowkta büah kown. <verse eid="JER 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9" />Enni hownia Babulawnuüa napowt ngengche kown mih mapaw hangkow ka tuak büa diah, amatni dow enni hownia napowt kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10" />Babulawn siphaiuüa kowi dow enni sumta chepaw naia kown, now amatni dow ka ngarau kowh tangbung lak kowi takuak hüah chepaw naia kown. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow uangah hanow nami Jerusalem marow mih nauang towkta kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11" />Babulawn siphaiuüa dow Faraw kowh siphaiuüa kowi kram rakowi Jerusalem marow hownia powt khai. <verse eid="JER 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12" />Nakhowk khe Jeremia dow Benjamin süng kowi kowh aia kowh kakbak süng natawi powng kownkow Jerusalem marow hownia tarü khai. <verse eid="JER 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13" />Tawkche Benjamin Tapplawt re-e aia kowtowm mih khin khe aia kowi dow kangchawng mih aluchow Irija mih hawt khümah khai, now tek pe mih, “En dow Babulawnuüa kowi tawi tangila kownkow en kowkowi mih chekhai,” pakhai. Irija dow Selemia chapa, now Selemia dow Hanani chapa chekhai.<verse eid="JER 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14" />Nakhowk khe nami kangchawng mih kowi Jeremia tek pe mih, “Nami dow dai lai taih, ang dow Babulawn prakowi tawi tangi dowi,” pakhai. Tawkche aia dow Jeremia kowh laiklow sünta pe dowi chekhai. Aia dow Jeremia kowi khümla hanow mang kowh maru iukuüa pur kowi kowpawla khai. <verse eid="JER 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15" />Nami maru iukuüa dow Jeremia luk kowi kunmarau hanow aia kowi bawpah khai, now aia kowi dow cha rui mih Jonathan kim kowi klungta hüah khai. Amatni dow nami kim mih thawngrum iawng tawngah büah khai. <verse eid="JER 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16" />Jeremia kowi dow nami thawngrum iawng mih kim kowi kowh krawng khawng kowi towah büah khai; nakowi aia dow khin krama uowi khai. <verse eid="JER 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17" />Nami kung kowi mang Zedekia mih kowchin maru hanow Jeremia kowi uang hawla khai, now ku lüntaah mih, “En tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uowi bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 37:17">Nakhowk khe Jeremia klangah mih, “Ow, uowi. En kowi dow Babulawn mang rut kowi naap en kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18" />Nami kung kowi mang Zedekia kowi Jeremia plan tek pe mih, “En, en kowh maru iukuüa hai maiawngün maru kawmuüa kowi tawng ngak chow ang changta khai? Tawngplawng kowchow thawngrum kowi enni tow ang khai? <verse eid="JER 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19" />‘Babulawn pren mang dow en kowi hai mami pren kowi nauang sen kown nadowi,’ pahai tek enni mih risiuüa tawng kowi chow? <verse eid="JER 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20" />Tawkche kawmat mih aw chakramang ang kowh mangkri, sakrauma hai ang laiklow sünta diah. Now ang tek iawng chang ang diah. Ang kowi dow cha rui mih Jonathan kim kowi hauang chin ang tham bowt. Nakowi en kowchin ang hanow ang nakowng kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21" />Nakhowk khe mang Zedekia dow Jeremia kowi kangchawngra viadawng kowi natowah kown mih pe ana khai, now marow kowi kawmpah khowk dowi mowr kawmpah sum miuüa mih ni towng aia kowi nauang pela lowk chi kown mih pe ana khai. Naiawng rakowi Jeremia kowi dow kangchawngra viadawng kowi uang towah khai.<verse eid="JER 37:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38" />
  <para style="s">Jeremia kowi tuikuam kowi kuakah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1" />Maru kawmuüa tut-e Jeremia tek laiklow mih khin khe Matan kowh chapa Sefatia, Pasur kowh chapa Gedalia, Selemia kowh chapa Jehukal hai Malkia kowh chapa Pasur büah mih tawi ta khai. <verse eid="JER 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2" />Jeremia tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng, ‘Mami marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow tasen, khown hai makowng hawi hown nakowng kown. Tawkche Babulawnuüa tut-e kowh kowtaap mih maru dow nakowng kown nadowi. Aia kowh asak dow naplai kown. <verse eid="JER 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3" />Mami marow dow Babulawn pren mang kowh siphaiuüa rut kowi ang naapta kown. Amatni dow mami marow napowngta kown,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4" />Nakhowk khe mang kowh maru iukuüa dow mang kowi tek pe mih, “Jeremia kowi kowngta kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow naiawng krawi tek mih hownia Jerusalem marow kowi kowh siphai hai maru kawmuüa kowi krawi nen pe sak khai. Aia dow naiawngün maru-uüa naiung kown mih nau dowi chekhai, aia nau mih dow angak chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5" />Maru iukuüa kowi mang Zedekia klangah mih, “Aia mih enni tut-e uowi hüah towbowt. Enni kowi ang nowng hang enni dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6" />Nakhowk khe amatni dow Jeremia kowi mang kowh chapa Malkia kowh tuikuam kowi leng hown iu klaah khai. Nami tuikuam dow kangchawngra viadawng re-e chekhai. Nami kuam kowi dow suplawk kangowh chekhai. Now Jeremia dow nami suplawk dawng kowi tamir ngialia khai.<verse eid="JER 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7" />Tawkche mang kim kowi kowh maru iuk Ebed-Melek dow kuam kowi Jeremia kowi kuakta mih tawi ta khai. Ebed-Melek dow Ethiawpia chenchap chekhai. Nami khin khe mang dow Benjamin tapplawt kowi chowm phülü chekhai. <verse eid="JER 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8" />Ebed-Melek dow mang kim hownia uang lawt hanow mang kowi kowtek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9" />“Aw ang kowh mangkri, risi Jeremia luk kowi nami maru-uüa chang mih dow lup ngak chekhai. Amatni dow Jeremia kowi mih kuam kowi kuakah khai; aia dow nakowi akhawr hown nakowng kown chowbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow marow kowi dow kawmpah khowk bowk khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10" />Nakhowk khe mang dow Ethiawpia chenchap Ebed-Melek kowi maiawng peah ana khai, “Ang kowh maru kowi pawla 30 ia diah, now risi Jeremia nakowng dowi kownkow tuikuam hownia uang khowngla büah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11" />Nakhowk khe Ebed-Melek dow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi pawla now mang kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah dak kowi kowh kim kowi kowkowi khai. Aia dow nami kim lak hownia tawnguat prim hai aseknama mih tawnguat pawla khai, now naiawngün tawnguat dow tuikuam kowi Jeremia tut-e leng hown iu kla pe khai. <verse eid="JER 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12" />Ethiawpia chenchap Ebed-Melek tek pe Jeremia mih, “Nami tawnguat prim hai aseknama mih tawnguat dow en kowh iangdak kowi paah diah, nahanow leng kowi dow en naka ngarau kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai. Jeremia dow nami iawng chang khai. <verse eid="JER 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13" />Nakhowk khe amatni dow aia kowi leng hown tuikuam hownia uang küngla khai. Nami kung kowi Jeremia dow kangchawngra viadawng kowi uowi khai.<verse eid="JER 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang kowi Jeremia plan peah prengia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14" />Nami kung kowi mang Zedekia dow kowchin maru hanow risi Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG kim kupra sum lawmbawr mih plawt kowi uang pawla khai. Mang tek pe Jeremia mih, “Ang lünta en laiklow lowk kown. Ang tut-e tawng iawng mih laiklow paw hangkow tada diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15" />Nakhowk khe mang Zedekia kowi Jeremia tek pe mih, “Ang che tek en hanow en nakowngta ang kown, now ang pe en prengia chepaw en nasünta kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16" />Nahanow mang Zedekia dow kukpa Jeremia tut-e takham sawi se tek pe mih, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming lüklau se ang takham khowk. Ang nakowngta en kown nadowi, now saita en kown nau miuüa rut kowi paw ang naap en kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17" />Nakhowk khe Jeremia tek pe Zedekia mih, “Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘En che Babulawn kowi kowh maru iukuüa tut-e khamsum hanow en kowh sak naplai kown, now Jerusalem marow paw natowkta kown nadowi. Nami klen kowi en hai en kimchakuüa dow naplai kown. <verse eid="JER 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18" />Tawkche Babulawn pren mang kowh maru iukuüa tut-e en che khamsum dowi hanow nami marow dow Babulawnuüa rut kowi naapta en kown, now amatni dow nami marow natowkta en kown. En matia paw amatni hownia naia plai kown nadowi,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19" />Nakhowk khe Jeremia kowi mang Zedekia klangah mih, “Kowmatia pren kowi towta hanow Babulawn pren kowi tangila mih Judauüa kowi dow ang kram khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Babulawnuüa dow ang kowi Judauüa rut kowi naapta ang chepaw naia kown, now amatni dow nachang ang naklak chepaw naia kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20" />Jeremia klangah mih, “En che CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow chün khai hanow Babulawnuüa dow Judauüa rut kowi naap en kown nadowi. Nahanow aiungma en naka uowi kown, now en naplai kown. <verse eid="JER 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21" />Tawkche en che khamsum dowi hanow mukmang kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tüng ang iawng naphaw kown. Mukmang kowi CHAKRAMANG tüng ang mih maiawng: <verse eid="JER 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22" />Juda mang kim kowi kowh ta sing uowi mih masiuüa hawmh kowi Babulawn pren kowi kowh siphai aluchowuüa khümla khai. Nakhowk khe naiawngün masiuüa hawmh tek en mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">“‘En kowh auiua sinuüa dow tiama ngak prakowi cham pawla en khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">en kowi dow amatni kuan en khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow en kowh khawk mih suplawk nek kowi tadup khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">naiawng akrat hown en uowi mih khita hanow en kowh auiuauüa dow nuata en khai,’ napa kown.<verse eid="JER 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23" />“En kowh masi hai en kowh chauüa kowi dow Babulawnuüa tut-e nakowpawla kown. En matia paw amatni rut hownia naia plai kown nadowi. En kowi dow Babulawn pren mang nakhüm en kown, now aia dow Jerusalem marow natowkta en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24" />Nakhowk khe mang Zedekia tek pe Jeremia mih, “Naiawngün lawnguan dow mia kowi paw hang cham tek diah. En che cham tek hanow en nakowng kown. <verse eid="JER 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25" />Maru iukuüa che en hown ang talawp mih ta hanow amatni dow nauang chepaw naia kown, now maiawng natek en chepaw naia kown, ‘Mang kowi tawng chow en tek pe mih tek anging diah, now mang tawng chow tek en mih tek anging diah. Anging tut-e mapaw hauang tada diah; en che tada khai hanow anging nakowngta en kown,’ napa kown. <verse eid="JER 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Jonathan kim kowi nakowsa ang dowi kownkow Mang kowi ang tek pe khowk chowdiah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi che kowsa ang hanow ang dow nakowng kown chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27" />Maru iukuüa maten dow Jeremia tut-e uang hanow uang lünta khai. Nakhowk khe Jeremia dow aia kowi kowh mang peah mih ana iawng rowprowp amatni kowi hawt klangah khai. Naiawng tek pe hanow amatni dow aia kowi lüntaah dowi bowt chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mang hown aia talawp mih laiklow dow amiapaw tawi ta dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28" />Jerusalem marow Babulawn pren mang uang powng dowi mowr Jeremia dow kangchawng miuüa kowh viadawng kowi uowi khai.<verse eid="JER 38:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow napowngta kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1" />Jerusalem marow dow maiawng powngta khai. Juda pren kowi Zedekia chowm mang mih taku ning hamüt la khe Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar dow aia kowh siphai maten kowi pawla now Jerusalem marow kowi kowkowi khai, now Jerusalem marow dow kowrumta lut khai. <verse eid="JER 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2" />Now Zedekia chowm mang mih lailowk ning nga kowi kowh tali la taku ni khe amatni dow Jerusalem marow tap mih khueah para khai. <verse eid="JER 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3" />Nakhowk khe Babulawn pren mang kowh maru iuk maten dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang kup khai, now marow dawnglang kowi kowh tapplawt kowi uang chowm büah khai. Naiawngün maru iukuüa dow Samgar marow hownia Nergal-Sarezer, maru iukuüa kowi kowh lang kri mih Nebo-Sarsekim hai Babulawn pren mang kowh akeng mih maru iukuüa chekhai. <verse eid="JER 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4" />Juda pren mang Zedekia hai aia kowh siphaiuüa dow naiawngün maru iukuüa kowi khi hanow kram kowh powt khai. Amatni dow iak-e khe mang kowh bakan prakowi mangla mih tiama iawng panow pre buk mih tap takra kowi kowh tapplawt iawng marow hownia Jawrdan lawngrawi prakowi powt büah khai.<verse eid="JER 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5" />Tawkche Babulawn pren mang kowh siphai hawmh dow amatni kowi kawikrawi khai, now Jeriko dowm nai kowi dow Zedekia kowi ka khümta büah khai. Amatni dow aia kowi khümla now Hamat pren kowi kowh Ribla marow kowi mang Nebuknezar tut-e kowpawla khai. Now mang Nebuknezar dow aia kowi ripah kown mih pe ana khai. <verse eid="JER 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6" />Mang Nebuknezar dow Ribla marow kowi Zedekia pur kowi achapauüa kowi saita pe khai, now Juda pren kowi kowh maru iuk maten kowi paw aia saita khai. <verse eid="JER 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7" />Nami kung kowi mang Nebuknezar dow Zedekia kowi laita pe mik khai, now aia kowi dow Babulawn pren kowi nakowpawla kownkow kri leng hown tawmah khai.<verse eid="JER 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8" />Babulawn siphaiuüa dow mang kowh kim hai maru kawmuüa kowh kim mih towkta pe bowk khai, now Jerusalem marow tap paw khueta pe büah khai. <verse eid="JER 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9" />Nami khin khe kowh marow kowi ta uowi miuüa, kowmatia chenchap kowi towta now Babulawnuüa hown tawi tabawng miuüa hai pren kowi kowh ta uowi mih maru-uüa kowi dow Nebuzardan mih khümla hanow Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. Nebuzardan dow mang chawng mih siphaiuüa kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. <verse eid="JER 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10" />Tawkche Nebuzardan mih krawng bawn uowi dowi mih angaraima miuüa kowi dow Juda pren kowi ta towla khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow amatni kowh grep krum hai laih mih ta peah khai.<verse eid="JER 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeremia kowi Thurai lawngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11" />Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar dow aia kowh achawng mih siphai aluchow Nebuzardan kowi Jeremia lawnguan kowi maiawng peah ana khai: <verse eid="JER 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12" />“Aia kowi dow mingkhetah kaneu diah. Aia kowi dow hangkow changah naklak diah, now aia tek iawng chang pe diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 39:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="JER 39:13-14" />Naiawng rakowi kangchawng miuüa kowh lang kri mih Nebuzardan, mang kowh prengia pek mih Nergal-Sarezer, maru iuk Nebusazban hai mang kowh akeng mih maru iukuüa dow Jeremia kowi nauang pawla kownkow kowchin pe maru khai, now naiawngün dow Jeremia kowi kangchawngra viadawng hownia uang pawla khai. Amatni dow Jeremia kowi aia kim kowi nakowpawla kownkow Ahikam kowh chapa Gedalia rut kowi ap-ah khai. Ahikam dow Safan kowh chapa chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Jeremia dow Juda pren kowi aia maru-uüa tut-e tawi uowi khai.<verse eid="JER 39:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15" />Kangchawngra viadawng kowi Jeremia takhang reng tak khe CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow aia tut-e maiawng uang ting khai: <verse eid="JER 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16" />“Ethiawpia pren hownia kowh Ebed-Melek tut-e kowkowi hanow kowtek pe diah. Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Mami Jerusalem marow kowi dow ang tekta mih iawng ang nauang pe tachiah kown. Nami dow aiung hown nadowi kowi angak hown ang nauang pe tachiah kown. Naiawng uang phaw mih khin khe dow enni nakhi kown. <verse eid="JER 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17" />Tawkche en kowi dow ang nalawng en kown, now en kramah miuüa tut-e dow en kowi ang naap en kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow ang luk kowi neplawng nesak khai. Naiawng rakowi ang nalawng en kown. En dow en ransu-uüa kowh saidawng kowi en nakowng kown nadowi. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pape khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 39:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40" />
  <para style="s">Juda pren kowi Jeremia uowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1" />Babulawn pren mang chawng mih aluchow Nebuzardan dow Jerusalem maru-uüa hai Judauüa kowi Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. Nami khin khe khümla miuüa pungmadawng kowi aia mih Jeremia kowi paw khi khai. Tawkche Jeremia kowi dow aia mih Rama marow hownia now tiama kowi lawtta khai. Nami khin khe aia tut-e dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow uang ting khai. <verse eid="JER 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2" />Jeremia kowi lawtta mih khin khe Nebuzardan dow aia kowi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai mih Judauüa luk kowi mami piakra nauang ting kown mih laiklow tek khai. <verse eid="JER 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3" />Kawmat dow CHAKRAMANG mih aia tekta mih iawng chang khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak enni chang khai, now aia kowh laiklow enni chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4" />Tawkche ani dow en rut kowi kowh lawngha leng ang latta en khowk. En che nau hanow ang hown Babulawn pren kowi en tawi ia tawi chekhai; en kowi dow ang naming nakhet en kown. Tawkche en tawi kown nau dowi hanow hauang tawi diah. Mü diah! Paprenma dow en pur kowi uowi hüah towbowt; en naura kowi en krawi ia uowi. <verse eid="JER 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5" />Tawkche makowi che en uowi kown now Ahikam kowh chapa Gedalia tut-e kowplan diah. (Gedalia dow Safan kowh chu chekhai). Gedalia dow Juda kowi kowh marow maten luk kowi nachang alow kownkow Babulawn pren mang towah mih chekhai. En nau now aia hown maru pungmadawng kowi en tawi ia uowi. Nachenganchepaw en che nau now en naura kowi en krawi nowng kowi kown. Nami dow en matia low taih,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi siphai aluchow dow aia kowi chakkham hai awmrawm sung peah now pe mangah khai. <verse eid="JER 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6" />Nakhowk khe Jeremia dow Mizpa marow kowi Ahikam chapa Gedalia tut-e kowkowi khai, now pren kowi kowh ta uowi miuüa pungmadawng kowi tawi uown uowi khai.<verse eid="JER 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gedalia kruitown Juda pren mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7" />Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar mih Ahikam kowh chapa Gedalia kowi Juda pren kruitown mih towah khai, now Babulawn pren kowi tawi takhang dowi mih ngaraima mih kachakuüa, masiuüa hai ngeuüa kowi namingkhet kown mih kurdik paw peah khai. Naiawngün satang dow Babulawn pren mang tut-e tawi taap dowi mih Juda pren kowh maru iukuüa hai siphai aluchowuüa mih tawi ta khai. <verse eid="JER 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8" />Nami satang tata hanow amatni dow Mizpa marow kowi Gidalia tut-e uang khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow Nethania kowh chapa Ismael, Karea kowh chapa Johanan, Netofa marow hownia kowh Tanhumet kowh chapa Seraia, Makhathi kowh chapa Jazania hai amatni kowh maru-uüa chekhai. <verse eid="JER 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9" />Now amatni hai amatni kowh maru-uüa tut-e kham sawi se Gedalia tek pe mih, “Babulawn pren kowi kowh kruitown miuüa kowi hangkow kram büa diah. Mami pren kowi uowi büa diah, now Babulawn mang tek iawng chang büa diah. Naiawng che enni chang hanow enni naiung kown. <verse eid="JER 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10" />Mizpa kowi ang nauowi kown, now a-i tut-e kowh nauang kown mih Babulawnuüa kowi natawi tangila enni kown mih laiklow ang natek pe kown taih. Tawkche enni mih grep tui, aden khin khe kowh uih-ak hai sau mih krawi kuaah hanow enni kowh puh kowi enni nakrümah kown, now enni napowngah kown mih kua hai marow kowi dow enni nauowi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11" />Babulawn pren mang dow Juda pren kowi ta towla maru sangrum khai, now naiawngün maru-uüa luk kowi kowh nakruitown kown mih kurdik dow Gedalia kowi towah khai. Naiawngün satang dow Moab, Amawn, Edawm hai akeng pren kowi kowh Judauüa mih ta khai. <verse eid="JER 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12" />Nakhowk khe amatni dow amatni cham tauet mih pren hownia Juda pren Mizpa marow kowi Gedalia tut-e uang plan khai. Amatni dow grep tui hai aden khin khe kowh uih mih ahuma krümah khai.<verse eid="JER 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13" />Akung kowi Karea chapa Johanan hai dowm kowi kowh uowi mih siphai hawmh kowh aluchowuüa dow Mizpa marow kowi Gedalia tut-e uangah hanow tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14" />“Amawnuüa kowh mang Balis saita en kownkow Nathania chapa Ismael kowi uang chinah mih en tuk bow?” pabüah khai. Tawkche Ahikam chapa Gedalia dow amatni kowh laiklow kowi owm dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15" />Nakhowk khe kukpa Gedalia kowi Karea chapa Johanan uang tek pe mih, “En che pe ang ana hanow Nathania chapa Ismael kowi ang kowsaita kown, amiapaw natuk kown nadowi. Nahanow aia mih naka sai en kown nadowi bowt. Aia che uang sai en khai hanow en riaret kowi kowh Judauüa mih nacham taset plawt kown, now Juda pren kowi kowh ta sing mih maru-uüa dow nakowng bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16" />Tawkche Ahikam kowh chapa Gedalia dow Karea kowh chapa Johanan kowi tek pe mih, “Naiawng mih lup hang chang diah. Ismael lawnguan kowi kowh en tek mih dow dai lai chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 40:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41" />
  <para style="s">Gedalia kowi saita mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JER 41:1-2" />Nathania kowh chapa Ismael dow mang krungchak chekhai, now aia dow mang kowh maru iuk chekhai. (Ismael dow Elisama kowh chu chekhai). Aia dow ranit la khe pawla maru hamüt ia hanow Ahikam chapa Gedalia tut-e Mizpa marow kowi kowkowi khai. Now nakowi amatni taiua cha hawm mih khin khe Eilsama hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih hamüt ia mih maru dow Babulawn pren mang towah mih kruitown mih Gedalia kowi saidawng hown saita büah khai. <verse eid="JER 41:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3" />Nami klen kowi Mizpa kowi kowh Gedalia hown tawi uowi mih Judauüa maten hai Babulawn siphaiuüa maten kowi dow Ismael mih saita bowk khai.<verse eid="JER 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="JER 41:4-5" />Gedalia kowng mih auai ni khe paw aia kowng mih amiapaw tuk dowi tak chekhai. Nakhowk khe Sekem marow, Silo marow hai Samari marow hownia maru uang 80 ia chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow kawmdi uanap hai nam iungma mih maikhük chang müa uanh uang pawla hanow CHAKRAMANG kim prakowi uang tarü khai. Amatni dow khaita mawmpawi prowng, amatni thekta nak mih tawnguat khupma hai amatni buk kow kowi tata naknak hanow uang tarü khai. <verse eid="JER 41:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6" />Ismael dow naiawngün maru-uüa hown nauang takrum kownkow kar se kar se Mizpa marow hownia uang khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa hown aia takrum mih khin khe aia tek pe mih, “Chu, Ahikam kowh chapa Gedalia tut-e a-i kowkowi lah,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7" />Marow kowi amatni uang ting hown krowksang Ismael hai aia hown kowh naiawngün uang tawi mih maru-uüa kowi saiah khai, now naiawngün uak dow tuikuam lowk mih kowi kuakah büah khai. <verse eid="JER 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8" />Tawkche amatni pungmadawng hownia hamüt ia mih maru dow Ismael kowi tek pe mih, “Hauang saita anging diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow püm, iakmow, sau hai kuai tui dow dowm kowi anging petta hüah chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow Ismael mih lawtta khai. Amatni kowi dow akeng miuüa hown aia saiah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9" />Ismael dow Gedalia hai akeng mih maru-uüa uak mih tuikuam kowi kuakah khai. Nami tuikuam dow mang Basa hownia Israel naka lawngra kownkow Juda mang Asa thaiah mih chowdiah. Tawkche Ismael dow nami tuikuam mih uak kangowh atekma changah khai.<verse eid="JER 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10" />Ismael dow Mizpa marow kowi kowh ta uowi miuüa kowi khümla khai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi dow mang kowh chamauüa hai nakowi kowh towla mih akeng maru-uüa chekhai. Mang kowh chawng mih aluchow Nebuzardan dow naiawngün maru-uüa luk kowi kowh kruitown mih Gedalia kowi towah khai. Ismael dow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi khümla now Amawnuüa pren kowi kowpawla khai.<verse eid="JER 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11" />Karea kowh chapa Johanan hai aia kowh siphai hawmh dow Ismael kowh lup ngak satang maten ta khai. <verse eid="JER 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12" />Nami khin khe amatni dow amatni kowh maru-uüa kowi pawla hanow Ismael hown nakowtasen kownkow tarü khai. Amatni dow aia kowi Gibeawn marow kowi kowh kanh aiukma mih re-e kowkrum büah khai. <verse eid="JER 41:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="JER 41:13-14" />Mizpa marow hownia kowh Ismael khümla mih maru-uüa dow Johanan hai aia hown siphai aluchowuüa kowi khita hanow awmrawm khai, now amatni dow Johanan tut-e kowkowi khai. <verse eid="JER 41:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15" />Tawkche Ismael hai aia hown kowh tawi mih raiat ia mih maru dow Johanan hownia ku powt hanow Amawnuüa tut-e kowkowi khai.<verse eid="JER 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren kowi Johanan pawla Judauüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16" />Nami kung kowi Johanan hai aia hown kowh siphai aluchowuüa dow Mizpa marow hownia kowh cham takhang miuüa kowi Gibeawn marow hownia uang lawngla khai. Gedalia kowi Ismael saita kung kowi Ismael rut hownia naiawngün siphaiuüa, masiuüa, ngeuüa hawmh hai mang kowh maru iukuüa kowi dow Johanan uang lawngla khai. <verse eid="JER 41:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="JER 41:17-18" />Amatni dow Babulawnuüa kowi kram kowh Juda pren hownia powt khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Ismael dow Babulawn pren mang towah mih kruitown mih Gedalia kowi saita khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Aigupta pren prakowi powt büah mih khin khe Bethlehem re-e kowh Gerut-Kimham kua kowi uowila pre sum ni khai.<verse eid="JER 41:17-18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42" />
  <para style="s">Maru kawmuüa vüi Jeremia chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="JER 42:1-2" />Nami kung kowi siphai aluchowuüa maten, Karea kowh chapa Johanan, Hosaia kowh chapa Jezania hai maru maten uang hanow Jeremia kowi tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown anging kowh laiklow sünta diah, now mami ta sing uowi mih maru-uüa vüi kowi CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai tut-e awr lü awr leng diah. Auown khe dow anging akawmma chowdiah. Tawkche kawmat dow anging pre sum iachow taih bowt mih en khi khowk chekhai. <verse eid="JER 42:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3" />CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai tut-e awr lü awr leng diah, nahanow aia dow tawng pra chow anging namang kown mih hai tawng chow anging nachang kown mih natek anging kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4" />Amatni kowi risi Jeremia klangah mih, “Enni kowh laiklow ang ta khowk. Enni uang lü mih iawng CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tut-e ang nalü ngengche kown taih. CHAKRAMANG tek mih maten ang natek enni kown taih, enni tut-e tawngpaw ang nait nadaah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5" />Nami khin khe Jeremia kowi amatni tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai uang pe tek en iawng anging che chang dowi hanow CHAKRAMANG dow aia tek iawng anging chang dowi pami saksi thuak mih pacham na lah. <verse eid="JER 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6" />Anging kowchin en mih CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai laiklow anging nachün kown. Nami laiklow anging tut-e iung chepaw iung dowi chepaw anging nachün kown. CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai kowh laiklow che anging chün hanow anging naiung kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7" />Hamüt ni kung kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow dow Jeremia tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="JER 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8" />Nakhowk khe aia dow Johanan, aia hown kowh uang tawi mih siphai aluchowuüa hai maru kawmuüa kowi kuaah lawmah khai. <verse eid="JER 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9" />Amatni kowi aia tek pe mih, “Enni tek ang iawng nakowtek kownkow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tut-e enni kowchin ang khai. Nami CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, <verse eid="JER 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10" />‘Mami pren kowi che enni uowi khai hanow ang nape iuksown enni kown, ang napiak enni kown nadowi. Singh chowk iawng ang nachowk enni kown, ang nachawita enni kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni luk kowi ang uang pawla phih rakowi ang sak kowi rau khai. <verse eid="JER 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11" />Enni kramah mih Babulawn pren mang kowi dow hangkow kram büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow enni tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. Ang dow natakhula enni kown, now amatni rut hownia ang nalawng enni kown. <verse eid="JER 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12" />Ang nasaksing sana enni kown, now Babulawn pren mang kowi paw nasaksing sana enni kownkow ang napeah saktuak kown. Now aia mih mami enni matia pren kowi nape uowi enni kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13" />“Tawkche CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai laiklow chün dowi kowi, ‘Anging matia pren kowi uowi kown anging nau dowi; <verse eid="JER 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14" />Aigupta pren kowi taih anging kowuowi kown. Nakowi dow tasen paw anging nakhi kown nadowi bowt, baw tün paw anging nata kown nadowi bowt, now chakkham khawr rakowi sakkrai hown paw anging nauowi kown nadowi bowt,’ pahai enni tek chepaw naia kown. <verse eid="JER 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15" />Naiawng che enni tek khai hanow ta sing uowi mih Judauüa CHAKRAMANG laiklow sünta diah. Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Enni che Aigupta pren kowi nauowi kown mih khowmta bowkta kowh kowuowi khai hanow, <verse eid="JER 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16" />enni kramah mih tasenra kowi enni nakla kown, enni kramah mih khown paw Aigupta pren kowi pat nauang tawi krawi enni kown, now nakowi mih enni nakowng kown. <verse eid="JER 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17" />Aigupta pren kowi kowuowi kownkow khowm bowkta khowk miuüa dow nakowi kowuowi mih khin khe tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi hown nakowng kown. Ang nauang pawla kown mih phih hownia lowk iachow paw naia plai kown nadowi,’ pape khai.<verse eid="JER 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18" />“Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa luk kowi ang sak-ihra uowi dowi mih hai kunmaraura ang uang pe tingah iawng enni che Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi hanow enni luk kowi paw ang kowh kunmaraura nauang ting kown. Nakhowk khe enni kowi dow maru naprawng naren hai nasui enni kown. Naiawng enni phaw mih khi hanow maru dow natakrow kown, now enni ming hown maru mih nacham tape piati kown. Enni kowh pren mih katpaw enni naplan khi kown nadowi bowt,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JER 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19" />Aw ta sing uowi mih Judauüa, CHAKRAMANG tek enni mih, ‘Aigupta pren kowi hangkow kowi büah,’ pakhai. Nauowi kaneu kownkow ani kowh ang tek enni mih laiklow sak kowi towah büa diah. <verse eid="JER 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20" />Enni dow kramra uowima mih lup ngak enni chang mih chowbowt. CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai tut-e nakowtek lai kownkow enni chin ang khai. Enni tek ang mih, ‘Anging vüi kowi CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai tut-e awr lü awr leng anging diah, now aia tek mih srui uang tek anging diah. Nahanow aia tek iawng anging nachang kown taih,’ pakhai. <verse eid="JER 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21" />Ani dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow ang tek enni khowk. Tawkche enni tut-e kowh CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai uang pe tek ang mih laiklow dow kawmat paw enni chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22" />Naiawng rakowi mami laiklow tuakah büa diah: Enni kowuowiah kown nau mih Aigupta pren kowi dow tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi hown enni nakowng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 42:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43" />
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren kowi Jeremia kowi maru pawla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1" />CHAKRAMANG uang pe tekah mih laiklow maten dow Jeremia mih maru kawmuüa tut-e krawi tek khai. <verse eid="JER 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2" />Nakhowk khe Hosaia kowh chapa Azaria, Karea kowh chapa Johanan hai akeng mih bawrima mih maru-uüa tek pe Jeremia mih, “En dai. Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi hanow nakowuowi dowi kown mih laiklow nauang tek anging kownkow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai uang chin en dowi. <verse eid="JER 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3" />Naiawng nauang tek anging kown mih Neria kowh chapa Baruk tek en kowh chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Babulawnuüa rut kowi naapta anging hanow natow anging nar kown nau kowh chekhai, nadowi now nakowngta anging kown aia nau kowh chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4" />Naiawng hown Johanan, siphai aluchowuüa hai maru maten Juda pren kowi nauowi phülü kown mih lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek üata khai. <verse eid="JER 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5" />Johanan hai siphaiuüa maten mih akeng pren kowi cham taset tauet mih Judauüa hai akeng pren hownia Juda pren kowi uang plan mih Judauüa maten kowi pawla hanow Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="JER 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6" />Amatni dow Gedalia rut kowi mang kowh kangchawng mih aluchow Nebuzardan apla mih masiuüa, kachakuüa, ngeuüa hai mang chamauüa chekhai. Amatni hown risi Jeremia hai Baruk kowi paw Aigupta pren kowi pawla büah khai. <verse eid="JER 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7" />Naiawng hai amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow üata büah khai. Amatni dow Aigupta pren kowi kowkup hanow Tapanhes marow mowr kowkowi khai.<verse eid="JER 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8" />Tapanhes marow kowi uowi khe Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9" />“Judauüa pur kowi aiuk aiukma mih huaklu cham paw sangrum diah, now Tapanhes marow kowi kowh mang kim re-e be pe <char style="w">ipbawn</char> mih viadawng kowi naiawngün huaklu mih kowdupah diah. <verse eid="JER 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10" />Nami kung kowi dow Judauüa kowi maiawng tek pe diah: Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Babulawn pren mang ang kowh nar Nebuknezar kowi ang nauang hawla kown, now mami re-e kowh ang petah mih huaklu luk kowi aia kowh mang chowm rah ang natow pe kown. Aia dow nami luk kowi nakhup pe mang tangbung kown. <verse eid="JER 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11" />Aia dow uangah now Aigupta pren kowi nauang piakah kown. Nami khin khe nakowng kownkow khowm bowkta khowk miuüa dow nakowng kown, nakhümla kownkow khowm bowkta khowk miuüa kowi dow nakhümla kown, now saidawng hown nakowng kownkow khowm bowkta khowk miuüa dow tasenra kowi saidawng hown nakowng kown. <verse eid="JER 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12" />Aia dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh arup aren chupra kim ün natowkta pe kown, now arup aren ün napawla pe kown. Aia dow Aigupta pren mih akhaw aklaima nachangah kown, now aiamat dow ruapur thing mih maru sükla kelang now mang mih iawng nami hownia thaulangma namang kown. <verse eid="JER 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13" />Aia dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh sat nammow chupiiara chüng napiakta kown, now Aigupta kowi kowh arup arenuüa chupiiara kim ün natowkta kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 43:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44" />
  <para style="s">Chup arup rakowi piakra uang ting mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1" />Aigupta pren kowi kowh Migdawl, Tapanhes, Memfis hai tawngphak pra kowh süng kowi uowi mih Judauüa maten lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow Jeremia tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="JER 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk, Jerusalem hai Juda pren kowi kowh kua hai marow maten luk kowi phih akraingma ang uang pawla mih enni khi khowk chekhai. Naiawngün kua hai marow dow kawmat paw apiaknama uowi reng tak chekhai. Tawkche nakowi dow miapaw uowiah dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JER 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3" />Naiawng phaw mih dow amatni kowh angak rakowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni mih arup arenuüa pur kowi cham towk maikhük hai cham chupiia mih hownia lainowmma towk ang kunmarau khai. Naiawngün arup aren lawnguan kowi amatni paw tuk dowi chekhai, enni paw tuk dowi chekhai, now enni kowh pipu-uüa paw tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4" />Ang kowh nar risiuüa kowi amatni tut-e plan plan ang uang chin pe khowk chowdiah. Ang suiah mih suiiai kaniaima mih lup nachang dowi kownkow amatni kowi ang kowh risiuüa tek pe khowk chowdiah. <verse eid="JER 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow nami laiklow chün dowi chekhai, now sünta paw sünta dowi chekhai. Amatni dow amatni kowh angak hownia uang plan dowi, now arup aren pur kowi towk maikhük mih paw taingta büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6" />Naiawng rakowi amatni luk kowi ang kowh kunmaraura lün pluplup mih ang uang khük pe khai. Nami dow Judauüa kowh marow hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh tiama towng lünla plup khai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün marow dow ani mowr akhaw aklaima hai apiaknama uowi reng tak.<verse eid="JER 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7" />“Kawmat ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk, tawngplawng kowchow naiawng khowt kowmatia kowi enni tuk piakah khai? Enni dow masiuüa, kachakuüa hai ngeuüa maten kowi Juda pren hownia uang lawtla hanow enni matia hai amatni kowi paw enni piakla khai. <verse eid="JER 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8" />Enni uang uowiah mih Aigupta pren kowi kowh arup arenuüa pur kowi enni towk maikhük hanow tawngplawng kowchow enni tuk towk ang kunmarau khai? Enni dow enni matia kowi natapiak kown, now lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten nasui enni hai enni kowh ming hown nacham tape piati kown. <verse eid="JER 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9" />Juda pren hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh tiama towng enni pipu-uüa, Juda manguüa hai mang masi hawmuüa, enni hai enni kowh masi hawmuüa chang ngak mih enni tamata khai bow? <verse eid="JER 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10" />Ani pat paw enni changta angak rakowi enni sak kowi rau dowi tak chekhai, now ang kowi paw ringkawma hown kram dowi tak chekhai. Enni hai enni pipu-uüa tut-e kowh ang pe enni mih rirow hai ari aiang miapaw enni chün dowi. <verse eid="JER 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11" />Naiawng rakowi ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai mih nauang pawla enni phih hanow enni bowkbowk kowi napiakta enni kownkow kamrütta khowk. <verse eid="JER 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12" />Juda pren kowi ta uowi hanow akung kowi Aigupta pren kowi nauang uowi kown tatuak mih maten kowi dow Aigupta pren kowi ang napiakta kown. Amatni dow tasenra kowi nadowi now khown hown nakowng bowk kown. Amatni dow nachowng maru prawng renra hai rensi küakau kown. Amatni kowi khita now maru mih naawda kown, now amatni ming hown maru natape piati kown. <verse eid="JER 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13" />Jerusalem kowi ang ripah mih iawng Aigupta pren kowi kowh uowi mih Judauüa kowi paw tasenra, khown hai makowng hawi hown ang naripah kown. <verse eid="JER 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14" />Aigupta pren kowi kowuowi mih Judauüa pungmadawng kowi ta sing uowi miuüa dow Juda pren kowi kowplan kown nau chepaw miapaw naia plan kown nadowi. Amatni pungmadawng hownia pre sum iachow klen kowi miapaw kownowng powt kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15" />Nakhowk khe Aigupta pren kowi kowh amatni uowi rah maten hownia masiuüa hawmh maten hai arup aren pur kowi cham towk maikhük mih masiuüa hawm kowh huauüa maten Jeremia tut-e uang khai. <verse eid="JER 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16" />Now amatni dow Jeremia kowi uang tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG ming hown anging tut-e kowh en uang tekah mih laiklow maten anging nasünta kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17" />Anging tekta mih iawng anging nachang ngengche kown. Anging kowh pipu-uüa, manguüa hai mang kowh maru iukuüa Mukuang Mangma vüi towk maikhük mih hai hüngah mih uanap chang mih iawng anging nachang kown. Nami khin khe dow anging kowh chakkham ahuma chowdiah, now akrat pusara paw uowi dowi hai aiungma anging uowi chowdiah. <verse eid="JER 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18" />Nachenganchepaw Mukuang Mangma vüi maikhük towk hai hüngah mih uanap chang anging taingta hownia akhawr hown anging uowi khai, now tasen hai khown hown anging piak rürü khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19" />Masiuüa hawmh plan tek mih, “Mukuang Mangma vüi anging towk maikhük khe, hüngah mih uanap anging chang khe hai aia rup uowi mih kawm anging thawp khe anging kowh huauüa tuk dowi pabow?” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20" />Nakhowk khe aia kowi kowh klangah mih kachakuüa hai masiuüa maten kowi Jeremia tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21" />“Juda pren kowi kowh marow tiama kowi hai Jerusalem marow tiama kowi akeng thurai kowi enni chupiia mih dow CHAKRAMANG sak kowi uowi reng chekhai. Now enni pipu-uüa, enni kowh manguüa, mang kowh maru iukuüa hai pren kowi kowh akeng maru-uüa nam iungma mih maikhük towk mih paw sak kowi CHAKRAMANG towah reng chekhai. <verse eid="JER 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22" />Enni kowh lup ngak hai suiiai kaniaima mih lup CHAKRAMANG nowng kham dowi bowt rakowi enni kowh pren mih akhaw aklaima, apiaknama hai suiiai kaniaima phaw khai. Now nami pren kowi kowh maru-uüa ming dow cham tapela piati kownkow maru tawngah khai. Kawmat mowr pat naiawng uowi reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="JER 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23" />Enni dow nam iungma mih maikhük towk khai, now CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak enni chang khai. Aia kowh laiklow, aia kowh ari aiang, aia kowh rirow hai aia kowh ana pek dow enni chün dowi. Enni luk kowi phih uang ting mih dow naiawng rakowi chekhai. Nami dow enni khi khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24" />Nami kung kowi masiuüa hai kachakuüa maten kowi Jeremia tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren kowi kowh uowi mih enni Judauüa maten CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta büa diah. <verse eid="JER 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Enni hai enni kowh masi hawmuüa tek mih, “Anging takhamta mih anging piakta kown nadowi. Mukuang Mangma vüi nam iungma mih maikhük natowk kownkow hai hüngah mih uanap nachang kownkow anging takham mih iawng anging nachang ngengche kown,” pakhai. Nami laikham powm iawng enni tüngah khai. Naiawng rakowi enni takham mih iawng chang büa diah. Enni takhamta mih laiklow sak kowi towah büa diah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26" />“Nachenganchepaw Aigupta pren kowi kowh enni Judauüa uowi mih maten CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow sünta büa diah. CHAKRAMANG tek mih, ‘Ang kowh ming kri kraingma mih hown mami ang takham khowk: Aigupta pren kowi kowh uowi mih Judauüa kowi dow, “Masing CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang takham khowk,” pami ang nape tekah kown nadowk. <verse eid="JER 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27" />Amatni luk kowi ang pela ching mih dow amatni iung müa nadowi, amatni nga müa chowtaih. Aigupta pren kowi kowh uowi mih Judauüa dow tasen hai khown hown asaima napiak kown. <verse eid="JER 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28" />Tasenra hownia plai kowh Aigupta pren hownia Juda pren kowi nauang plan kown mih maru dow maru iun a-echow naown kown. Nami kung kowi dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh uang uowi miuüa maten ang kowh laiklow chünchü na mih amatni kowh laiklow chünchü na mih natuk büah kown.<verse eid="JER 44:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29" />“‘Mami pren kowi ang narip enni kown, now ang napiakta enni kownkow ang tekta iawng ang nachang kown. Nami amatra dow maiawng: <verse eid="JER 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30" />Aigupta pren mang Faraw Hofra kowi aia kowi lim pe sak reng mih aia kowh ransu rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Aia kowi dow Juda pren mang Zedekia kowi aia kowh ransu Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar rut kowi ang ap-ah iawng ang naap-ah kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 44:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45" />
  <para style="s">Baruk vüi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1" />Juda pren kowi Josia kowh chapa Jehoiakim chowm mang mih tali ning khe risi Jeremia hownia kowh laiklow Neria kowh chapa Baruk tut-e uang ting khai. <verse eid="JER 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2" />Baruk kowi risi Jeremia tek pe mih, “Aw Baruk, en lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG Israel kowh Thurai tek mih maiawng: <verse eid="JER 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3" />En tek mih, ‘Uh! Ang kowh arau hown CHAKRAMANG mih pe ang akrat ngamlam khai. Ang dow nguk runrun se ang uowi mih ang bowm mih nowm khowk, ang ka tanai dowi bowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4" />“Nachenganchepaw mami laiklow natek en kownkow CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘Ang thawpah mih mami chenchap kowi ang napiakta kown. Ang chowkta mih maten ang nachawita kown. <verse eid="JER 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5" />Naiawng now tawng iawng chow en matia vüi kri kraingma mih lawnguan kowi en tuk owmsak khai? Naiawng hangkow owmsak diah. Sak kowi towah diah; maru maten luk kowi ang nauang pawla phih kown. Nachenganchepaw en kowi dow lowra kowi en cham kowi chepaw ang natow en sing reng kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="JER 45:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46" />
  <para style="ms">Chenchapuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1" />Mami dow chenchapuüa lawnguan kowi kowh risi Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG uang tek pe mih laiklow chekhai.<verse eid="JER 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aiguptauüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2" />Juda pren kowi Josia kowh chapa Jehoiakim chowm mang mih tali ning khe Babulawn pren hai Aigupta pren mih tasen khai. Nami khin khe Karchemis marow kowi Nebuknezar mih Aigupta pren mang Faraw-Nekaw kowh siphaiuüa kowi senah now nowngta khai. Nami siphaiuüa lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,<verse eid="JER 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3" />“Enni kowh kawngma aiuk asowm uowi mih maten pawla diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:3">now cham dowk tasen kownkow lawt büa diah.<verse eid="JER 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4" />Enni kowh kawrnga kamrütla hanow nami luk kowi chowm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">krukla lukruk büah hanow atanma kowiowng büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Enni kowh reh mih tawk pluplup pat sükah büah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">now enni kowh tasen tawnguat tawngla büa diah.<verse eid="JER 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5" />“Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng ang tuk khi khai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Amatni dow kram kowh kung prakowi sut khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">amatni kowh siphaiuüa dow sum khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Amatni dow sum kowh kung prakowi ngeula dowi kowi alenma powt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">amatni dow lainowmma kram khai.<verse eid="JER 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6" />Iowm lenma miuüa paw ia powt dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">now akürma miuüa paw nowng powt dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">Amatni dow tawngphak prakowi Iufratis aw re-e tatheu kowh tim büah khai.<verse eid="JER 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7" />“Paimi uang hai mang mih amia chenchap chow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:7">Nail aw tui krawi limta pren bowk mih iawng uang haimang mih mia chow?<verse eid="JER 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8" />Aigupta siphaiuüa uaimang mih dow Nail aw tui iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">Nami dow krawi limta pren bowk mih aw tui iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Amatni dow bawrima hown tek mih, ‘Anging nakrawi mumta lusa bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">now anging nakrawi piakta marow hai maru bowk kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9" />Kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa low, dowk tasen büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">kawrnga kari te miuüa low, thuklama miuüa iawng te kawrnga kari büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Siphaiuüa, kawngma kur mih Ethiawpiauüa hai Libiauüa, now leba dowk mih Lidiauüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">pur prakowi thüa büa diah.<verse eid="JER 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami ni dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh <char style="w">CHAKRAMANG kowh ni</char> chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">nami dow ransu-uüa luk kowi aia napaw lu klai kown mih ni chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Nami ni khe dow saidawng mih du dowi mowr nakrawi sowi banlan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">now vi sakkrai mih rim dowi mowr aia nakrawi sowi banlan kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawngphak pra kowh pren hai Iufratis aw pang kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG nachang phuchua pawi kown.<verse eid="JER 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11" />Aw Aigupta chama, rü hanow Gilead süng kowi kowpün diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">now uang pawla arau iowm müa chakhang diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Nachenganchepaw chakhang chap ahuma en tawng mih dow aiawnglowma taih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">en naiung kown mih sakowmra uowi dowi.<verse eid="JER 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12" />Chenchapuüa mih en rukrai mih lawnguan ta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">en kowh kar klow lusa tek khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">En kowh akürma mih siphaiuüa dow nataiua iowm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">now amatni dow tachawn hanow krawng kowi katsang natim kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13" />Babulawn mang Nebuknezar nauang sen Aigupta pren kown mih satang CHAKRAMANG mih risi Jeremia kowi uang tek pe khai.<verse eid="JER 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14" />Aigupta kowi kowchia pe büa diah, Migdawl kowi kowphuang pe büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">Memfis hai Tapanhes kowi maiawng kowtek pe büah diah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">“Kamrüt büah hanow atanma kowiowng büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">Tawngplawng kowchow panow saidawng hown enni napiak bowk kown chowbowt,” pape diah.<verse eid="JER 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15" />Tawngplawng kowchow enni kowh siphaiuüa tim khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:15">Amatni dow nowng iowng dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:15">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG nawtah mih chekhai.<verse eid="JER 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16" />Amatni dow aplan aplan tatheu khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">amatni dow en luk ang luk kowi tim büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">Amatni dow tatek mih, “Chu, rü hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">chang a-i nowng miuüa kowh saidawng rut hownia a-i cham powt lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">now a-i matia maru-uüa tut-e hai a-i matia pren kowi a-i plan lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17" />Nami kung kowi dow maru-uüa natatek kown mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">“Aigupta pren mang Faraw dow aklow taih tün,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">aia dow khin iung uang ting mih iawmta khai,” napa kown.<verse eid="JER 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18" />Aming mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG pami mang tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">“Ang kowh ming hown ang takham khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">Aigupta kowi nakingküaah kown mih maru nauang lowk ia kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">Aia dow hungh dawng kowi kowh Tabawr hungh iawng akroma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">now sata ria kowi kowh Karmel hungh iawng aiukma chekhai.<verse eid="JER 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19" />Aw Aigupta maru-uüa, maru nakhümla enni hanow alakma kowi nacham pawla enni kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">Naiawng rakowi enni matia kowh uanh mih kamrüt büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">Memfis marow dow apiaknama nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">Nakowi dow miapaw nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20" />Aigupta dow klangiungma mih chia chah iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">Tawkche aia kowi namakah kownkow tawngphak hownia iawrh uang tarü lowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21" />Aigupta kowi kowh ka maina mih siphaiuüa dow akauma mih chia chah iawng chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">amatni paw nataplan hanow alenma napowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni luk kowi dow piak khin uang ting khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">amatni naka ripra kown mih khin uang towm khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22" />Amatni kowh ransu siphaiuüa uang haimang khe Aiguptauüa dow napowt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">amatni dow rua sowr klow iawng asachow asachow napowt kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">Amatni kowi dow singh krip miuüa iawng marek dowkma ransu-uüa nauang senah kown.<verse eid="JER 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23" />Aigupta kowh kaurawng aiiuma chepaw ransu-uüa dow nauang chiata kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh ransu-uüa dow plawng hawmh lak-e lang kawm chekhai.<verse eid="JER 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24" />Aiguptauüa kowi dow napeah rukrai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:24">now amatni kowi dow tawngphak pra kowh maru-uüa rut kowi naap-ah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, “Thebes marow kowi kowh Amawn thurai kowi, Faraw hai Aigupta kowi kowh arup aren maten kowi neplawng nesak miuüa kowi ang naripah kown. <verse eid="JER 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26" />Amatni kowi nasaita kown nau mih Babulawn mang Nebuknezar hai aia kowh siphaiuüa rut kowi ang naap-ah kown. Nachenganchepaw akung kowi dow Aigupta pren kowi alai kowh iawng maru nauowi iawk kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 46:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aia maru-uüa kowi Thurai nalawngah kown mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27" />Thurai tek mih, “Aw ang kowh nar Jakawb, hangkow kram diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">aw Israel, hangkow tanua diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">En cham takhangra pren alakma mih hownia ang nalawng en ngengche kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">now nami hownia en kowh chuprek chaprekuüa kowi ang nalawngah ngengche kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Jakawb dow thaulangma nauowi iawk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">aia kowi dow miapaw natüng pe kramra kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28" />Aw ang kowh nar Jakawb, hangkow kram diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang tawi uowila en reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Ang cham uet en khe akeng chenchapuüa tut-e en cham uowi khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">naiawngün chenchapuüa maten kowi dow asaima ang napiakta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Tawkche en kowi dow asaima ang napiak en kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">En kowi dow tara nowm hown ang nahawi en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">mapaw rip en dowi matchang ang nalawt en kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 46:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47" />
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1" />Faraw kowsen Gaza marow dowi rawn khe Filistinuüa lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tekah mih laiklow risi Jeremia tut-e uang towm khai.<verse eid="JER 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">“Tawngphak prakowi tawng iawng chow tui pün mih sam mü madiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">nami tui dow ue plawtlawt taih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Nami tui dow nami pren hai alak kowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi nalimla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">nami dow marow hai nakowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi nalimla kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Nahanow nakowi kowh maru-uüa dow napla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">nami prenchakuüa maten dow nanguk nakar kown.<verse eid="JER 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3" />Filistinuüa dow kawrnga iowm tün, ransu-uüa kowh kawrnga kari tün nata kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">now kawrnga kari khawk taui mih tün ün nata büah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">Amatni kowh pauüa dow amatni kowh chauüa kowi nalawngah kownkow naplan kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">amatni kowh rut dow auaklakma natahing hüah kown.<verse eid="JER 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4" />Filistinuüa maten kowi napiakta kown mih ni uang ting khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">Tura hai Sidawn kowi khowng miuüa maten kowi nakowngta kown mih ni paw uang ting khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">Ang CHAKRAMANG mih Krete süngdum hownia kowh uang mih Filistinuüa kowi napiakta kown.<verse eid="JER 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5" />Gaza dow uowila uiting uangtak mih natüngla kownkow nakhaita sam kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">Askelawn marow dow ririmma natakuak hüah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Laina kowi kowh uowi miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">mün ni tak chow enni nanguk nakar kown?<verse eid="JER 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6" />Karla se, ‘Aw CHAKRAMANG kowh saidawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">mün ni kung kowi chow en natanai kown?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">En kowh akawp kowi taphang bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">now uowi phülü bowt,’ pahai tek büa diah.<verse eid="JER 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7" />Tawkche aia kowi dow ang peah ana mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">Naiawng rakowi aia dow ka tanai dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:7">Askelawn hai sata pang kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi nasenah kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">aia kowi peah ana mih dow ang chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 47:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48" />
  <para style="s">Moab kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1" />Moab lawnguan kowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 48:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">“Nebo marow kowh piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">Kiriathaim marow dow narukrai hanow akeng chenchap rut kowi nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">Aia kowh kangchawngra kimkrowng dow naka rukrai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">aia kowh kangchawngra kimkrowng dow adima napiak nak kown.<verse eid="JER 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2" />Moab kowi dow nakiowah kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">aia kowi dow napiakta kownkow Hesbawn marow kowi maru sangkrang thüm khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Amatni dow tatek mih, ‘Chu, paimi chenchap kowi a-i piakta lah,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Madmen marow ow, en kowi paw napiakta en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">en kowi dow kung hownia saidawng nakrawi en kown.<verse eid="JER 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3" />“Horonaim marow hownia kowh kar klow sünta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:3">nami kar klow dow piakra uang ting kowh kar mih klow chekhai.<verse eid="JER 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4" />Moab kowi dow napiakta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:4">now aia kowh chauüa dow nakarla sawm kown.<verse eid="JER 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5" />Luhit marow prakowi awr pün büa khe amatni dow nakarla hulu kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">now Horonaim marow prakowi iu sun büah khe amatni dow takrow takrai lai rakowi nakarla hu kown.<verse eid="JER 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6" />Cham powt büa diah! Kowmatia sak naplai kownkow iowm büa diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:6">Süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh pram mung iawng cham uowi büa diah.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh pram mung iawng cham uowi büa diah. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami auan Hebrai lai hown kowh chim dowi chekhai.</char></note><verse eid="JER 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7" />“Moab, en dow en kowh lup hai en kowh dawngthawnguan luk kowi neplawng nesak khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">Naiawng rakowi en kowi paw nakhümla en hanow napawla en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">En kowh thurai Kemaws kowi kowh uamow kowi napawla pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">now en kowh maru iukuüa kowi paw napawla en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">Amatni kowi dow alakma mih pren kowi maru nacham pawla kown.<verse eid="JER 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8" />Marow maten kowi apiak mih nauang ting kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">tawng mih marow paw nakhalat kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">Ang kowh laiklow iawng lawngrawi hai laina süng mih napiak kown.<verse eid="JER 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9" />Moab kowi peah lap diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">aia mih iow hanow pacham nowng powt lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">Aia kowh marow dow akhaw aklaima nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">nakowi dow miapaw nauowi kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Towsakma hown ang kowh lup chang dowi miuüa kowi dow ang napeah piati kown. Aia kowh saidawng kowi pe saiah maru dowi mih maru kowi dow ang napeah piati kown.<verse eid="JER 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11" />“Lowk mih kawng hownia alowk mih kawng kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">katpaw klingklaiah dowi mih arak dow asowr hai anam piak dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">Nami powm iawng Moab dow asowmchow hownia thaulangma uowi phülü khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">aia kowi dow katpaw maru khümla now cham pawla dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="JER 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12" />“Nachenganchepaw tuikawng hownia kowh khükah miuüa kowi ang nauang chin pe kown mih khin dow uang ting khowk. Nakhowk khe dow amatni mih aia kowi nakhükah hanow akhawma natowah kown, now aia kowh tuikawng dow nadita pe nak kown. <verse eid="JER 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13" />Bethel kowi kowh amatni owmah mih thurai rakowi Israeluüa rukrai khai; nami iawng Moabuüa paw Kemaws thurai kowi owmah rakowi narukrai kown.<verse eid="JER 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14" />“‘Anging dow tasen mih siphai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:14">sakkraingma hown tasen mih maru,’ pami tawng enni Moabuüa tuk tek khai?<verse eid="JER 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15" />Moab hai aia kowh marow ün dow ransu-uüa napiakta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:15">aia kowh tasen kiakma mih klanguüa hawmh khowm padow tasenra kowi nakowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:15">Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16" />Moab kowh piak khin dow uang ting khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:16">aia kowh phih dow alenma uang tarü thüm khowk.<verse eid="JER 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17" />Aia riaret kowi kowh enni uowi miuüa maten aia vüi nguk büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">aia kowh ming iung nang iung tawi tuk miuüa maten aia vüi kar büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">Aia kowi enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Aia kowh kruitownra kür piak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">aia kowh rowsira uowima mih nowng changra dow piak khai bowt,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Dibawn marowchakuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">enni kowh rowsira uowima mih arah hownia uang iu dowm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">now akang khawngma mih bawn kowi uang chowm büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Moab kowi piakah miuüa uangah hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">en kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim nakrawi piakta en kown.<verse eid="JER 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19" />Aw Aroer marowchakuüa, tiama ria kowi iowng büah hanow hawt tang mü büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:19">now cham powt miuüa kowi, ‘Tawng chow own?’ Padow lüntaah büa diah.<verse eid="JER 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20" />Moab dow ka rukrai khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow tapiak nak khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Naiawng rakowi nguk büah kar büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">‘Moab piak khai bowt,’ padow Arnawn aw pang kowi kowkrawi phuang büa diah.<verse eid="JER 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21" />“Laina süng kowi kowh uowi mih maten luk kowi tara chet khin uang ting khai bowt. Holon, Jahaz, Mefat, <verse eid="JER 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22" />Dibawn, Nebo, Bet-Diblathaim, <verse eid="JER 48:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23" />Kiriathaim, Begamul, Betmeawn, <verse eid="JER 48:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24" />Keriawt hai Bawzra marow luk kowi tara chet khin uang ting khai bowt. Moab pren kowi kowh atawnchow mih hai alakma mih marow maten luk kowi tara chet khin uang ting khai bowt. <verse eid="JER 48:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25" />Moab kowh kürra nang dow dungta pe khai bowt, now aia kowh rut dow klowkta pe khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26" />“Moab kowi dow apuama changah diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow tanü iuk mih hown kingküa ang khai. Aia dow aia kowh hük kowi nataiüa lutlut kown. Aia dow nachowng rensi kau kown. <verse eid="JER 48:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27" />Aw Moab, Israel dow en kowh rensi kau chowdiah nadowi bow? Aia kowi dow kuk miuüa pungmadawng kowi ka khümla khai bow? Tawngplawng kowchow aia kowi en khi towng en suiah kowh en tuk lek lu khai?<verse eid="JER 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28" />“Moab marowchakuüa low, towla marow büah hanow hungh kowi cham uowi büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:28">hungh kowi kowh powng luk kowi chang bai mih uatur iawng chowng büa diah.<verse eid="JER 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29" />Moab bawri mih lawnguan dow anging ta khowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow lainowmma chang bawri khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">Arawn amatma mih aia kowh owrowra lawnguan anging tuk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">now aia tanü mih hai kunma ngak lawnguan paw anging tuk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30" />Aia kowh owrowma mih bawri laiklow ang tuk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:30">nachenganchepaw nami dow aiawnglowma taih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:30">now aia tanü mih dow tawngpaw asung uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 48:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31" />Naiawng rakowi Moab vüi ang nanguk nakar kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:31">Moab pren kowi kowh Kir-Hareset marow kowi uowi miuüa vüi ang nakar kown.<verse eid="JER 48:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32" />Sibma marowchakuüa low, enni vüi ang nakar kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">Jazer marowchakuüa vüi ang kar mih lak-e ang nalang kar kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Pakat khe enni dow sata klen prang cham tarawk mih grep ruih iawng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">now Jazer marow mowr arui prek cham tarawk mih grep ruih iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Nachenganchepaw satma khin khe kowh uih krawi piak mih uang ting khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">grep ruih luk kowi krawi piak miuüa uang ting khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 48:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33" />Uih-ak bakan iawng mih piawpara hai awmrawmra dow tama khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">nami piawpara hai awmrawmra dow Moab pren hownia powt khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Grep uih küara hownia kowh grep tui lawtra dow ang pitta khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">nakowi dow apiaw apama hown hekla plala se miapaw küa grep uih dowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Nakowi hek klow plak klow uowi chepaw nami dow piaw kowh hek mih pla mih nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34" />“Amatni kowh kar klow dow Hesbawn hownia Eleale hai Jahaz mowr, Zoar hownia Horonaim hai Eglat-Selisia mowr ta khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Nimrim kowi kowh aw tui paw kang khai bowt. <verse eid="JER 48:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35" />Moab kowi alowngma mih arah kowi kowh phuchuara kowi chang phuchua miuüa hai amatni kowh arup arenuüa vüi towk maikhük miuüa kowi ang napiakta kown. <verse eid="JER 48:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36" />Naiawng rakowi Moab kowi kowh maru-uüa hai Kir-Heres kowi kowh maru-uüa vüi prui tün iawng ang kar ang nguk khai. Amatni krümah mih dawngthawnguan dow khowk bowk khowk. <verse eid="JER 48:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37" />Amatni dow uowila uiting uangtak mih natüngla kownkow khaita sam hai khaita mawmpawi büah bowk khai, now rut kowi tangen tata büah hanow khup sala uan büah bowk khai. <verse eid="JER 48:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38" />Moab kowi kowh kimluk maten kowi hai marow talang kowi dow nguk klow kar klow klen kowi tawngpaw ta dowi bowt chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow miapaw nauah dowi mih puh kowi iawng Moab kowi ang dita nak khai. <verse eid="JER 48:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39" />Aia dow tadi nak khowk! Aia vüi dow lainowmma maru kar khai. Moab dow rukrai kowh dangta kung hüah khai bowt. Aia dow aia riaret kowi kowh maru-uüa maten tut-e chowng rensi küakau khai bowt, now aia piak mih krang khita now maru takrow khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 48:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Sünta, ransu-uüa dow uamu iangla lap hanow alowngma hownia uang tahür mih iawng nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:40">amatni dow Moabuüa kowi nauang senah kownkow nauang kown.<verse eid="JER 48:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41" />Moab kowi kowh marow dow ransu napowngta kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">now kangchawngra kimkrowng dow ransu-uüa nakhünta kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:41">Nahanow amatni kowh tasen kiakma miuüa dow nakram kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">amatni dow penchow kimuowi mu rau phaw mih masiuüa kowh sak iawng naphaw kown.<verse eid="JER 48:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42" />Moab dow tanü iuk mih hown kingküa ang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:42">naiawng rakowi aia dow chenchap iawng nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JER 48:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43" />Moab kowi kowh maru-uüa low, takrow takraira mih hawt pawm enni khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:43">kuam hai leng chak ia mih hawt pawm enni hüah towbowt.<verse eid="JER 48:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44" />Kram kowh powt mih maru dow kuam kowi nadowh kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">kuam hownia uang lawt mih maru dow leng kowi natasowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Moab kowi naripah kown mih khin dow ang kamrütta khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 48:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45" />“Hesbawn marow kowi kowtatung tanim kownkow kowpowt miuüa dow iowngla rim khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">amatni dow akhowng mih uowi dowi miuüa iawng iowngla rim khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Hesbawn hai Sihun hownia kowh maih uang ting khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">nami maih dow Moab pren paprenma kamta pe khai.<verse eid="JER 48:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46" />Aw Moab, en luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih dow kramra uowi lai kowbow!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">Kemaws marowchakuüa dow piak khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:46">En kowh chapa hai chamauüa kowi dow khümla hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">alakma mih pren kowi cham pawla khai.<verse eid="JER 48:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47" />Nachenganchepaw pur prakowi dow Moab kowi aiungma ang natowah iawk kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:47">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:47">Moab kowh tara chet lawnguan dow mami mowr now chur khai.<verse eid="JER 48:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49" />
  <para style="s">Amawnuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1" />Amawnuüa lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">“Israel kowh chapa uowi dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">Aia kowng kung kowi aia kowh dawngthawnguan powng mih miapaw uowi dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">Tawngplawng kowchow Gad krungchak kowh süng Milkawm thurai chupiia miuüa tuk powngta pe khai?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">Tawngplawng kowchow nakowi kowh marow kowi krawi tuk uowi büah khai?<verse eid="JER 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2" />Sünta, Amawnuüa kowh Rabba marow kowi ang nasenah kown mih khin uang ting khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">Nakhowk khe dow nami marow mih apiaknama nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">Aia riaret kowi kowh kua ün ang natowkta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Akung kowi Israeluüa kowi prütah miuüa kowi dow Israeluüa naprütah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3" />“Aw Hesbawn, kar hai nguk diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Ai marow mih tapiak khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Rabba marowchakuüa low, kar büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">khup sala uan hanow uowila uiting uangtak büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Ka achang uan dowi bowt rakowi mami tap hownia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">paimi tap mowr chi krawi iowm büah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh thurai Milkawm kowi dow alakma mih pren kowi nacham pawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">now aia kowh uamowuüa hai maru iukuüa kowi paw napawla kown.<verse eid="JER 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4" />En dow en kowh asi uowima mih lawngrawi rakowi en chang bawri khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">Tawkche nami dow nalüa piak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:4">Aw kaah sakowm dowi mih chama, en kowh dawngthawnguan luk kowi en owmsak se en tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">‘Mia chow uang nowng sen ang kown?’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5" />Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">en tavir lut uowi miuüa maten hownia lainowmma ang nauang pawla en kramra kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">Enni bowkbowk kowi ang naprütta enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">powt miuüa kowi nakrawi kuaah kown mih maru miapaw nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6" />Nachenganchepaw akung kowi dow Amawnuüa mih naiung iawk kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:6">amatni kowi dow aiungma ang natowah iawk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edawmuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7" />Edawmuüa lawnguan kowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">“Teman kowh chanlaira uowi dowi bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Prengia chakma miuüa kowh prengia iung laiklow chur khai bowt bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Amatni kowh chanlaira khowk khai bowt bow?<verse eid="JER 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8" />Esau chuprek chaprekuüa low, kung prakowi plan powt büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">now cham tapet büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Esau krungchak kowi ang naripah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">nami khin khe aia luk kowi paw ang nauang pawla pe phih kown.<verse eid="JER 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9" />Grep uih klek miuüa en tut-e uang e dow amatni mih ta towla grep uih ne dowi tham bow?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:9">Uar-e khe kuk miuüa uang ku e dow amatni nau mowr taih nadowi bow nakula kown?<verse eid="JER 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10" />Nachenganchepaw Esau krungchak kowh süng dow akhaw aklaima ang natowla pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">Amatni naia tapetla dowi kownkow amatni kowh pren dow aplitsurma ang nachang pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">Aia kowh krungchakuüa, tasin taken miuüa hai kimping namkhetuüa dow napiak kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">amiapaw nata lat kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11" />Enni mih saratchow chauüa kowi ta towla büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:11">amatni kowi dow ang natakhula kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:11">Enni kowh mamaimowuüa paw ang luk kowi pacham neplawng nesak lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ka ripra kown tataing dowi mih khowm ka ripra hanow tawngplawng kowchow ka ripra dowi matchang en nauowi kown chow? En dow nami ripra bia nakham ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="JER 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13" />Ang matia ming hown ang takham khowk, Bawzra marow dow napiak hanow suiiai kaniaima naphaw kown. Aia piak mih khi hanow maru naawda kown, now aia kowh ming hown maru nacham tape piati kown. Aia kowh kua hai marow maten dow chowngchowng saksakma apiaknama nauowi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14" />Chintak mih lowk ia kowi chenchapuüa tut-e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">uang chinah mih satang CHAKRAMANG hownia ang ta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">Aia tek mih, “Nakowsen Edawm kownkow takua talawm büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">nadowk tasen kownkow awr rü diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Kawmat dow chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi asowmchow ang nachang en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:15">now maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi suiiai kaniaima ang nachang en kown.<verse eid="JER 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16" />Aw hua cheng kowi kowh uowi mih maru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">en dow alowng alowngma mih hungh kowi kowh arah powng mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Maru kram en rakowi en bawri khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">tawkche nami bawrira mih kuan en khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Uamu iawng dow alowngma mih rah kowi en chang kim chepaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">nami hownia ang nauang klala en kown.<verse eid="JER 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17" />“Edawm kowh piak krang dow khi hanow maru naawda kown. Aia riaret iawng mang miuüa dow lainowmma nakram kown, now aia kowi dow maru nakhareah kown. <verse eid="JER 49:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18" />Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, aria aret kowi kowh kua hailawm Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow kowi piakah mih iawng Edawm kowi paw ang napiakah kown. Nahanow Edawm kowi dow miapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JER 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19" />“Jawrdan aw ria kowi kowh kaurawng hownia krangsi uang lawt hanow pram dawng kowi krawi mak chak khe kowh iawng Edawmuüa kowi amatni kowh pren hownia amaisang ang nakrawiah kown. Now amatni kowh pren luk kowi dow ang ruiah mih maru kowi ang natowah kown. Mia chow ang hown tale? Mia chow nowng kingküa ang? Mia iawng mih kruitown mih paw nowng kingküa ang dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20" />Naiawng rakowi sünta diah, Edawmuüa kowi tawng chow nachangah kown mih CHAKRAMANG sangkrangta khowk, now Teman marowchakuüa kowi paw tawng chow nachangah kown mih aia kamrütta khowk. Amatni kowh chauüa kowi dow kür hown ransu-uüa nacham küngla kown, now amatni kowh lup ngak rakowi amatni kowh pren dow asaima aia napiakta pe kown. <verse eid="JER 49:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21" />Amatni piak mih klow hown dow lusa mih nachür kown. Amatni kowh kar klow dow Sata Rik mowr nata kown. <verse eid="JER 49:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22" />Sünta, ransu-uüa mih uamu iawng iangla lap hanow alowngma hownia uang tahür mih iawng Bawzra marow kowi nauang senah kown. Nami ni khe dow penchow kimuowi mu rau phaw mih masiuüa kowh sak iawng Edawm kowi kowh tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa kowh sak naphaw kown.<verse eid="JER 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Damaska marow kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23" />Damaska marow lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">“Hamat hai Arpad marow dow kram lai bowt kowh rüp prang towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ta satang ngak khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">Amatni dow tuak chur khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">amatni kowh sak dow liku uang khe kowh sata tui iawng tahowng prungrung towbowt.<verse eid="JER 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24" />Damaska dow auaklakma towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">aia dow kram lai bowt rakowi napowt kownkow taplan khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">Aia kowi dow penchow kimuowi mu rau phaw mih masiuüa iawng arau dowkah khai.<verse eid="JER 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25" />Nami dow aming anang iukma mih marow chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:25">nami dow ang kowh awmrawmra marow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:25">Tawkche nami marow mih kawmat dow akhaw aklaima towbowt.<verse eid="JER 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26" />Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG ang tek khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:26">aia kowh klanguüa hawmh uak dow akuangma mih tiama kowi natakuakla pan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:26">nami ni khe dow aia kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi ang nachumta pe bowk kown.<verse eid="JER 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27" />Damaska marow tap dow ang natowkta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:27">nami maih dow Ben-Hadaduüa kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim nakamta kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kedar hai Hazawr marow kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28" />Mang Nebuknezar tut-e sum tasen mih Kedar hai Hazawr marow mang lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:28" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:28">“Rü diah, Kedar kowi kowsen diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:28">now satlawt pra kowh maru-uüa kowi piakah diah.<verse eid="JER 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29" />Amatni kowh tangbung hai tawncher maten maru napawla pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">now amatni kowh uanh, tangbung uaniang hai ut ün napawla pe bowk kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">Amatni dow hek se natek pe kown mih, ‘Kramra tavir lut khowk,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 49:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Hazawr marowchakuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">alenma powt büa diah, now cham tapet büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">Tawngplawng kowchow panow Nebuknezar mih nakingküa enni kownkow sangkrang khowk.<verse eid="JER 49:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31" />Babulawnuüa low, rü büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">now thaulangma hai asowrma uowi mih chenchap kowi kowsenah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">Nami chenchap kowh dow tap paw uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">now tapplawt klia paw uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">Amatni dow amatni malowkchow taih uowi.<verse eid="JER 49:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32" />Amatni kowh ut hawmh hai tawncher hawmh maten dow pawla pe büah bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">amatni dow ngeupa pra krowngchowchi kep sam mih chenchap<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngeupa pra krowngchowchi kep sam mih chenchap </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lawnguan tuk kown nau now Jeremia 9:25-26 kowi kowh footnote mü diah.</char></note> chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">Amatni kowi dow ang nasetta plawt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">now amatni luk kowi dow ang nauang pawla pe phih kown.<verse eid="JER 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33" />Hazawr marow dow brenkhui hawmh uowi rah nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:33">now chowngchowng saksakma akhaw aklaima nauowi kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">Nakowi dow miapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 49:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elam marow kowi CHAKRAMANG naripah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34" />Juda pren kowi Zedekia chowm mang mih auown prakowi Elam marow lawnguan kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh laiklow risi Jeremia tut-e uang ting khai. CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="JER 49:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35" />“Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk, Elam marow kowh kürra tut leba dow ang napiakta pe kown. <verse eid="JER 49:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36" />Mukuang tali tingnui hownia Elam kowi nakingküaah kownkow ang nauang pawla pe li kown. Nami li hown amatni kowi dow pren tali nui kowi ang nasetta plawt kown. Amatni dow chenchap maten tut-e nacham takhang kown. <verse eid="JER 49:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37" />Amatni kowi nasaiah kown nau miuüa pur kowi amatni kowi dow ang dita nak kown. Ang kowh kunmarau lün pluplup mih hown amatni luk kowi ang nauang pawla pe phih kown. Amatni kowi chumta dowi mowr nakingküaah kownkow ang nauang chin pe saidawng kown. <verse eid="JER 49:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38" />Elam kowi ang kowh mang chowm rah ang natowah kown, now aia kowh mang hai mang kowh maru iukuüa kowi dow ang napiakta pe kown. <verse eid="JER 49:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39" />Nachenganchepaw pur prakowi dow Elam kowi mih aiungma ang natowah iawk kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 49:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50" />
  <para style="s">Babulawn vüi kowi kowh laiklow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1" />Mami dow Babulawn prenchakuüa lawnguan kowi kowh risi Jeremia kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih laiklow chekhai. CHAKRAMANG tek mih,<verse eid="JER 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2" />“Enni mih chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi krawi chia krawi phuang diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">tawngpaw hangkow itah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Ruang tamkhuown büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">now krawi phowng satang büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Babulawn pren dow maru napowngta kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">Bel thurai dow naka rukrai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">now Marduk thurai dow natadi nak kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Babulawn kowi kowh arup aren dow naka rukrai kown.<verse eid="JER 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3" />“Babulawn kowi dow tawngphak hownia kowh chenchap nauang senah kown. Aia kowh pren dow apiaknama natowta pe hüah kown. Nakowi dow miapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt; maru hai tawncher maten nacham powt bowk kown.<verse eid="JER 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4" />“Nami khin khe Israel hai Juda maru-uüa mih mik tui vüng prang CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi tuk kown mih nanau kown. <verse eid="JER 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5" />Amatni dow Zaiawn tiama lawnguan kowi nakrawi lünta kown, now nami prakowi nakowkowi büah kown. Amatni dow katpaw tamata dowi bowt pat CHAKRAMANG hown chowngchowng saksakma mih sangbowk laitawm natatow büah kown.<verse eid="JER 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6" />“Ang maru-uüa dow tama mih ruapur hawmh iawng chekhai. Amatni kowi dow tiama tawi kowi amatni kowh kruitown miuüa cham pawla khai. Naiawngün kruitown miuüa rakowi amatni dow hungma mawngma kowi krawi lenla pang khai. Amatni dow tawng iawng chow ruapur tung kowi nauang plan kown mih tuk dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JER 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7" />Amatni kowi dow krumah miuüa srui senah khai. Amatni kowh ransu-uüa tek mih, ‘Israeluüa kowi a-i senah mih tawi dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow amatni kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküa mih chekhai. Nami klen kowi amatni kowh tawkra ching hai amatni pipu-uüa kowh sakowmra CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak chang büah khai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8" />“Aw Israeluüa, Babulawn hownia powt büa diah. Babulawnuüa kowh pren towla hanow rua hawmh pur kowi ruala rik mang mih iawng taowt powt büah diah. <verse eid="JER 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9" />Tawngphak pra kowh pren hownia chenchap aiuk aiukma mih kowi ang nakuaah hanow Babulawn pren kowi ang nauang pe senah kown. Amatni dow Babulawnuüa kowi nasenah hanow napowngta pren kown. Amatni ransu-uüa kowh leba sek dow tasen kiakma miuüa kowh iawng mapaw naiawm kown nadowi. <verse eid="JER 50:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10" />Babulawn kowi kowh uanh maten dow ransu-uüa napawla pe kown; amatni kowh uanh pawla mih ransu-uüa maten dow nasak-ih kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11" />“Aw Babulawnuüa, ang maru-uüa kowh uanh maten</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">enni pawla rakowi enni piaw hai awmrawm khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">Enni dow chia chah powrchow mih iawng plaila dowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">now nau haupawk thüm mih kawrnga iawng hek khai.<verse eid="JER 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12" />Tawkche enni kowh pren mih naka rukrai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">enni kowh pren dow akhaw aklaima naphaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">Babulawn dow chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi nalang sowm kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">aia dow süngrüp süngkangma iawng rüprapma naphaw kown.<verse eid="JER 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13" />CHAKRAMANG kunmarau rakowi Babulawn dow asaima natapiak kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">aia tut-e dow miapaw nauowi kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">Aia iawng kowmang miuüa maten dow naawda kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">now aia kowh piak krang khi hanow maru naprawng renah kown.<verse eid="JER 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14" />Leba dowkma miuüa low, Babulawn kowi nasenah kownkow tapat lut kowiowng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:14">now leba sek lowkchow khowm lat dowi pat kowapah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kingküala mih angak chang khai.<verse eid="JER 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15" />Aia kowi dow tavir lut kowsenah büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">aia dow khamsum khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Aia kowh akhawtma mih kimkrowng dow piak khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">now aia kowh tap dow takhue khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Aia luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG sat pe aklai mih chowbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">enni paw sat pe aklai diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">akeng chenchapuüa kowi aia krawi chang iawng aia kowi changah büa diah.<verse eid="JER 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16" />Babulawn kowi kowh liu sawt miuüa maten kowi pawla bowk diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">nakowi kowh luprak kua miuüa maten kowi cham chinta bowk diah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi kowh maru-uüa dow ransu-uüa kowh saidawng kowi kram kowh napowt bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">amatni dow amatni chowlowkkow pren kowi naplan bowk kown.<verse eid="JER 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai maru-uüa vüi sakowmra</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17" />“Israeluüa dow krangsi krawiah kowh cham taset plawt mih ruapur hawmh iawng chekhai. Amatni kowi dow auown khe Asuria mang uang senah khai. Achur khe dow Babulawn mang Nebuknezar mih amatni kowh hut dita pe nak khai. <verse eid="JER 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18" />Naiawng rakowi ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai mih Asuria mang kowi ang ripah khai. Nami iawng Babulawn mang hai aia kowh pren kowi paw ang naripah kown. <verse eid="JER 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowi dow amatni kowh tawkra kowi ang nauang plan pawla kown, now amatni dow Karmel hai Basan süng kowi nakrawi taw kown. Amatni dow Efraim hai Gileaduüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi aduma nauowi kown. <verse eid="JER 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20" />Nami khin khe dow Israeluüa kowh angak mih nacham pe kown. Tawkchedow angak lowkchow paw naka kown nadowi. Juda kowi paw nacham pe angak kown. Tawkche lowkchow paw naka pe angak kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang natowah sing kown miuüa kowi dow ang nalawtta pe angak kown chekhai.<verse eid="JER 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babulawn kowi Thurai chet pe tara mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21" />“Aw Babulawn ransu-uüa, ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">Merathaim kowi hai Pekawd kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi kowsenah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">Amatni kowi dow kowkrawiah hanow saita büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">amatni kowi asaima piakta büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">now ang pe enni mih ana maten iawng chang büa diah.<verse eid="JER 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22" />Babulawn pren kowi dow tasen klow ta khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:22">now piakra akraingma mih klow paw taah khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23" />Babulawn dow palusama kowh matul chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:23">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow aia mih taklowk naknak khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:23">Aia piak krang khita hanow chenchapuüa maten awda khai.<verse eid="JER 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24" />Aw Babulawn, en vüi ang chakta leng hüah khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">nami leng kowi en tasowk khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">Tawkche en tuk dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">En kowi khümta en khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow kingküa ang khai.<verse eid="JER 50:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25" />Babulawn pren kowi dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG kowh lup uowi chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">naiawng rakowi ang kowh rutchün khawkleng towk rah kim ang uowah hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">ang uang lawtla rutchün khawkleng khai.<verse eid="JER 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26" />Aw Babulawn ransu-uüa, Babulawn kowi uang senah kownkow alakma hownia uang büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">aia kowh chakkham nungra kim uowta pe büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">now nakowi kowh uanh maten napawla pe kownkow hurta hüah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">Aia kowi dow asaima piakta büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">tawngpaw hangkow towla büah diah.<verse eid="JER 50:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27" />Chiala iawng akürma mih aia kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi saita pe diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:27">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi naripah kown mih khin uang ting khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 50:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28" />Sünta, Babulawn hownia kowh ia powt miuüa dow Jerusalem kowi uangah now a-i kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai chup kim piakta mih klai tawng iawng chow Thurai sat pe mih lawnguan uang tek khai.<verse eid="JER 50:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Babulawn kowi nauang senah kownkow leba dowk miuüa maten kowi hawah diah. Aia tavir lut siphaiuüa kowi pe khupah tangbung büa diah; mia kowi paw hangkow pe powtah diah. Aia kowh lup sung mih aia kowi pe kaah diah; aia krawi chang iawng aia kowi changah diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh chimsaima mih Thurai kowi kingküa mih hownia tanü iuk khai. <verse eid="JER 50:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30" />Naiawng rakowi aia kowh klanguüa hawm dow marow kowi kowh tiama kowi ün kowng kowh natakuakla pan kown. Nami ni khe dow aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi nachumta pe bowk kown.<verse eid="JER 50:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31" />“Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:31">aw bawrima mih maru-uüa, sünta, ang kingküa enni khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni naka ripra kown mih khin uang ting khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 50:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32" />Aw bawrima mih chenchap, enni dow natatui hanow natim kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">tawkche miapaw nakrüng enni kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:32">Enni kowh marow ün dow ang natowkta enni kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">now naiawngün marow dow aria aret kowi kowh uowi mih hailawm nakam bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 50:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Israel hai Juda kowi kowh maru-uüa dow nowng chang powng changra kowi uowi khai. Amatni kowi dow khümah miuüa akhawtma dowkah hanow amatni kowi pe powtah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="JER 50:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowh lawng miia dow akürma chekhai. Aia ming dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Amatni kowi dow Israel pren kowi thaulangma nape uowiah kownkow aia natawi takhula kown. Tawkche Babulawn prenchakuüa kowi dow akrat pusama hown aia natowah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 50:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Babulawnuüa hai aia prenchakuüa kowi dow saidawng hown nasaiah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:35">now maru iukuüa hai chanlaima miuüa kowi paw saidawng hown nasaiah kown.<verse eid="JER 50:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36" />Amatni kowh risi iuauüa kowi nakingküaah kown mih saidawng nauang ting kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:36">nakhowk khe amatni dow abualama pami nakhi-ah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Amatni kowh tasen kiakma miuüa kowi dow saidawng hown nasenah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:36">now amatni dow lainowmma nakram kown.<verse eid="JER 50:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37" />Babulawn kowh kawrnga, kawrnga kari hai prenlang siphaiuüa kowi dow saidawng hown nasenah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">now amatni dow masiuüa iawng auaklakma naphaw kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Aia kowh dawngthawnguan maten dow ransu-uüa napawla pe kown.<verse eid="JER 50:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38" />Sat kang rakowi nakowi kowh tui maten dow nakang kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:38">Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami pren dow arup aren kowh pren chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">Nakowi kowh kramra uowima mih arup arenuüa mih nakowi kowh maru-uüa kowi bualama nachangah kown.<verse eid="JER 50:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39" />“Naiawng rakowi süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh asadua hai brenkhui hawmh mih nakowi nauowi kown, now nakowi mih <char style="w">ut uakling</char> paw nauowi kown. Nakowi dow katpaw maru nauowi kown nadowi bowt; chowngchowng saksakma nakowi miapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="JER 50:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40" />Aria aret kowi kowh kua hailawm Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow kowi ang piakah iawng Babulawn kowi paw ang napiakah kown. Nakowi dow miapaw nauowi kown nadowi. Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 50:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41" />“Sünta, tawngphak hownia siphaiuüa uang tarü pathum khowk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:41">prenchur nammowt hownia chenchap akürma mih hai manguüa uang tarü tasen khowk.<verse eid="JER 50:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42" />Amatni dow leba dowkma hai saidawng dowkma kangowh chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">amatni dow kunma ngakma hai saksing sanara uowi dowi mih maru chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Kawrnga hown amatni uang tarü khe sata tui talowng mih tün iawng atün nowk rumrum khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Aw Babulawn chama, nauang sen en kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">amatni dow tasen tawnguat hown uang tarü khowk chekhai.<verse eid="JER 50:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43" />Babulawn mang dow ransu-uüa uang mih satang tata hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:43">kram lai bowt kowh bawng auaklakma phaw khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">Aia dow penchow kimuowi mu rau phaw mih masiuüa iawng lainowmma kawm khai.<verse eid="JER 50:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44" />“Jawrdan aw ria kowi kowh kaurawng hownia krangsi uang lawt hanow pram dawng kowi krawi mak chak khe kowh iawng Babulawnuüa kowi amatni kowh pren hownia amaisang ang nakrawiah kown. Now amatni kowi dow ang ruiah mih maru krüa kowi ang natowah kown. Mia chow ang hown tale? Mia chow nowng kingküa ang? Mia iawng mih kruitown mih paw nowng kingküa ang dowi chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="JER 50:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45" />Naiawng rakowi Babulawn vüi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG sangkrangra sünta diah. Amatni kowh chauüa kowi dow kür hown ransu-uüa nacham küngla kown, now amatni kowh pren dow asaima aia napiakta pe kown. <verse eid="JER 50:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46" />Babulawn piak mih klow hown dow palusama nachür kown. Amatni kowh kar klow dow chenchapuüa mih nata kown.<verse eid="JER 50:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51" />
  <para style="s">Babulawn piak mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">“Sünta, Babulawnuüa hai Babulawn kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi napiakah kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:1">li iawng akürma mih siphaiuüa kowi ang nauang chin pe kown.<verse eid="JER 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2" />Babulawn kowi mih chapli kowi li rownla iawng napawla kownkow prenlang siphaiuüa kowi ang nauang chin pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">aia kowh maru-uüa kowi napiakta pe kownkow prenlang siphaiuüa kowi ang nauang chin pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">Aia kowi dow bowkbowk hownia nauang senah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">now aia dow akhaw aklaima ransu-uüa nata towla hüah kown.<verse eid="JER 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3" />Babulawn siphaiuüa ka khup tasen tawnguat dowi rawn uang büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">amatni ka uüi leba dowi rawn uang senah büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">Amatni kowh tasen lang kiak mih siphaiuüa kowi khowm hangkow pe plaiah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">amatni kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi asaima saita pe diah.<verse eid="JER 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4" />Amatni kowh uak dow Babulawnuüa pren kowi natakuakla pan kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:4">amatni dow ka arau kowh tiama towng kowi kowng mih natakuakla pan kown.<verse eid="JER 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5" />Israel hai Juda pren mih mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG nuata dowi tak.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:5">Amatni kowh pren dow Israel kowh chimsaima mih kowi kingküala mih angak tek khai bowt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">nachenganchepaw kawmat pat aia dow amatni kowh Thurai chowreng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6" />“Judauüa hai Israeluüa low, Babulawn hownia alenma powt büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">enni kowh sak naplaila kownkow iowm büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">Aia kowh angak rakowi hang tawi piak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">CHAKRAMANG nasat klai kown mih khin uang ting khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">Aia kowh kakbak dow aia kowi CHAKRAMANG napeah kown.<verse eid="JER 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7" />Babulawn dow CHAKRAMANG rut kowi kowh kuh bia iawng chowdiah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">aia dow palusama maru kowi pe puaah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">Chenchapuüa mih aia kowh grep tui tawi kham khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">Naiawng rakowi amatni dow kawmat thu khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8" />Babulawn dow mingmang dowi khe dowh kowh teu khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">aia vüi kar büah nguk büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">Aia kowh arau iung müa uang pawla pe chakhang büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">aia kowh arau naiung chepaw naia.<verse eid="JER 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9" />Prenlang maru-uüa tek mih, ‘Babulawn naiungla kownkow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">anging khowngah khowk chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">Tawkche aia mih ia iung dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">Chu, aia kowi towla hüah now chowlowkkow pren kowi i mangta pe bowt lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh ripra dow kuangchan kowi tawk khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">Nami ripra dow kraing lai bowt kowh nowng khaiah dowi bowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10" />Judauüa hai Israeluüa tek mih, ‘A-i dow CHAKRAMANG matia kowh maru chekhai pami aia tüngah khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:10">Naiawng rakowi chu, a-i kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai changah mih lup lawnguan Zaiawn kowi i kowtek diah sik,’ pabüah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11" />CHAKRAMANG mih Babulawnuüa kowi nasenah kownkow Media mang kowi kowkrowkah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kamrütra dow Babulawn kowi napiakta kown mih chekhai. Aia kowh chup kim piakta mih rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih Babulawnuüa kowi nasat pe aklai ngengche kown. Babulawn kowi uang senah mih siphai aluchow tek pe siphaiuüa mih, “Enni kowh leba sek sükah büa diah, now pawla kawngma büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12" />Babulawn kowi nasenah kownkow ruang tamkhuown lowk diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">kangchawng miuüa kowi akhawtma changah küng diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">Tow kangchawng mih diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">siphaiuüa kowi tapetra kowi towah diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">CHAKRAMANG mih aia tekta iawng Babulawnuüa kowi changah khai.<verse eid="JER 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13" />Aw Babulawn, en dow tui huma mih ria kowi en uowi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">now en kowh dow dawngthawnguan ahuma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">Nachenganchepaw en kowh chur khin uang ting khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">en kowh piak khin uang ting khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG dow aia ming hown takham se tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:14">“Babulawn pren kowi dow plawng hawmh iawng ransu akawmma ang nauang pawla en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:14">now naiawngün maru kawm dow awng mih klow atünma natüng büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi kiowah mih meng</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15" />CHAKRAMANG dow aiamat kür hown lusa mih thawpah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">aia kowh chanlaira hown lusa mih aia thawpah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">now aia kowh prengia hown mukuang mih aia thawpah khai.<verse eid="JER 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16" />Aia kowh ana hown mukuang kowi dow tui tün nowk rumrum reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">aia dow prenchur nammowt hownia uangnim kowi uang pawla reng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Aia dow uang nauangla kownkow pla kowi pe nowiah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">now aia dow li krümra hownia li kowi uang lawtla reng.<verse eid="JER 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17" />Maru maten bualama hai chanlaira uowi dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">kuh hown kowh uanthawp sarauüa dow amatni thawpah mih arup rakowi ka rukrai khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni thawpah mih arup dow aiua chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">now asak paw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="JER 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18" />Naiawngün arup dow asung uowi dowi hai khare nichak müa uanh chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:18">tara chetra khin khe naiawngün dow napiak bowk kown.<verse eid="JER 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19" />Nachenganchepaw Jakawb kowh Thurai dow naiawngün arup iawng nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">aia dow lowra uanh thawp miia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">Now Israeluüa dow aiamat kowh amülüng mih dawngthawnguan chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">aia kowh ming dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="JER 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babulawn kowi rip chamang CHAKRAMANG ripah mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Babulawn, en dow ang kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">pren hai chenchapuüa kowi en hown ang piakah khai.<verse eid="JER 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21" />En hown kawrnga hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa kowi ang piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:21">en hown kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kari te miuüa kowi ang piakah khai.<verse eid="JER 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22" />En hown masiuüa hai kachakuüa kowi ang piakah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">en hown lawngtanguüa hai ngeuüa kowi ang piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">now en hown malauüa hai klanguüa kowi ang piakah khai.<verse eid="JER 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23" />En hown ruapur thing miuüa hai ruapur hawmh kowi ang piakah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">en hown laithawn miuüa hai chiala hawm kowi ang piakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">now en hown pren kruitown miuüa hai mang kowh maru iukuüa kowi ang piakah khai.<verse eid="JER 51:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24" />“Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow Zaiawn kowi kowh en changah mih klai ang nasat en kown. Babulawn hai Babulawn kowi kowh uowi miuüa maten kowi ang maru-uüa pur kowi ang naripah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 51:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Babulawn, en dow palusama kowi krawi piak mih hungh iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow ang nakingküa en kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">Ang kowh rut parah hanow hungh hownia ang nalün en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">now akamnama mih hungh iawng ang nachang en kown.<verse eid="JER 51:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26" />En pren kowi kowh hua dow nachangla kim kownkow lowkchow khowm maru natawngah kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:26">en dow chowngchowng saksakma akhaw aklaima nauowi bowt kown.<verse eid="JER 51:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27" />“Nadowk tasen kown mih amat müa ruang tamkhuown büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">now tum baw büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Babulawn kowi nasenah kownkow chenchapuüa kowi pe kamrütah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">aia kowi nauang tawi sen kownkow Ararat, Minni hai Askenaz prenchak kowi hawla büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Aia kowi nakowsen kownkow rui siphai aluchow lowk ia diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">now plawng hawmh iawng ahuma pawla kawrnga büa diah.<verse eid="JER 51:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28" />Aia kowi nakowsen kownkow chenchapuüa kowi pe kamrütah diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">Mediauüa kowh manguüa kowi hai amatni kowh pren kruitown miuüa kowi pe kamrütah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">now mang kowh maru iukuüa hai amatni krüa kowi kowh uowi mih pren maten kowi paw pe kamrütah diah.<verse eid="JER 51:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29" />Babulawn pren dow rau lai bowt kowh chür prang towbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:29">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow Babulawn kowi akhaw aklaima hai apiaknama nachangah kown mih kamrüt khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">now aia dow nami aia kamrütta mih iawng Babulawn kowi chang pe khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 51:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30" />Babulawn kowh tasen mih siphaiuüa dow taingta tasen khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">amatni dow amatni kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi uowi hüah khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Amatni kowh dow kür khowk khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">amatni dow masiuüa iawng auaklakma phaw khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Amatni kowh uowi rah dow towkta pe khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">Babulawn kowh tapplawt klia maten dow piakta pe khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 51:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31" />Satang phowng miuüa dow alowk kung kowi alowk Babulawn mang kowi uang phowng pe satang khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:31">Aia kowh marow ransu-uüa powngta pe mih satang dow aia kowi maru uang phowng pe khai.<verse eid="JER 51:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32" />Aw kowi kowh khawk hown nowng pownah mih arah ransu-uüa powngta pe khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:32">now uaklung taw dow towkta pe khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:32">Naiawng rakowi Babulawn siphaiuüa dow lainowmma kram khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 51:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33" />Ang mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">Babulawn dow te kowi küaah mih luprak iawng phaw khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:33">ngen luprak mih iawng aia kowi nangenah kown mih khin uang ting khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 51:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34" />Jerusalem maru-uüa tek mih, “Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar iawnta anging khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">aia dow dita anging nak khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">now tuikawng khaw iawng tow anging khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Aia dow rua mang iawng iawnta anging khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">anging kowh uanh iung maten dow aia pawta anging khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">now anging pren hownia aia kuakta anging khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 51:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35" />Zaiawn kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow maiawng pacham tek lah:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">“Anging kowi kowh chang anging nowng mih iawng Babulawnuüa kowi paw changah nowng büah dit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">Sai anging mih iawng Babulawnuüa kowi paw saiah büah dit,” pahai pacham tek lah.<verse eid="JER 51:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babulawn kowi CHAKRAMANG sat pe klai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Aw Jerusalem, ang natawi tangila en kown taih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">now en vüi ang nasat pe klai kown taih.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">Babulawn kowh sata mih ang nakangta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">now aia kowh tui lawtra maten paw ang nakangta pe kown.<verse eid="JER 51:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37" />Babulawn dow apiaknama naphaw kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">aia dow nachowng brenkhui hawmh uowi rah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">now maru prawngren müa nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">Nakowi dow miapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">aia piak krang dow khi hanow maru naawda kown.<verse eid="JER 51:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38" />“Aia kowh maru-uüa maten dow krangsi iawng nahek kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:38">now krangsi chah iawng nalai büah kown.<verse eid="JER 51:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39" />Amatni chak sakkrai nowm nowm khe dow ang nakamrüt pe pawi lowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">amatni naia piawla kownkow amatni kowi dow ang nape puaah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:39">Nami kung kowi dow katpaw thowr dowi bowt pat achowngma vüi ang nape müiah kown.<verse eid="JER 51:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40" />Amatni kowi dow ngenra prakowi ruapur, ruapur chah hai rua kowi iawng ang napawla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:40">now nakowi dow tawncher ngen iawng amatni kowi ang nangenah kown.<verse eid="JER 51:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41" />“Babulawn kowi dow palusama kiowah chowdiah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:41">Nachenganchepaw aia dow tim khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:41">Aia kowh piak krang khi hanow chenchapuüa mih lainowmma naawda kown.<verse eid="JER 51:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42" />Babulawn luk kowi dow sata tuilowng iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:42">ransu-uüa nauang taluk khup kown.<verse eid="JER 51:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43" />Aia kowh marow ün dow napiak bowk kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">naiawngün marow dow akang khawngma mih süngrüp süngkangma pren iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">Nakowi dow miapaw nauowi kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">now nami pren iawng dow miapaw namang nakat kown nadowi.<verse eid="JER 51:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44" />Babulawn kowi kowh Bel thurai kowi dow ang naripah kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">aia kowi dow aia iawnah mih maten ang nape hükah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">Aia tut-e dow tui hawr iualua mih iawng chenchapuüa nakowkowi kown nadowi bowt.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">Aia kowh tap paw natakhue bowt kown.<verse eid="JER 51:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cham takhang miuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG hawah mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45" />“Aw ang maru-uüa, Babulawn pren hownia uang lawt büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">enni matia sak naplaila kownkow uang powt büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:45">CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmarau lün pluplup mih hownia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">naplaila kownkow alenma powt büa diah.<verse eid="JER 51:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46" />Babulawn pren kowi anowm nadowi mih satang enni ta khe hangkow kram büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">now hangkow sak nen büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">Pren kowi dow paning kowh paning anowm nadowi mih satang nakrawi tauet kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">tawngbak khe dow Babulawn kowi kowh nowng chang powng changra satang enni nata kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">now mami mang hown paimi mang tasen mih satang enni nata kown.<verse eid="JER 51:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47" />Babulawn kowi kowh arup aren kowi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">ang naripah kown mih khin nauang ting ngengche kown chowbowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">Aia kowh pren paprenma narukrai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">aia kowh kowng mih maru-uüa maten dow tiama kowi natakuakla pan kown.<verse eid="JER 51:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48" />Nami kung kowi dow mukuang hai lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maten Babulawn piak mih lawnguan ta hanow piaw kowh nahow kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawngphak hownia aia kowi napiakah kown mih maru nauang senah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">Ang CHAKRAMANG mami laiklow ang tek khowk.<verse eid="JER 51:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49" />Babulawn rakowi palusama maru kowngla klip mih iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:49">Israeluüa kowi kowngta mih rakowi Babulawnuüa paw nakowng kown.<verse eid="JER 51:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50" />Kowngra hownia enni ia plai miuüa low,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">uang powt büa diah, hangkow kra tham bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">Alakma mih pren kowi enni uowi khe CHAKRAMANG kowi ka tuak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">now Jerusalem lawnguan kowi tuakah büa diah.<verse eid="JER 51:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51" />“Enni tek mih, ‘Maru prawngren anging kowh anging ka rukrai khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">rukrai rakowi anging mumta lumowr khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:51">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi kowh chimsaima mih rah kowi prenlang maru-uüa uang kup khai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="JER 51:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52" />Nachenganchepaw ang tek khowk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:52">Babulawn kowi kowh arup aren kowi ang naripah kown mih khin uang ting khowk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">Nakhowk khe ka arau kowh Babulawn kowi kowh arah maten kowi maru nakarla sawm kown.<verse eid="JER 51:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53" />Kuang dawng kowi pat Babulawn kowting chepaw;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">now kangchawngra kimkrowng khawt chamang khawt changah chepaw,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:53">aia kowi napiakah kown mih maru ang nakowchin pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 51:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asaima pat Babulawn napiak kown mih</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54" />Babulawn hownia kar klow tarua phawnglawng khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">Babulawn pren hownia piak mih klow nowk rumrum khai.<verse eid="JER 51:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG mih Babulawn kowi piakah thüm chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">aia kowh klow kraingma mih dow CHAKRAMANG nataingta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">Ransu-uüa mih tuilowng iawng dow aklow nowk rumrum nauang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">amatni dow atün atünma hekla se Babulawn kowi nauang senah kown.<verse eid="JER 51:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56" />Babulawn kowi nauang senah kownkow krawi piak mih maru-uüa uang khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">amatni dow Babulawn kowh siphaiuüa kowi khümah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">now amatni kowh leba mih klowkta pe büah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow aklai sat mih Thurai chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">aia dow Babulawnuüa kowi amatni krawi chang mih klai sat pe khai.<verse eid="JER 51:56" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57" />Mukuang siphaiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG pami mang tek mih, “Aia kowh maru iukuüa, chanlai miuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">pren kruitown miuüa, akeng mih maru iukuüa hai tasen mih siphaiuüa kowi apuama ang nachangah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">Amatni dow achowngma vüi namüi bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">amatni dow nathowr kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="JER 51:57" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58" />Babulawn kowi kowh tap dow nakheuta hanow krawng hown alik sang ang nachangta pe kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">now aia kowh tapplawt akroma mih dow ang natowkta pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">Maru-uüa kawmah mih dow aiawnglowma nachowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">now chenchapuüa kowh kawm sung dow maih kowi nakam kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="JER 51:58" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babulawn kowi Jeremia krawi phowng pe satang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59" />Juda pren kowi Zedekia chowm mang mih tali ning khe mang Zedekia hown Seraia mih Babulawn pren kowi kowtawi khai. Nakhowk khe Seraia kowi risi Jeremia peah ana ne khai. Seraia dow Neria kowh chapa chekhai, now Neria dow Meseia kowh chapa chekhai. Seraia dow mang kowh hawmlawm bawng chekhai. <verse eid="JER 51:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60" />Babulawn pren luk kowi kowh phih nauang ting kown mih lawnguan maten Jeremia mih charam tua kowi ruiah khai. <verse eid="JER 51:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61" />Seraia kowi Jeremia tek pe mih, “Babulawn pren kowi en kowting khe mami charam tua kowi kowh laiklow maten maru-uüa kowi en naphat pe kown mih kowi pela ching diah. <verse eid="JER 51:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62" />Nami kung kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘Aw CHAKRAMANG, mami arah napiakta kown mih laiklow en tek khai. Nahanow maru hai tawncher mih makowi miapaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Nami arah dow achowngma vüi akhaw aklaima nauowi kown towbowt,’ pape diah. <verse eid="JER 51:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63" />Mami charam tua en ki phat kung kowi dow tap pe huaklu lowk hanow Iufratis aw kowi en nakuakta kown. <verse eid="JER 51:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64" />Nami kung kowi dow en natek kown mih, ‘Babulawn dow mami iawng nanip kown. Aia dow narü kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih nauang pawla pe phih kown chekhai. Aia dow asaima napiak kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:64">Jeremia kowh laiklow dow mami mowr now chur khai bowt.<verse eid="JER 51:64" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem piak mih lawnguan plan tekah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1" />Juda pren kowi Zedekia chowm mang mih dow 21 ning khe chekhai. Aia dow lailowk ning mowr Jerusalem marow kowi chowmla mang khai. A-u dow Libna marowchak Jeremia kowh chama Hamutal chekhai. <verse eid="JER 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2" />Zedekia dow Jehoiakim iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. <verse eid="JER 52:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3" />Jerusalem hai Juda maru-uüa rakowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura dow lün pluplup khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow aia pur hownia amatni kowi prütah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:3">Akung kowi mang Zedekia dow Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar kowi kingküaah khai. <verse eid="JER 52:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4" />Zedekia chowm mang mih taku ning khe kowh hamüt la kowi hamüt ni khe Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar dow aia kowh siphai hawmh maten kowi pawla now Jerusalem marow nakowrumta hüah kownkow tarü khai. Aia dow Jerusalem marow uat kowi krawi khup tangbung khai, now marow riaret kowi dow akroma aia krawi chun pe bawn khai. <verse eid="JER 52:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5" />Zedekia chowm mang mih lailowk ning mowr Jerusalem marow dow rumta hüah khai. <verse eid="JER 52:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6" />Nami ning tali la kowi kowh taku ni mih ni khe Jerusalem marow kowi kowh khown dow uang hu ngamlam khai. Naiawng rakowi marowchakuüa kowh dow chakkham hing uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JER 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7" />Akung kowi Jerusalem marow tap dow takhue parah khai. Nakhowk khe paw Babulawn siphaiuüa dow Jerusalem marow mih rumta hüah reng tak chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Juda siphaiuüa maten dow iak-e khe mang kowh bakan re-e kowh tap pre buk mih tapplawt iawng ku powt hanow Jawrdan lawngrawi prakowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="JER 52:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8" />Mang Zedekia kowh siphai hawmh maten dow aia hown taprai hanow taset plawt khai. Nami khin khe Babulawnuüa kowh siphai hawmh dow mang Zedekia kung kowi kawikrawi khai, now aia kowi dow Jeriko dowm kowi krawi ka khümta khai. <verse eid="JER 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9" />Now amatni dow aia kowi Ribla marow kowi Babulawn mang tut-e kowpawla khai. Nakowi dow Babulawn mang mih aia kowi naripah kownkow siphai hawmh kowi peah ana khai. <verse eid="JER 52:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10" />Siphaiuüa dow Ribla marow kowi mang Zedekia pur kowi achapauüa kowi saiah khai, now Juda pren kowi kowh maru iukuüa maten kowi paw saita khai. <verse eid="JER 52:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11" />Nami kung kowi dow aia kowh mik pre buk trui laita pe khai, now aia kowi dow kri leng hown tawmla hanow Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. Aia kowi dow kowng dowi mowr thawng kowi Babulawn mang towah khai.<verse eid="JER 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim piak mih lawnguan plan tekah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12" />Babulawn pren kowi Nebuknezar chowm mang mih laitaku ning khe tanga la kowi kowh ranit ni khe mang chawng mih aluchow Nebuzardan dow Jerusalem marow kowi uang khai. <verse eid="JER 52:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13" />Now Nebuzardan dow CHAKRAMANG kim, mang kim hai Jerusalem marow kowi kowh kim maten krawi towkta khai. Nami klen kowi marow kowi kowh akri akrima mih kim maten paw aia krawi towkta bowk khai. <verse eid="JER 52:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14" />Nebuzardan nimkrüa kowi kowh uowi mih Babulawn siphai hawmh maten dow Jerusalem marow tap mih khueta khai. <verse eid="JER 52:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15" />Now marow kowi kowh ta uowi miuüa, uanthawp sarauüa hai Babulawn mang prakowi tawi tangi miuüa maten kowi dow mang chawng mih Nebuzardan khümla khai. <verse eid="JER 52:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16" />Nachenganchepaw Juda pren kowi kowh grep krum natamingkhet kownkow hai nata chang laih nata chang üa kownkow ngaraima miuüa kowi dow pren kowi aia ta towla ne khai. <verse eid="JER 52:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17" />Now Babulawn siphaiuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh kri hown kowh thawpah mih kimchüng pre buk, kri hown kowh bia chowm müa hai tui nungra kri hown kowh bia iukma mih ün theuta naknak khai. Now naiawngün uanh dow Babulawn pren kowi pawla büah khai. <verse eid="JER 52:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18" />Nami klen kowi amatni dow puh, plawi kuak müa uaibak, maibu kowi kowh bawthi kep müa kaingkep hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh tawngah kengah mih kri uanh maten pawla büah bowk khai. <verse eid="JER 52:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19" />Aia dow bia, mairing towk müa puh, biatum, maibu towng, uaibak, hüngah mih uanap chang müa puh ün Nebuzardan pawla bowk khai. Now aia dow kuh hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih akeng mih uanh maten paw pawla bowk khai. <verse eid="JER 52:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20" />Mang Sawlawmawn mih CHAKRAMANG kim vüi kimchüng pre buk, tui nungra kri hown kowh bia iukma mih hai nami bia dak kowi kowh kri hown kowh thawpah mih chiala laipre buk hai akeng mih chowm müa ün kri hown thawpah khai. Naiawngün kowi kowh kri maten dow di lai bowt kowh nowng khaiah dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="JER 52:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21" />Naiawngün kimchüng dow pachüng kowi aklang lairaiat muk chi chekhai, now naiawngün kimchüng buk iuk dow laipre muk chi chekhai. Nami kimchüng tat dow apawk chi chekhai, now alak dow akhawngrawngma chekhai. <verse eid="JER 52:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22" />Nami kimchüng lu dow aklang tanga muk chi chekhai. Nami lu kowi dow kri leng tapat lut chekhai, now kri hown kowh dalim uih hown tawngah khai. <verse eid="JER 52:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23" />Kri leng tapat lut dalim uih uowi mih dow 100 klüng chekhai. Tawkche adak hownia khi mih dow 96 klüng taih chekhai.<verse eid="JER 52:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babulawn kowi cham takhang mih lawnguan plan tekah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24" />Now mang chawng mih aluchow Nebuzardan dow Judauüa kowh uamow lang kri mih Seraia, akhowng mih uamow Zefania<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zefania </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dow Zefania bowih rui miia nadowi chekhai.</char></note> hai Thurai chup kim kangchawng mih sum ia kowi khümla khai. <verse eid="JER 52:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25" />Now Jerusalem marow kowi kowh ta tapet miuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh tasen miuüa luk kowi towah mih aluchow hai mang kowh prengia pek mih ranit ia kowi aia khümla khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow hawt paw siphai sar reng mih cha rui mih siphai aluchow kowi khümla khai, now marow kowi kowh krawi ta ka khümah mih maru 60 ia kowi paw pawla khai. <verse eid="JER 52:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26" />Naiawngün khümla mih maru-uüa maten kowi dow Nebuzardan mih Ribla marow kowi Babulawn mang tut-e kowpawla khai. <verse eid="JER 52:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27" />Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow Babulawn pren mang mih Hamat pren kowi kowh Ribla marow kowi saita bowk khai. Naiawng hai Judauüa kowi dow khümla now amatni pren hownia alakma kowi cham pawla khai. <verse eid="JER 52:27" /><verse number="28-30" style="v" sid="JER 52:28-30" />Nebuknezar khümla mih Judauüa maru iun dow maiawng: aia chowm mang mih ranit ning khe aia uang khümla mih maru iun dow 3,023 ia chekhai. Nami klen kowi aia chowm mang mih lairiat ning khe Jerusalem hownia aia uang khümla mih maru iun dow 832 ia chekhai. Now aia chowm mang mih 23 ning khe mang chawng miuüa kowh aluchow Nebuzardan uang khümla mih maru iun dow 745 ia chekhai. Babulawnuüa khümla mih Judauüa maru iun dow bowk kowi 4,600 ia chekhai.<verse eid="JER 52:28-30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoiakin kowi thawngrum hownia lawtta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31" />Juda pren mang Jehoiakin kla thawng mih 37 ning khe Evil-Merodak dow Babulawn pren kowi chowm mang khai. Nami ning laipre la kowi kowh lacher 27 ni khe aia dow sanaah kowh Jehoiakin kowi thawngrum hownia lawtta khai. <verse eid="JER 52:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32" />Aia dow Jehoiakin kowi klangiungma klowpah klangah khai. Aia dow Babulawn pren kowi Jehoiakin hown tawi takhang mih akeng mih manguüa kowi lak-e Jehoiakin kowi lang towah asung khai. Aia dow Jehoiakin kowi ringkawma mih chowm rah kowi pe chowmah khai. <verse eid="JER 52:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33" />Evil-Merodak dow Jehoiakin kowi thawngrum hownia kowh tawnguat pe klüpta hanow pe khupah tawnguat sar khai. Nami hownia bowt now Jehoiakin dow sing uowi mowr atungma mang hown tawi taiua cha chakkham khai. <verse eid="JER 52:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34" />Aia sing uowi mowr dow mang mih aia kowi ni towng kowh charek peah reng chekhai.<verse eid="JER 52:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52" />
</usx>